<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="LEV" style="id">RRK03.SFM Runyankore-Rukiga Bible Version 1964 lasted edited 06.07.2022</book>
  <para style="h">ABALEEVI</para>
  <para style="toc1">Ekitabo Kya Musa Ekya Kashatu Ekirikwetwa Abaleevi</para>
  <para style="toc2">Abaleevi</para>
  <para style="toc3">Lev</para>
  <para style="mt2">EKITABO KYA MUSA EKYA KASHATU EKIRIKWETWA</para>
  <para style="mt1">ABALEEVI</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="LEV 1" />
  <para style="s1">Ebitambo by'okwotsya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LEV 1:1" />MUKAMA akeeta Musa, yaagambira nawe omu Ihema ry'okubugaabuganiramu, naagira ati: <verse eid="LEV 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LEV 1:2" />Gambira Abaisraeli, obagire oti: Omuntu weena omuriimwe ku ariba naareetera MUKAMA ekitambo, muryaguma muhongye ekirugire omu masyo g'ente nari ag'entaama.<verse eid="LEV 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LEV 1:3" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:3: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 12:5">Kur 12:5</ref>; <ref loc="MAL 1:14">Mal 1:14</ref>; <ref loc="HEB 9:14">Heb 9:14</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ekitambo kye ku arikiiha omu busyo bw'ente, ahongye enimi y'ekimasha etaine kamogo, agiheere aha muryango gw'Eihema ry'okubugaabuganiramu, abone kwikirizibwa omu maisho ga MUKAMA. <verse eid="LEV 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LEV 1:4" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 53:4">Isa 53:4</ref>; <ref loc="2CO 5:21">2 Kor 5:21</ref>; <ref loc="ROM 12:1">Rom 12:1</ref>. </char></note> Ate engaro ze aha mutwe gw'ekitambo ky'okwotsya, kiikirizibwe ahabwe okumurihiirira. <verse eid="LEV 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LEV 1:5" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 10:11">Heb 10:11</ref>; <ref loc="1PE 1:2">1 Pet 1:2</ref>. </char></note> Aitire egyo nimi omu maisho ga MUKAMA, batabani ba Arooni abanyamurwa bareete eshagama yaayo, bagishukyere eitambiro eriri aha muryango gw'Eihema ry'okubugaabuganiramu embaju zoona. <verse eid="LEV 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LEV 1:6" />Abaagye ekyo kitambo ky'okwotsya, akicwagure nk'oku emyanya yaakyo eri. <verse eid="LEV 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LEV 1:7" />Bwanyima batabani ba Arooni omunyamurwa bate omuriro aha itambiro, baguteekyereho enku, <verse eid="LEV 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LEV 1:8" />bate ebyo bicweka n'omutwe n'ebishaju aha nku eziri aha muriro aha itambiro, nibabikuratanisa gye; <verse eid="LEV 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LEV 1:9" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:9: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CO 2:15">2 Kor 2:15</ref>; <ref loc="EPH 5:2">Efe 5:2</ref>. </char></note> kwonka eby'omunda byakyo n'amaguru gaakyo babyozye n'amaizi; kandi omunyamurwa abyokyeze kimwe aha itambiro, kuba ekitambo ekyokize, empongano eyokiibwe omu muriro ey'ekisooroora kirungi, ehongyeirwe MUKAMA.<verse eid="LEV 1:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LEV 1:10" />Ekitambo kye eky'okwotsya ku kiriba nikiruga omu busyo bw'entaama nari obw'embuzi, atambe empaya etaine kamogo. <verse eid="LEV 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LEV 1:11" />Agiitire omu maisho ga MUKAMA aha rubaju rw'eitambiro orurikureeba obukiizi-bwa-bumosho; batabani ba Arooni abanyamurwa bashukyere eitambiro eshagama yaayo embaju zoona; <verse eid="LEV 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LEV 1:12" />agicwagacwagure nk'oku emyanya yaayo eri n'omutwe gwayo n'ebishaju byayo, omunyamurwa abite aha nku eziri aha muriro gw'aha itambiro, naabikuratanisa gye; <verse eid="LEV 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LEV 1:13" />kwonka eby'omunda byayo n'amaguru gaayo abyozye n'amaizi, abitambe byona, abyokyeze aha itambiro; ekyo n'ekitambo ekyokize, empongano eyokiibwe omu muriro ey'ekisooroora kirungi ehongyeirwe MUKAMA. <verse eid="LEV 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LEV 1:14" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:14: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 2:24">Luk 2:24</ref>. </char></note> Kandi ekitambo kye eky'okwotsya ku kiriba kiri enyonyi, areete ekitambo ky'obwiba nari enkombe nto. <verse eid="LEV 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LEV 1:15" />Omunyamurwa agireete aha itambiro, agihotore ebitsya, agicweho omutwe, agyokyeze aha itambiro; eshagama yaayo egikamuukyemu neejwera aha rubaju rw'eitambiro; <verse eid="LEV 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LEV 1:16" />agiihemu ekitondoro, agihaanyeho ebyoya, abinagye aha rubaju rw'eitambiro orurikureeba oburugwa-izooba, ahu baata eiju ry'akashenda. <verse eid="LEV 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LEV 1:17" />Akwate amapapa gaayo, agitaagure, kwonka atagitaanisamu, agyokyeze aha itambiro aha nku eziri aha muriro; ekyo n'ekitambo ekyokize, empongano eyokiibwe omu muriro ey'ekisooroora kirungi, ehongyeirwe MUKAMA.<verse eid="LEV 1:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LEV 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="LEV 2" />
  <para style="s1">Empongano y'esaano</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LEV 2:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LEV 6:14">Lev 6:14</ref>. </char>
    </note> Omuntu weena ku arihongyera MUKAMA empongano y'esaano, ahongye esaano y'obunono; agishukyeho amajuta g'emizeituuni, agimemeerereho obubaane oburikwetwa lebona; <verse eid="LEV 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LEV 2:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 10:4">Byak 10:4</ref>. </char></note> agireetere batabani ba Arooni abanyamurwa, agiiheho oruhi rw'esaano y'obunono n'amajuta, hamwe n'obubaane bwayo bwona, omunyamurwa abyokyeze aha itambiro kuba ekiijutsyo, empongano eyokiibwe omu muriro y'ekisooroora kirungi ahari MUKAMA. <verse eid="LEV 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LEV 2:3" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 7:9">Lev 7:9</ref>. </char></note> Ekiritsigara ahari egyo mpongano y'esaano kibe ekya Arooni n'abatabani; egyo n'empongano erikwera munonga omu mpongano ezihongyeirwe MUKAMA ezokiibwe omu muriro.<verse eid="LEV 2:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LEV 2:4" />Ku orihonga empongano y'esaano eteekire omu iteekyero ry'emigaati, ebe twakeeki otutatumbisiibwe otw'esaano y'obunono otujwangizemu amajuta, nari capati ezitatumbisiibwe ezisiigirweho amajuta. <verse eid="LEV 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LEV 2:5" />Kandi ku orihonga empongano y'esaano ekarangire, ebe esaano y'obunono etatumbisiibwe, ejwangizemu amajuta. <verse eid="LEV 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LEV 2:6" />Okicwemu ebicweka, obishukyeho amajuta; egyo n'empongano y'esaano. <verse eid="LEV 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LEV 2:7" />Empongano yaawe ku eriba eri ey'esaano ekarangisiibwe amajuta aha kyoma, ebe ey'esaano y'obunono ejwangizemu amajuta. <verse eid="LEV 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LEV 2:8" />Empongano y'esaano ekozirwe omu miringo egyo oryagireetera MUKAMA; ku erireetwa aha munyamurwa, agitware aha itambiro, <verse eid="LEV 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LEV 2:9" />aihe ahari egyo mpongano ekiijutsyo kyayo, akyokyeze aha itambiro kuba empongano eyokiibwe omu muriro y'ekisooroora kirungi ahari MUKAMA. <verse eid="LEV 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LEV 2:10" />Ekiritsigara ahari egyo mpongano y'esaano, kibe ekya Arooni n'abatabani; egyo n'empongano erikwera munonga omu mpongano ezihongyeirwe MUKAMA, ezokiibwe omu muriro.<verse eid="LEV 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LEV 2:11" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2:11: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MRK 8:15">Mak 8:15</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 5:8">1 Kor 5:8</ref>; <ref loc="GAL 5:9">Gal 5:9</ref>. </char>
    </note> Hatarigira empongano y'esaano ei mwahongyera MUKAMA ekozirwe n'ekitumbisa; ahabw'okuba timushemereire kwotsya kitumbisa nari obwoki bwona kuba empongano eyokiibwe omu muriro ehongyeirwe MUKAMA. <verse eid="LEV 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LEV 2:12" />Empongano z'esaano ezirimu ekitumbisa n'obwoki muryazihongyera MUKAMA nk'omuganuro, kwonka zitarihongyerwa aha itambiro kuba empongano y'ekisooroora kirungi. <verse eid="LEV 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LEV 2:13" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:13: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MRK 9:49">Mak 9:49</ref>; <ref loc="COL 4:6">Kol 4:6</ref>. </char></note> Empongano y'esaano yoona oryaguma ogitemu omwonyo, kandi otariikiriza empongano zaawe ez'esaano kuburamu omwonyo gw'endagaano ya Ruhanga waawe; empongano zaawe zoona oryaguma ozihongye n'omwonyo.<verse eid="LEV 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LEV 2:14" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2:14: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LEV 23:10">Lev 23:10</ref>, <ref loc="LEV 23:14">14</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kandi ku orihongyera MUKAMA empongano y'esaano ey'omuganuro, oryareeta obushiisha bw'engano obutarikire aha muriro, ebihere by'engano mbisi, kuba empongano y'esaano ey'omuganuro gwawe; <verse eid="LEV 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LEV 2:15" />ogishukyeho amajuta, kandi ogimemeerereho obubaane bwa lebona; egyo n'empongano y'esaano. <verse eid="LEV 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LEV 2:16" />Omunyamurwa ayotsye akacweka k'ebihere by'engano n'amajuta hamwe n'obwo bubaane bwona kuba ekiijutsyo kyayo; egyo n'empongano ehongyeirwe MUKAMA eyokiibwe omu muriro.<verse eid="LEV 2:16" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LEV 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="LEV 3" />
  <para style="s1">Ebitambo by'okusiima ahabw'obusingye</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LEV 3:1" />Kandi empongano ye ku eriba eri ekitambo ky'okusiima ahabw'obusingye, yaakiiha omu busyo bw'ente yaaba nimi nari enyana, ahongye ekitaine kamogo omu maisho ga MUKAMA, <verse eid="LEV 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LEV 3:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 53:4">Isa 53:4</ref>; <ref loc="2CO 5:21">2 Kor 5:21</ref>; <ref loc="1PE 2:24">1 Pet 2:24</ref>. </char></note> ate engaro ze aha mutwe gw'empongano ye, agiitire aha muryango gw'Eihema ry'okubugaabuganiramu; batabani ba Arooni abanyamurwa bashukyere eitambiro eshagama embaju zoona. <verse eid="LEV 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LEV 3:3" />Aihe ahari ekyo kitambo ky'okusiima ahabw'obusingye empongano eyokiibwe omu muriro ehongyeirwe MUKAMA, ebishaju ebishwekire eby'omunda n'ebishaju byona ebibiriho, <verse eid="LEV 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LEV 3:4" />n'entsigo zombi eziri aha mugongo n'ebishaju byazo, n'ekishaabo ky'aha kitugu, abihongye; <verse eid="LEV 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LEV 3:5" />batabani ba Arooni bagyokyeze aha itambiro ry'okwokyezaho ebitambo aha nku eziri aha muriro; egyo n'empongano eyokiibwe omu muriro ey'ekisooroora kirungi ahari MUKAMA.<verse eid="LEV 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LEV 3:6" />Empongano ye ey'ekitambo ky'okusiima MUKAMA ahabw'obusingye ku eriba eri ey'omu busyo bw'entaama, yaaba mpaya nari omwagazi, ahongye ekitaine kamogo. <verse eid="LEV 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LEV 3:7" />Ku arihayo omwana gw'entaama kuba empongano ye, aguhongye omu maisho ga MUKAMA; <verse eid="LEV 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LEV 3:8" />kandi ate engaro ze aha mutwe gw'empongano ye, agiitire omu maisho g'Eihema ry'okubugaabuganiramu; batabani ba Arooni bashukyere eitambiro eshagama embaju zoona. <verse eid="LEV 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LEV 3:9" />Aihe ebishaju ahari ekyo kitambo ky'okusiima ahabw'obusingye, ekyokiibwe omu muriro, ekihongyeirwe MUKAMA, n'omukira gwona ogw'ebishaju agukuuriraine n'engugi, n'ebishaju ebishwekire eby'omunda, n'ebishaju byona ebibiriho, <verse eid="LEV 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LEV 3:10" />n'entsigo zombi eziri aha mugongo n'ebishaju byazo, n'ekishaabo eky'aha kitugu akitwarirane n'entsigo; <verse eid="LEV 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LEV 3:11" />omunyamurwa akyokyeze aha itambiro kuba empongano y'eby'okurya eyokiibwe omu muriro ehongyeirwe MUKAMA.<verse eid="LEV 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LEV 3:12" />Empongano ye ku eriba eri ey'embuzi, agihongye omu maisho ga MUKAMA; <verse eid="LEV 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LEV 3:13" />ate engaro ze aha mutwe gwayo, agiitire omu maisho g'Eihema ry'okubugaabuganiramu; batabani ba Arooni bashukyere eitambiro eshagama yaayo embaju zoona; <verse eid="LEV 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LEV 3:14" />aihe ahari ekyo kitambo empongano ye eyokiibwe omu muriro ei ahongyeire MUKAMA, ebishaju ebishwekire eby'omunda, n'ebishaju byona ebibiriho, <verse eid="LEV 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LEV 3:15" />n'entsigo zombi eziri aha mugongo n'ebishaju ebiziriho, n'ekishaabo eky'aha kitugu akitwarirane n'entsigo. <verse eid="LEV 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LEV 3:16" />Omunyamurwa abyokyeze aha itambiro; n'eby'okurya by'empongano eyokiibwe omu muriro eby'ekisooroora kirungi; ebishaju byona n'ebya MUKAMA. <verse eid="LEV 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LEV 3:17" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:17: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 14:22">1 Sam 14:22</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 44:7">Ezk 44:7</ref>, <ref loc="EZK 44:15">15</ref>. </char></note> Kiryaba ekiragiro ekitarihwaho omu busingye bwanyu bwona n'omu maka gaanyu goona, imwe okutarya bishaju nari eshagama.<verse eid="LEV 3:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LEV 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="LEV 4" />
  <para style="s1">Empongano y'ekibi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LEV 4:1" />MUKAMA yaagambira Musa ati: <verse eid="LEV 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LEV 4:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 14:27">1 Sam 14:27</ref>. </char></note> Gambira Abaisraeli oti: Omuntu ku arikora ekibi atakikozire nkana, yaakora kimwe aha bi MUKAMA yaazibiire, <verse eid="LEV 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LEV 4:3" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 5:3">Heb 5:3</ref>. </char></note> ku ariba ari omunyamurwa owaashukirweho amajuta okozire ekibi ekyo, akareetera eihanga ryona orubanja, ahongyerere ekibi eki akozire enimi y'ekimasha etaine kamogo, agihongyere MUKAMA kuba empongano y'ekibi. <verse eid="LEV 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LEV 4:4" />Areete egyo nimi aha muryango gw'Eihema ry'okubugaabuganiramu omu maisho ga MUKAMA, ate engaro ze aha mutwe gwayo, agiitire omu maisho ga MUKAMA. <verse eid="LEV 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LEV 4:5" />Omunyamurwa owaashukirweho amajuta atware aha shagama yaayo, agireete omu Ihema ry'okubugaabuganiramu, <verse eid="LEV 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LEV 4:6" />akoze orukumu omuri egyo shagama, agimiisiire emirundi mushanju omu maisho ga MUKAMA omu maisho g'omukingo ogukingiire Omwanya ogurikwera munonga; <verse eid="LEV 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LEV 4:7" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:7: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 16:18">Lev 16:18</ref>. </char></note> kandi atware ahari egyo shagama, agite aha mahembe g'ekyoterero ky'obubaane oburikutaamirana omu maisho ga MUKAMA ekiri omu Ihema ry'okubugaabuganiramu; kandi eshagama y'egyo nimi y'ekimasha eyaatsigaraho yoona agishukye ahansi aha kibunu ky'eitambiro ry'okwokyezaho ebitambo, eriri aha muryango gw'Eihema ry'okubugaabuganiramu. <verse eid="LEV 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LEV 4:8" />Kandi ebishaju byona by'egyo nimi ey'empongano y'ekibi abiiheho, ebishaju ebishwekire eby'omunda n'ebishaju byona ebibiriho, <verse eid="LEV 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LEV 4:9" />n'entsigo zombi eziri aha mugongo n'ebishaju byazo, n'ekishaabo eky'aha kitugu abitwarirane n'ezo ntsigo, <verse eid="LEV 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LEV 4:10" />nk'oku babiiha aha nimi y'ekitambo ky'okusiima ahabw'obusingye; omunyamurwa abyokyeze aha itambiro ry'okwokyezaho ebitambo. <verse eid="LEV 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LEV 4:11" />Kwonka oruhu rwayo n'enyama zaayo zoona n'omutwe gwayo n'amaguru gaayo n'eby'omunda byayo n'efa yaayo, <verse eid="LEV 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LEV 4:12" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:12: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 13:11">Heb 13:11</ref>. </char></note> eby'egyo nimi yoona abitware aheeru y'orusiisira omu mwanya murungi, ahu baata eiju ry'akashenda, abite aha nku, abyotsye; aho ahu baata eiju, bibe niho byayokyezibwa.<verse eid="LEV 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LEV 4:13" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4:13: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="NUM 15:24">Kub 15:24</ref>; <ref loc="JOS 7:11">Yos 7:11</ref>. </char>
    </note> Eihanga ryona ery'Abaisraeli ku ririba niryo rikozire ekibi aha bi MUKAMA yaazibiire, ritakikozire nkana, haza kyasherekwa omutwe gw'abantu abateeraine, eihanga ryagiibwaho orubanja, <verse eid="LEV 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LEV 4:14" />bwanyima ekibi eki bakozire kyamanywa, eihanga ryona rihongye enimi y'ekimasha kuba empongano y'ekibi, bagireete omu maisho g'Eihema ry'okubugaabuganiramu. <verse eid="LEV 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LEV 4:15" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:15: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 53:6">Isa 53:6</ref>. </char></note> Abakuru b'eihanga bate engaro zaabo aha mutwe gw'egyo nimi omu maisho ga MUKAMA, kandi eitirwe omu maisho ge; <verse eid="LEV 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LEV 4:16" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:16: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 9:12-14">Heb 9:12-14</ref>. </char></note> omunyamurwa owaashukirweho amajuta areete aha shagama y'egyo nimi omu Ihema ry'okubugaabuganiramu, <verse eid="LEV 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LEV 4:17" />agikozemu orukumu, agimiisiire emirundi mushanju omu maisho ga MUKAMA omu maisho g'ogwo mukingo; <verse eid="LEV 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LEV 4:18" />kandi atware ahari egyo shagama, agite aha mahembe g'ekyoterero, ekiri omu maisho ga MUKAMA omu Ihema ry'okubugaabuganiramu; kandi eshagama y'egyo nimi eyaatsigaraho yoona agishukye ahansi aha kibunu ky'eitambiro ery'okwokyezaho ebitambo, eriri aha muryango gw'eihema ry'okubugaabuganiramu; <verse eid="LEV 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LEV 4:19" />kandi ebishaju byayo byona abiiheho, abyokyeze aha itambiro. <verse eid="LEV 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LEV 4:20" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:20: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 2:17">Heb 2:17</ref>; <ref loc="1JN 1:7">1 Yoh 1:7</ref>; <ref loc="1JN 2:2">2:2</ref>. </char></note> Okwo abe nikwo yaatwaza egyo nimi; nk'oku atwarize enimi y'empongano y'ekibi, abe nikwo yaatwaza n'egi; omunyamurwa ahongye atyo eky'okubarihiirira, nabo baryasaasirwa. <verse eid="LEV 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LEV 4:21" />Bwanyima atware egyo nimi aheeru y'orusiisira, agyotsye nk'oku ayokize ey'okubanza; egyo n'empongano y'ekibi ehongirwe ahabw'eihanga ryona.<verse eid="LEV 4:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LEV 4:22" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4:22: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="NUM 16:2">Kub 16:2</ref>; <ref loc="EZR 9:2">Ezr 9:2</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kandi omutegyeki ku arikora ekibi aha bi MUKAMA Ruhanga we yaazibiire, atakikozire nkana, yaagiibwaho orubanja, <verse eid="LEV 4:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LEV 4:23" />bwanyima yaamanyisibwa ekibi eki akozire, areete empaya y'embuzi etaine kamogo, agihongye, <verse eid="LEV 4:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LEV 4:24" />ate engaro ze aha mutwe gw'egyo mbuzi, agiitire omu maisho ga MUKAMA ahu baitira ebitambo by'okwotsya; egyo n'empongano y'ekibi. <verse eid="LEV 4:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LEV 4:25" />Bwanyima omunyamurwa atware aha shagama y'egyo mpongano y'ekibi aha rukumu rwe, agite aha mahembe g'eitambiro ry'okwokyezaho ebitambo, endiijo shagama yoona agishukye ahansi aha kibunu ky'eryo itambiro. <verse eid="LEV 4:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LEV 4:26" />Ebishaju byayo byona abyokyeze aha itambiro, nk'oku bootsya ebishaju by'ebitambo by'okusiima ahabw'obusingye; omunyamurwa amuhongyerere empongano y'okurihiirira ekibi kye, nawe aryasaasirwa.<verse eid="LEV 4:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LEV 4:27" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4:27: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ECC 7:20">Mub 7:20</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kandi omuntu weena ow'omu bantu b'obutoosha ku arikora ekibi aha bi MUKAMA yaazibiire, atakikozire nkana, yaagiibwaho orubanja, <verse eid="LEV 4:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LEV 4:28" />bwanyima yaamanyisibwa ekibi eki akozire, areete omwagazi gw'embuzi ogutaine kamogo, aguhongye ahabw'ekibi eki akozire. <verse eid="LEV 4:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LEV 4:29" />Ate engaro ze aha mutwe gw'egyo mpongano y'ekibi, agiitire ahu baitira ebitambo by'okwotsya. <verse eid="LEV 4:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LEV 4:30" />Omunyamurwa atware aha shagama yaagwo aha rukumu rwe, agite aha mahembe g'eitambiro ery'okwokyezaho ebitambo; endiijo shagama yoona agishukye ahansi aha kibunu ky'eryo itambiro; <verse eid="LEV 4:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LEV 4:31" />kandi ebishaju byagwo byona abiiheho, nk'oku babiiha aha bitambo by'okusiima ahabw'obusingye; omunyamurwa abyokyeze aha itambiro kuba ekisooroora kirungi ahari MUKAMA; omunyamurwa amuhongyerere empongano y'okurihiirira ekibi kye, nawe aryasaasirwa.<verse eid="LEV 4:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LEV 4:32" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4:32: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 53:7">Isa 53:7</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 1:29">Yoh 1:29</ref>; <ref loc="REV 5:6-14">Kush 5:6-14</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kandi ku arireeta omwana gw'entaama kuba empongano y'ekibi, areete omwagazi ogutaine kamogo; <verse eid="LEV 4:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LEV 4:33" />ate engaro ze aha mutwe gw'egyo mpongano y'ekibi, agiitire ahu baitira ebitambo eby'okwotsya kuba empongano y'ekibi. <verse eid="LEV 4:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LEV 4:34" />Omunyamurwa atware aha shagama y'egyo mpongano y'ekibi aha rukumu rwe, agite aha mahembe g'eitambiro ry'okwokyezaho ebitambo; endiijo shagama yaagwo agishukye ahansi aha kibunu ky'eryo itambiro; <verse eid="LEV 4:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LEV 4:35" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:35: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 9:24">Dan 9:24</ref>. </char></note> ebishaju byagwo byona abiiheho, nk'oku babiiha aha mwana gw'entaama gw'ekitambo eky'okusiima ahabw'obusingye; omunyamurwa abyokyeze aha itambiro aha mpongano ezookiibwe omu muriro ahari MUKAMA, amuhongyerere empongano y'okurihiirira ekibi eki akozire; nawe aryasaasirwa.<verse eid="LEV 4:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LEV 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="LEV 5" />
  <para style="s1">Empongano z'eby'okushiisha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LEV 5:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">5:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PRO 29:24">Enf 29:24</ref>. </char>
    </note> Omuntu weena ku arirahizibwa, yaakora ekibi ky'okwanga kujurira eki areebire, nari eki arikumanya, aryagiibwaho orubanja rw'okutahikiirira. <verse eid="LEV 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LEV 5:2" />Nari omuntu weena ku arikora aha kintu kyona ekirikuzira, yaaba omutumbi gw'enyamaishwa erikuzira, nari ogw'ekitungirwe ekirikuzira, nari ogw'ekirikugyendesa enda ekirikuzira, atakimanyire, yaasiisikara, aryagiibwaho orubanja. <verse eid="LEV 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LEV 5:3" />Nari ku arikora aha kirikuzira ekirikuruga omu muntu ondiijo eky'omuringo gwona atakimanyire, ku arikimanya, aryagiibwaho orubanja. <verse eid="LEV 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LEV 5:4" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 14:24">1 Sam 14:24</ref>; <ref loc="1SA 25:22">25:22</ref>. </char></note> Nari omuntu ku arirahukwa aha rurimi, yaarahira kukora kubi nari kukora gye kyonakyona eki arirahuka kurahira atakimanyire, ku arikimanya aryagiibwaho orubanja rw'ekyo eki yaarahukire kurahira. <verse eid="LEV 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LEV 5:5" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 26:40">Lev 26:40</ref>; <ref loc="EZR 10:11">Ezr 10:11</ref>. </char></note> Mbwenu omuntu ku arimanya ku aine orubanja rwa kimwe ahari ebyo, ayature ekyo kibi ki akozire, <verse eid="LEV 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LEV 5:6" />areetere MUKAMA omwagazi gw'entaama nari ogw'embuzi ogw'omu busyo kuba empongano ey'okumwihisaho orubanja rw'ekibi eki akozire; omunyamurwa amuhongyerere empongano y'okurihiirira ekibi kye; nawe aryasaasirwa.<verse eid="LEV 5:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LEV 5:7" />Kwonka ku ariba ari omworo otarikubaasa kureeta omwana gw'entaama, areete obwiba bubiri nari enkombe nto ibiri, azihongyere MUKAMA kuba empongano y'okumwihisaho orubanja rw'ekibi eki akozire, emwe ebe empongano ey'ekibi, endiijo ebe empongano ey'okwotsya. <verse eid="LEV 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LEV 5:8" />Azireetere omunyamurwa, nawe abanze kutamba ey'empongano y'ekibi, agihotore ebitsya, agicweho omutwe, kwonka atagibaganisamu habiri; <verse eid="LEV 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LEV 5:9" />atware aha shagama y'egyo mpongano y'ekibi, agimiisiire aha rubaju rw'eitambiro; endiijo shagama yoona egikamuukyemu, neejwera ahansi aha kibunu ky'eitambiro; egyo n'empongano y'ekibi. <verse eid="LEV 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LEV 5:10" />Eya kabiri agihongye kuba empongano y'okwotsya, nk'omugyenzo ogwatairweho oku guri; omunyamurwa amuhongyerere empongano y'okurihiirira ekibi eki akozire, nawe aryasaasirwa.<verse eid="LEV 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LEV 5:11" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">5:11: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="NUM 5:15">Kub 5:15</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kwonka ku ariba ari omworo otarikubaasa kureeta obwiba bubiri nari enkombe nto ibiri, areete ekicweka kimwe kya ikumi kya eefa y'esaano y'obunono kuba empongano y'ekibi ey'okuhongyerera ekibi eki akozire; arekye kugitamu amajuta n'obu kwakuba okugimemeereraho obubaane bwa lebona; ahabw'okuba egyo n'empongano y'ekibi. <verse eid="LEV 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LEV 5:12" />Egyo saano agireetere omunyamurwa, ogwo munyamurwa agiiheho oruhi kuba ekiijutsyo kyayo, agyokyeze aha itambiro ahaiguru y'empongano ehongyeirwe MUKAMA eyokiibwe omu muriro; egyo n'empongano y'ekibi. <verse eid="LEV 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LEV 5:13" />Atyo omunyamurwa amuhongyerere empongano y'okurihiirira ekibi kyona eki akozire omuri ebyo byona, nawe aryasaasirwa. Esaano eritsigaraho ebe ey'omunyamurwa, nk'empongano y'esaano oku etwazibwa. <verse eid="LEV 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LEV 5:14" />MUKAMA yaagambira Musa ati: <verse eid="LEV 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LEV 5:15" />Omuntu ku arishobya ekintu kimwe omu birikwera ebya MUKAMA, yaakora ekibi atakimanyire, areetere MUKAMA empongano y'okumwihisaho orubanja ey'empaya y'entaama ey'omu busyo etaine kamogo, obariirire obuguzi bwayo omu shekeli z'efeeza, nka shekeli ey'Omwanya ogurikwera oku eri, kuba empongano y'okwihaho orubanja; <verse eid="LEV 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LEV 5:16" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:16: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 22:14">Lev 22:14</ref>; <ref loc="NUM 5:7">Kub 5:7</ref>. </char></note> kandi arihe eki asiisire ahari ekyo kintu ekirikwera, akyongyereho ekicweka kimwe kya kataano kyakyo, abihe omunyamurwa; bwanyima omunyamurwa amuhongyerere empongano y'egyo mpaya y'entaama ey'okwihaho orubanja, ebe empongano ey'okumurihiirira; kandi aryasaasirwa.<verse eid="LEV 5:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LEV 5:17" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">5:17: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LUK 12:48">Luk 12:48</ref>; <ref loc="HEB 5:2">Heb 5:2</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kandi omuntu weena ku arishiisha, yaagira eki yaakora omu bi MUKAMA yaazibiire, n'obu ariba atakimanyire, aryaba aine orubanja, kandi okutahikiirira kwe kuryamugumaho. <verse eid="LEV 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LEV 5:18" />Aryaiha omu busyo empaya y'entaama etaine kamogo, nk'oku oribariirira obuguzi bwayo, kuba empongano y'okwihaho orubanja, agireetere omunyamurwa; omunyamurwa amuhongyerere kurihiirira eki ashobize atamanyire, nawe aryasaasirwa. <verse eid="LEV 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LEV 5:19" />Egyo n'empongano ey'okwihaho orubanja; ahakuba buzima naaba aine orubanja omu maisho ga MUKAMA.<verse eid="LEV 5:19" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LEV 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="LEV 6" />
  <para style="s1">Empongano y'ebibi ebikozirwe nkana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LEV 6:1" />MUKAMA yaagambira Musa ati: <verse eid="LEV 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LEV 6:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 5:4">Byak 5:4</ref>; <ref loc="PRO 24:28">Enf 24:28</ref>; <ref loc="PRO 26:19">26:19</ref>. </char></note> Omuntu weena ku arishiisha, yaacumura ahari MUKAMA omu kuryangatanisa ebi mutaahi we amubiikize, nari ebi ayemerereire, nari omu kumunyaga nari omu kumuhata, <verse eid="LEV 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LEV 6:3" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 22:1">Kur 22:1</ref>; <ref loc="JER 7:9">Yer 7:9</ref>, <ref loc="JER 7:10">10</ref>. </char></note> nari okugwa aha kibuzire, akakiryangatanisa naarahira ebishuba, nari ekintu kyona omu bi abantu bakora bakabisiisiramu, biryatwazibwa biti; <verse eid="LEV 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LEV 6:4" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 5:5">Lev 5:5</ref>, <ref loc="LEV 5:6">6</ref>. </char></note> omuntu ku arikikora, yaagiibwaho orubanja, aryariha eki aibire, nari eki anyagiise eishaija, nari eki aryangataniise bamubiikize, nari eki atorotoire kibuzire, <verse eid="LEV 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LEV 6:5" />nari ekintu kyona eki ayehakaine naarahira ebishuba, aryabigarura byona, kandi abyongyereho ekicweka kimwe kya kataano, abihe mukama waabyo aha izooba eri arihongyeraho empongano y'okwihaho orubanja; <verse eid="LEV 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LEV 6:6" />bwanyima areetere omunyamurwa empongano egyo, ei ahongyeire MUKAMA kumwihaho orubanja, empaya y'entaama etaine kamogo, nk'oku oribariirira obuguzi bwayo, kuba empongano y'okumwihaho orubanja; <verse eid="LEV 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LEV 6:7" />omunyamurwa amuhongyerere empongano y'okumurihiirira omu maisho ga MUKAMA; nawe aryasaasirwa eki ariba akozire kyona ekyamureeteire orwo rubanja.<verse eid="LEV 6:7" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ekiragiro ky'empongano z'okwotsya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LEV 6:8" />MUKAMA yaagambira Musa ati: <verse eid="LEV 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LEV 6:9" />Ragiira Arooni n'abatabani oti: Eki nikyo kiragiro ky'ebitambo by'okwotsya. Ekitambo ky'okwotsya kiryaguma kiteebwe aha nku z'aha itambiro, kiraareho okuhitsya omu kasheeshe, kandi omuriro gw'aha itambiro gugume nigwaka. <verse eid="LEV 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LEV 6:10" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:10: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 28:39-43">Kur 28:39-43</ref>. </char></note> Omunyamurwa ajware ekanzu ye ya bafuta, n'empare ye ya kitaani, ayoore eiju ry'ekitambo ekyokize, ekyokiibwe omu muriro aha itambiro, arite aha rubaju rw'eitambiro; <verse eid="LEV 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LEV 6:11" />bwanyima ajuure ebyo bijwaro, ajware ebindi, atware eiju aheeru y'orusiisira, aryate omu mwanya murungi. <verse eid="LEV 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LEV 6:12" />Omuriro gw'aha itambiro guryaguma nigwaka, gutariraara; omunyamurwa agume agutemu enku buri kasheeshe, ariteho gye ekitambo ky'okwotsya, ayotsyeho ebishaju by'empongano z'okusiima ahabw'obusingye. <verse eid="LEV 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LEV 6:13" />Ogwo muriro gugume nigwaka aha itambiro obutoosha, gutariraara.<verse eid="LEV 6:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ekiragiro ky'empongano y'esaano</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LEV 6:14" />Eki nikyo kiragiro ky'empongano y'esaano. Batabani ba Arooni baryaguma bagihongye omu maisho ga MUKAMA omu maisho g'eitambiro. <verse eid="LEV 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LEV 6:15" />Omunyamurwa agiiheho oruhi rw'esaano y'obunono n'amajuta gaayo n'obubaane bwa lebona bwona obugimemeereirweho, abyokyeze aha itambiro kuba ekiijutsyo kyayo ky'ekisooroora kirungi ahari MUKAMA. <verse eid="LEV 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LEV 6:16" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:16: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 18:10">Kub 18:10</ref>. </char></note> Ebiraatsigareho biriibwe Arooni n'abatabani; babiriire omu mwanya gurikwera bitatumbisiibwe; omu kibuga ky'Eihema ry'okubugaabuganiramu babe nimwo baabiriira. <verse eid="LEV 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LEV 6:17" />Bataribiteekyerana n'ekitumbisa; naakibaha kuba omugabo gwabo ogw'empongano ezi mpongyeirwe ezokiibwe omu muriro; n'ebirikwera munonga, nk'empongano y'ekibi n'ey'okwihaho orubanja oku biri. <verse eid="LEV 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LEV 6:18" />Oyetwa omushaija weena omuri beene Arooni akiryeho, nk'omugabo gwe ogurikuruga omu mpongano ezokiibwe omu muriro ezihongyeirwe MUKAMA; kibe ekiragiro ky'ebiro byona omu busingye bwanyu bwona; oribikoraho weena aryaba orikwera.<verse eid="LEV 6:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LEV 6:19" />MUKAMA yaagambira Musa ati: <verse eid="LEV 6:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LEV 6:20" />Egi niyo mpongano ei Arooni n'abatabani barihongyera MUKAMA aha izooba eri arishukirwaho amajuta; ekicweka kimwe kya ikumi ekya eefa y'esaano y'obunono kuba empongano y'esaano obutoosha, ekicweka kyayo kihongwe omu kasheeshe, n'ekindi omu mwabazyo. <verse eid="LEV 6:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LEV 6:21" />Ogiteekyerane n'amajuta aha kyoma ky'okukarangaho; ku eraahikwemu amajuta, ogireete, ogihongye omu bicweka bikarangire kuba empongano y'esaano y'ekisooroora kirungi ehongyeirwe MUKAMA. <verse eid="LEV 6:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LEV 6:22" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:22: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 9:26">Dan 9:26</ref>. </char></note> Kandi omunyamurwa ow'omuri batabani ba Arooni oriba ashukirweho amajuta kumuhungurira, abe niwe yaagihongyera MUKAMA, nk'ekiragiro ky'obutoosha oku kirikuragiira; empongano egyo eyokibwe yoona. <verse eid="LEV 6:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LEV 6:23" />Buri mpongano y'esaano erihongwa omunyamurwa eryayokibwa yoona, teririibwa.<verse eid="LEV 6:23" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ekiragiro ky'empongano y'ekibi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LEV 6:24" />Kandi MUKAMA yaagambira Musa ati: <verse eid="LEV 6:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LEV 6:25" />Gambira Arooni n'abatabani oti: Eki nikyo kiragiro ky'empongano y'ekibi. Omwanya ogu baitiramu ekitambo ky'okwotsya babe niho baaguma nibaitira n'empongano y'ekibi omu maisho ga MUKAMA; egyo n'empongano erikwera munonga. <verse eid="LEV 6:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LEV 6:26" />Omunyamurwa oriba naagitamba ahabw'ekibi, abe niwe yaagirya; eriirwe omu mwanya gurikwera omu kibuga ky'Eihema ry'okubugaabuganiramu. <verse eid="LEV 6:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LEV 6:27" />Ekirikora aha nyama yaayo kyona kiryaba ekirikwera; kandi eshagama yaayo ku eritaraakira ekijwaro kyona, ekyo kijwaro ekyataraakirwa eshagama oryakyogyeza omu mwanya gurikwera. <verse eid="LEV 6:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LEV 6:28" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:28: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 15:12">Lev 15:12</ref>. </char></note> Orwabya oru eteekirwemu ruryayatwa; kwonka ku eriba eteekirwe omu rwabya rw'emiringa, orwo rwabya ruryakuutwa, kandi rumunyunguzibwe n'amaizi. <verse eid="LEV 6:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LEV 6:29" />Oyetwa omushaija weena omu banyamurwa agiryeho; egyo n'empongano erikwera munonga. <verse eid="LEV 6:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LEV 6:30" />Kwonka empongano y'ekibi yoona, ei eshagama yaayo erireetwa omu Ihema ry'okubugaabuganiramu kurihiirira ekibi omu Mwanya ogurikwera, etaririibwa, kureka eyokibwe omu muriro.<verse eid="LEV 6:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LEV 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="LEV 7" />
  <para style="s1">Ekiragiro ky'empongano y'okwihaho orubanja</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LEV 7:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">7:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LEV 5:1-6">Lev 5:1-6</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 6:1-7">6:1-7</ref>. </char>
    </note> Eki nikyo kiragiro ky'empongano y'okwihaho orubanja; n'empongano erikwera munonga. <verse eid="LEV 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LEV 7:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 4:24">Lev 4:24</ref>. </char></note> Omu mwanya ogu baitiramu ekitambo ky'okwotsya, babe niho baaguma nibaitira n'empongano y'okwihaho orubanja, eshagama yaayo eshukyerwe eitambiro embaju zoona. <verse eid="LEV 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LEV 7:3" />Kandi ebishaju byayo byona bihongwe, omukira gwayo gw'ebishaju, ebishaju ebishwekire eby'omunda, <verse eid="LEV 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LEV 7:4" />entsigo zombi eziri aha mugongo n'ebishaju ebiziriho, n'ekishaabo eky'aha kitugu akitwarirane n'ezo ntsigo, omunyamurwa abiiheho, <verse eid="LEV 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LEV 7:5" />abyokyeze aha itambiro kuba empongano eyokiibwe omu muriro ehongyeirwe MUKAMA; egyo n'empongano y'okwihaho orubanja. <verse eid="LEV 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LEV 7:6" />Oyetwa omushaija omu banyamurwa weena agiryeho; eriirwe omu mwanya gurikwera; egyo n'empongano erikwera munonga. <verse eid="LEV 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LEV 7:7" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:7: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 6:25">Lev 6:25</ref>. </char></note> Nk'empongano y'ekibi oku eri, nikwo n'empongano y'okwihaho orubanja eri; ekiragiro kyazo ni kimwe; omunyamurwa orikuzihonga abe niwe yaagitwara. <verse eid="LEV 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LEV 7:8" />Omunyamurwa orikutamba ekitambo ky'okwotsya eky'omuntu weena, abe niwe yaatwara oruhu rw'ekitambo ky'okwotsya eki yaatamba. <verse eid="LEV 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LEV 7:9" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:9: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 9:7-14">1 Kor 9:7-14</ref>. </char></note> Kandi empongano y'esaano yoona eteekyeirwe omu iteekyero ry'emigaati, n'ekintu kyona ekikarangisiibwe amajuta aha kyoma, kandi n'ekiteekirwe aha kyoma, biryaba eby'omunyamurwa owaabihayo. <verse eid="LEV 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LEV 7:10" />N'empongano y'esaano yoona ejwangizemu amajuta nari ey'esaano eyomire, eryabaganwa batabani ba Arooni boona nibainganisa.<verse eid="LEV 7:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ekiragiro ky'empongano z'okusiima ahabw'obusingye</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LEV 7:11" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">7:11: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LEV 3:1">Lev 3:1</ref>. </char>
    </note> Eki nikyo kiragiro ky'ebitambo by'empongano z'okusiima ahabw'obusingye, ezirihongyerwa MUKAMA. <verse eid="LEV 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LEV 7:12" />Omuntu ku arikihonga ahabw'okusiima, hamwe n'ekyo kitambo ky'okusiima areete twakeeki otutatumbisiibwe otujwangize n'amajuta, na capati ezitatumbisiibwe ezisiigirwe amajuta, n'otundi twakeeki tw'esaano y'obunono otujwangize gye n'amajuta. <verse eid="LEV 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LEV 7:13" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:13: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="AMO 4:5">Amo 4:5</ref>. </char></note> Twakeeki otwo atwongyereho emigaati etatumbisiibwe, abihongye hamwe n'ekitambo kye ky'okusiima ahabw'obusingye, eki arikuhonga ahabw'okusiima MUKAMA. <verse eid="LEV 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LEV 7:14" />Ahari buri empongano aiheho omugaati gumwe kuba empongano y'okuzongazonzya ahari MUKAMA, gube omugabo gw'omunyamurwa orikushukyera eshagama y'ekitambo ky'okusiima ahabw'obusingye. <verse eid="LEV 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LEV 7:15" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:15: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 22:30">Lev 22:30</ref>. </char></note> Enyama y'ekitambo ky'empongano ze ez'okusiima ahabw'obusingye eryariibwa aha izooba eri ekyo kitambo kirihongyerwaho; atarigira ei yaatsigaho okuhitsya omu kasheeshe. <verse eid="LEV 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LEV 7:16" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:16: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 19:6">Lev 19:6</ref>. </char></note> Kwonka ekitambo ky'empongano ye ku kiriba kiri eky'okuhiga, nari eki atoizire ahabw'okweyendera, kiryariibwa aha izooba eri arikiheeraho, kandi ekiritsigaraho kiriibwe omu kasheeshe; <verse eid="LEV 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LEV 7:17" />kwonka enyama y'ekitambo ekyo eritsigaraho okuhitsya aha izooba rya kashatu, eryayokibwa omu muriro. <verse eid="LEV 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LEV 7:18" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:18: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 4:4">Kut 4:4</ref>, <ref loc="GEN 4:5">5</ref>; <ref loc="JER 6:20">Yer 6:20</ref>. </char></note> Kandi enyama yoona ey'ekitambo ey'empongano ze z'okusiima ahabw'obusingye, ku eririibwa aha izooba rya kashatu, teriikirizibwa, kandi teribarirwa ogwo ogihongire; eryaba erikunugwa, kandi origiryaho weena aryagiibwaho orubanja rw'okutahikiirira. <verse eid="LEV 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LEV 7:19" />Enyama erikora aha kirikuzira kyona etaririibwa, kureka eyokibwe omu muriro. Abashemeire boona nibaikirizibwa kurya enyama y'ekitambo, <verse eid="LEV 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LEV 7:20" />kwonka omuntu weena orirya aha nyama y'ekitambo ky'empongano z'okusiima MUKAMA ahabw'obusingye, akisiisikaire, omuntu ogwo aryacuubwa omu ihanga rye. <verse eid="LEV 7:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LEV 7:21" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:21: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 4:14">Ezk 4:14</ref>. </char></note> Kandi omuntu weena ku arikora aha kintu kyona ekirikuzira, ekirikuruga omu muntu, nari aha nyamaishwa erikuzira, nari aha kintu kyona ekisiisikaire ekirikuzira, haza akarya aha nyama y'ekitambo ky'empongano z'okusiima MUKAMA ahabw'obusingye, omuntu ogwo aryacuubwa omu ihanga rye.<verse eid="LEV 7:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LEV 7:22" />MUKAMA yaagambira Musa ati: <verse eid="LEV 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LEV 7:23" />Gambira Abaisraeli oti: Mutarirya ebishaju by'ente nari eby'entaama nari eby'embuzi. <verse eid="LEV 7:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LEV 7:24" />Ebishaju by'ekyefeereire nari eby'ekiitsirwe enyamaishwa nibibaasa kukoresibwa omu muringo gundi gwona, kwonka mutaribiryaho na kakye; <verse eid="LEV 7:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LEV 7:25" />ahakuba omuntu weena orirya aha bishaju by'enyamaishwa y'omu birikuhongyerwa MUKAMA ebirikwokibwa omu muriro, omuntu ogwo aryacuubwa omu ihanga rye. <verse eid="LEV 7:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LEV 7:26" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:26: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 15:20">Byak 15:20</ref>. </char></note> Kandi mutarirya eshagama y'omuringo gwona ey'ebirikuguruka nari ey'enyamaishwa omu maka gaanyu goona. <verse eid="LEV 7:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LEV 7:27" />Omuntu weena orirya eshagama y'omuringo gwona, acuubwe omu ihanga rye.<verse eid="LEV 7:27" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ekiragiro ky'empongano y'okusiima ahabw'obusingye</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LEV 7:28" />MUKAMA yaagambira Musa ati: <verse eid="LEV 7:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LEV 7:29" />Gambira Abaisraeli oti: Oritambira MUKAMA ekitambo ky'empongano z'okusiima ahabw'obusingye, areetere MUKAMA empongano ye; aihe aha kitambo ekyo eky'okuhongyera MUKAMA ekirikwokibwa omu muriro, akyereetere n'engaro ze; <verse eid="LEV 7:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LEV 7:30" />areete ebishaju n'enkoro, egyo nkoro bagizongazonzye, ebe empongano ezongazongiibwe omu maisho ga MUKAMA. <verse eid="LEV 7:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LEV 7:31" />Omunyamurwa ayotsye ebishaju aha itambiro; kwonka enkoro ebe eya Arooni n'abatabani. <verse eid="LEV 7:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LEV 7:32" />Kandi aha bitambo by'empongano zaanyu ez'okusiima ahabw'obusingye, muryaguma muhe omunyamurwa ekivune ky'okuguru kwa buryo kuba empongano eihirweho. <verse eid="LEV 7:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LEV 7:33" />Ow'omuri batabani ba Arooni, oriba naatamba eshagama n'ebishaju by'empongano z'okusiima ahabw'obusingye, abe niwe yaatwara ekivune ky'okuguru kwa buryo kuba omugabo gwe; <verse eid="LEV 7:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LEV 7:34" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:34: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 18:3">Bir 18:3</ref>. </char></note> ahakuba enkoro erikuzongazongibwa n'ekivune ky'okuguru ekiihwaho, naabiiha aha Baisraeli omu bitambo by'empongano zaabo z'okusiima ahabw'obusingye, naabiha Arooni omunyamurwa n'abatabani kuba omugabo gwabo ogw'ebiro byona, ogu bahairwe Abaisraeli. <verse eid="LEV 7:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LEV 7:35" />Ogwo nigwo mugabo gwa Arooni n'abatabani ogwihirwe omu mpongano ezookiibwe omu muriro, ebihairweyo ahari MUKAMA, ogwabaihiirweho aha izooba eri baamurikiirweho omu maisho ga MUKAMA kumuheereza nk'abanyamurwa be; <verse eid="LEV 7:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LEV 7:36" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:36: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 7:18-28">Heb 7:18-28</ref>. </char></note> ogwo mugabo MUKAMA akaragiira Abaisraeli kuguma nibagubaha, yaakiragiira aha izooba eri yaabashukiireho amajuta kubashoroora. Ekyo kyaba ekiragiro ekitarihwaho omu busingye bwabo bwona.<verse eid="LEV 7:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LEV 7:37" />Ekyo nikyo kiragiro ky'ekitambo eky'okwotsya, n'eky'empongano y'esaano, n'eky'empongano y'ekibi, n'eky'empongano y'okwihaho orubanja, n'eky'okushoroora, n'eky'ekitambo ky'okusiima ahabw'obusingye, <verse eid="LEV 7:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LEV 7:38" />ebi MUKAMA yaaragiriire Musa aha rushozi Sinai, aha izooba eri yaaragiriireho Abaisraeli kureetera MUKAMA empongano zaabo omu ihamba rya Sinai.<verse eid="LEV 7:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LEV 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="LEV 8" />
  <para style="s1">Okushoroorwa kwa Arooni n'abatabani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LEV 8:1" />MUKAMA yaagambira Musa ati: <verse eid="LEV 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LEV 8:2" />Twara Arooni n'abatabani n'ebijwaro biri n'amajuta g'okushukaho ahabw'okushoroora, n'enimi y'ekimasha ey'empongano y'ekibi, n'empaya ibiri z'entaama, n'ekiibo ky'emigaati etatumbisiibwe; <verse eid="LEV 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LEV 8:3" />kandi oteeranire eihanga ryona aha muryango gw'Eihema ry'okubugaabuganiramu. <verse eid="LEV 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LEV 8:4" />Musa yaakora nk'oku MUKAMA yaamuragiira; eihanga ryona ryateeranira aha muryango gw'Eihema ry'okubugaabuganiramu. <verse eid="LEV 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LEV 8:5" />Musa yaagambira eihanga ryona ati: Eki nikyo MUKAMA yaaragiira kukorwa. <verse eid="LEV 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LEV 8:6" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:6: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 52:11">Isa 52:11</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 6:11">1 Kor 6:11</ref>. </char></note> Musa yaareeta Arooni n'abatabani, yaaboozya n'amaizi; <verse eid="LEV 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LEV 8:7" />yaamujweka ekooti, yaamuzirika n'eky'okwezirikisa kiri, yaamujweka ekanzu, yaagitungikaho efodi, yaamuzirika eky'okwezirikisa kya efodi ekirukirwe abanyamwoga, yaakigimuhamisaho; <verse eid="LEV 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LEV 8:8" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:8: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 28:6">1 Sam 28:6</ref>; <ref loc="EZR 2:63">Ezr 2:63</ref>. </char></note> yaamujweka eky'aha kifuba kiri, kandi omurikyo yaakitamu Urimu na Tumimu. <verse eid="LEV 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LEV 8:9" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:9: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ZEC 3:5">Zek 3:5</ref>; <ref loc="ZEC 6:11">6:11</ref>. </char></note> Yaamujweka ekikwemba aha mutwe, kandi aha kikwemba omu maisho yaataho ekipande ky'ezaabu, nikyo kirunga ekirikwera, nk'oku MUKAMA yaaragiire Musa.<verse eid="LEV 8:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LEV 8:10" />Bwanyima Musa yaihayo amajuta gari ag'okushukaho ahabw'okushoroora, yaagashuka aha butaaho n'ahari byona ebyabaire birimu, yaabyeza. <verse eid="LEV 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LEV 8:11" />Yaagamiisiira n'aha itambiro emirundi mushanju, kandi yaagashuka ahari eryo itambiro n'ebintu byaryo byona, n'aha kinaabiro n'ekibunu kyakyo, kubyeza. <verse eid="LEV 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LEV 8:12" />Kandi yaagashuka n'aha mutwe gwa Arooni kumweza. <verse eid="LEV 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LEV 8:13" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:13: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 29:8-35">Kur 29:8-35</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 132:9">Zab 132:9</ref>. </char></note> Bwanyima Musa yaareeta batabani ba Arooni, yaabajweka ekooti, yaabazirika n'eby'okwezirikisa, yaabajweka n'enkofiira, nk'oku MUKAMA yaamuragiire.<verse eid="LEV 8:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LEV 8:14" />Bwanyima yaareeta enimi y'ekimasha ey'empongano y'ekibi; Arooni n'abatabani baata engaro zaabo aha mutwe gw'egyo nimi y'empongano y'ekibi. <verse eid="LEV 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LEV 8:15" />Musa yaagiita, yaatwara eshagama yaayo, yaagita aha mahembe g'eitambiro n'orukumu rwe aha nshonda zaaryo zoona, yaarishemeza, yaashuka endiijo shagama yoona ahansi aha kibunu kyaryo kuririhiirira, yaaryeza. <verse eid="LEV 8:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LEV 8:16" />Yaatwara ebishaju byona ebishwekire eby'omunda, n'ekishaabo eky'aha kitugu, n'entsigo zombi n'ebishaju byazo, yaabyokyeza aha itambiro. <verse eid="LEV 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LEV 8:17" />Kwonka enimi, oruhu rwayo n'enyama zaayo n'efa yaayo, yaabyokyeza aheeru y'orusiisira nk'oku MUKAMA yaamuragiire.<verse eid="LEV 8:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LEV 8:18" />Yaareeta empaya y'entaama kuba ekitambo ky'okwotsya; Arooni n'abatabani baata engaro zaabo aha mutwe gw'egyo mpaya. <verse eid="LEV 8:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LEV 8:19" />Musa yaagiita, yaashukyera eitambiro eshagama yaayo embaju zoona. <verse eid="LEV 8:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LEV 8:20" />Ku yaaherize kugicwagacwagura, yaayotsya omutwe gwayo n'ebicweka byayo n'ebishaju byayo; <verse eid="LEV 8:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LEV 8:21" />yaayozya eby'omunda byayo n'amaguru gaayo n'amaizi, yaayokyeza egyo mpaya yoona aha itambiro; kyaba ekitambo kyokize eky'ekisooroora kirungi, empongano eyokiibwe omu muriro, ehongyeirwe MUKAMA, nk'oku MUKAMA yaaragiire Musa.<verse eid="LEV 8:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LEV 8:22" />Bwanyima yaareeta empaya y'entaama eya kabiri, empaya ey'okushoroorwa kw'abanyamurwa; Arooni n'abatabani baata engaro zaabo aha mutwe gwayo; <verse eid="LEV 8:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LEV 8:23" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:23: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 12:1">Rom 12:1</ref>. </char></note> Musa yaagiita, yaatwara aha shagama yaayo, yaagita aha nshonga y'okutu kwa Arooni okwa buryo n'aha kikumu kishaija eky'engaro ya buryo, n'aha kikumu kishaija eky'ekigyere kya buryo; <verse eid="LEV 8:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LEV 8:24" />bwanyima yaareeta batabani ba Arooni, yaata eshagama aha nshonga z'amatu gaabo aga buryo n'aha bikumu bishaija eby'engaro zaabo za buryo n'aha bikumu bishaija eby'ebigyere byabo bya buryo; Musa yaashukyera endiijo shagama yoona aha itambiro embaju zoona. <verse eid="LEV 8:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LEV 8:25" />Kandi yaatwara ebishaju byayo n'omukira gw'ebishaju n'ebishaju ebishwekire eby'omunda, n'ekishaabo ky'aha kitugu n'entsigo zombi n'ebishaju byazo n'ekivune ky'okuguru kwa buryo; <verse eid="LEV 8:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LEV 8:26" />kandi omu kiibo ky'emigaati etatumbisiibwe eyaabaire etuura omu maisho ga MUKAMA, yaihamu kaakeeki kamwe akatatumbisiibwe, n'akandi akasiigirwe amajuta na capati emwe, yaabita ahari ebyo bishaju n'aha kivune ky'okuguru kwayo okwa buryo; <verse eid="LEV 8:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LEV 8:27" />byona yaabita aha ngaro za Arooni n'aha ngaro z'abatabani, yaabizongazonzya, byaba empongano ezongazongiibwe omu maisho ga MUKAMA. <verse eid="LEV 8:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LEV 8:28" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:28: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 5:2">Efe 5:2</ref>. </char></note> Bwanyima Musa yaabiiha omu ngaro zaabo, yaabyokyeza aha itambiro hamwe n'ekitambo ky'okwotsya, nk'empongano y'okushoroorwa kw'abanyamurwa ey'ekisooroora kirungi; yaaba empongano eyokiibwe omu muriro ehongyeirwe MUKAMA. <verse eid="LEV 8:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LEV 8:29" />Kandi Musa yaatwara enkoro, yaagizongazonzya kuba empongano ezongazongiibwe omu maisho ga MUKAMA; enkoro egyo yaaba omugabo gwa Musa ogw'ahari egyo mpaya y'okushoroorwa kw'abanyamurwa, nk'oku MUKAMA yaaragiire Musa. <verse eid="LEV 8:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LEV 8:30" />Kandi Musa yaatwara aha majuta ag'okushukaho ahabw'okushoroora n'aha shagama eyaabaire eri aha itambiro, yaabimiisiira ahari Arooni n'aha bijwaro bye n'aha batabani n'aha bijwaro byabo; atyo yaayeza Arooni n'ebijwaro bye n'abatabani n'ebijwaro byabo.<verse eid="LEV 8:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LEV 8:31" />Bwanyima Musa yaagambira Arooni n'abatabani ati: Muteekye egyo nyama aha muryango gw'Eihema ry'okubugaabuganiramu, mube niho mwagiriira hamwe n'emigaati eri omu kiibo ey'okushoroorwa kw'abanyamurwa, nk'oku naaragiire, ningira nti: Arooni n'abatabani bagirye. <verse eid="LEV 8:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LEV 8:32" />Enyama n'emigaati ebiraatsigareho, mubyotsye n'omuriro. <verse eid="LEV 8:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LEV 8:33" />Mumare ebiro mushanju, mutarikushohora aheeru y'Eihema ry'okubugaabuganiramu, okuhitsya ahu ebiro by'okushoroorwa kwanyu birihwera; ahabw'okuba okushoroorwa kwanyu nikwija kumara ebiro mushanju. <verse eid="LEV 8:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LEV 8:34" />Nk'oku byakorwa eri izooba, nikwo MUKAMA yaaragiira ku biguma nibikorwa bityo okubarihiirira. <verse eid="LEV 8:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LEV 8:35" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:35: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1TI 5:21">1 Tim 5:21</ref>. </char></note> Nimwija kuguma aha muryango gw'Eihema ry'okubugaabuganiramu nyomushana na nyekiro okumara ebiro mushanju, nimukora eki MUKAMA yaaragiira, mutakaafa; ahakuba nikwo naaragiirwa. <verse eid="LEV 8:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LEV 8:36" />Arooni n'abatabani baakora byona ebi baaragiririirwe omuri Musa.<verse eid="LEV 8:36" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LEV 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="LEV 9" />
  <para style="s1">Empongano za Arooni z'okubanza</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LEV 9:1" />Aha kiro kya munaana Musa yaayeta Arooni n'abatabani n'abakuru b'Abaisraeli, <verse eid="LEV 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LEV 9:2" />yaagambira Arooni ati: Twara enimi y'ekimasha kuba empongano y'ekibi, n'empaya y'entaama kuba ekitambo ky'okwotsya, ebitaine kamogo byombi, obitambire omu maisho ga MUKAMA. <verse eid="LEV 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LEV 9:3" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1PE 2:24">1 Pet 2:24</ref>. </char></note> Kandi ogambire Abaisraeli oti: Mutware empaya y'embuzi kuba empongano y'ekibi, n'enyana hamwe n'omwana gw'entaama ebihikize omwaka gumwe ebitaine kamogo kuba ekitambo ky'okwotsya, <verse eid="LEV 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LEV 9:4" />n'enimi n'empaya y'entaama kuba empongano ez'okusiima ahabw'obusingye, bitambirwe omu maisho ga MUKAMA; kandi mutware n'empongano y'esaano ejwangize n'amajuta; ahakuba eri izooba MUKAMA naija kubeeyoreka. <verse eid="LEV 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LEV 9:5" />Baareeta omu maisho g'Eihema ry'okubugaabuganiramu ebi Musa yaaragiira; eihanga ryona ryairira haihi, ryayemerera omu maisho ga MUKAMA. <verse eid="LEV 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LEV 9:6" />Musa yaagira ati: Eki nikyo MUKAMA yaabaragiira kukora; kandi ekitiinisa kya MUKAMA nikiija kubabonekyera. <verse eid="LEV 9:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LEV 9:7" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:7: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 5:1">Heb 5:1</ref>, <ref loc="HEB 5:3">3</ref>. </char></note> Musa yaagira Arooni ati: Hika aha itambiro, ohongye empongano yaawe y'ekibi n'ekitambo kyawe ky'okwotsya, kandi okore eby'okwerihiirira n'eby'okurihiirira abantu; oreete n'empongano y'abantu, okore eby'okubarihiirira, nk'oku MUKAMA yaaragiire.<verse eid="LEV 9:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LEV 9:8" />Atyo Arooni yaahika aha itambiro, yaita enyana y'empongano y'ekibi ey'okwehongyerera; <verse eid="LEV 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LEV 9:9" />abatabani baamureetera eshagama, yaagikozamu orukumu, yaagita aha mahembe g'eitambiro, endiijo yaagishuka ahansi aha kibunu ky'eitambiro; <verse eid="LEV 9:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LEV 9:10" />kwonka ebishaju n'entsigo zombi n'ekishaabo ky'aha kitugu eby'egyo mpongano y'ekibi yaabyokyeza aha itambiro, nk'oku MUKAMA yaaragiire Musa. <verse eid="LEV 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LEV 9:11" />Enyama yaayo n'oruhu rwayo yaabyotsya omu muriro aheeru y'orusiisira.<verse eid="LEV 9:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LEV 9:12" />Bwanyima yaita ekitambo ky'okwotsya; abatabani baamureetera eshagama yaakyo, yaagishukyera eitambiro embaju zoona; <verse eid="LEV 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LEV 9:13" />baamureetera ebicweka by'ekyo kitambo ky'okwotsya, kimwe kimwe hamwe n'omutwe gwakyo; yaabyokyeza aha itambiro. <verse eid="LEV 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LEV 9:14" />Yaayozya eby'omunda n'amaguru gaakyo, yaabita aha kitambo ky'okwotsya, yaabyokyeza aha itambiro.<verse eid="LEV 9:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LEV 9:15" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">9:15: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1CO 15:3">1 Kor 15:3</ref>. </char>
    </note> Yaareeta empongano z'abantu, yaatwara embuzi y'empongano y'ekibi kyabo, yaagiita, yaagihongyerera ekibi, nk'empongano y'ekibi ey'okubanza. <verse eid="LEV 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LEV 9:16" />Bwanyima yaareeta ekitambo ky'okwotsya, yaakihonga nk'oku omugyenzo gwakyo guri. <verse eid="LEV 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LEV 9:17" />Kandi yaareeta empongano y'esaano, yaagiihaho oruhi rwijwire, yaagyokyeza aha itambiro, naagyongyera aha kitambo ky'okwotsya eky'omu kasheeshe.<verse eid="LEV 9:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LEV 9:18" />Kandi yaita n'egyo nimi n'empaya y'entaama eby'okutambirira abantu kuba empongano zaabo ez'okusiima ahabw'obusingye; abatabani baamureetera eshagama yaabyo, yaagishukyera eitambiro embaju zoona, <verse eid="LEV 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LEV 9:19" />kandi n'ebishaju by'enimi n'eby'empaya, n'omukira gw'ebishaju, n'ebishaju ebishwekire eby'omunda, n'entsigo zombi, n'ekishaabo ky'aha kitugu; <verse eid="LEV 9:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LEV 9:20" />baata ebyo bishaju aha nkoro zaazo, yaabyokyeza aha itambiro; <verse eid="LEV 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LEV 9:21" />kwonka enkoro zaazo n'ekivune ky'okuguru kwa buryo Arooni yaabizongazonzya kuba empongano ezongazongiibwe omu maisho ga MUKAMA, nk'oku Musa yaaragiire.<verse eid="LEV 9:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LEV 9:22" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">9:22: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LUK 24:50">Luk 24:50</ref>. </char>
    </note> Bwanyima Arooni yaimutsya emikono ye aha bantu, yaabashabira omugisha, yaaruga aha itambiro ahu yaabaire naatambira empongano y'ekibi n'ekitambo kyokize n'empongano z'okusiima ahabw'obusingye. <verse eid="LEV 9:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LEV 9:23" />Musa na Arooni baataaha omu Ihema ry'okubugaabuganiramu; ku baashohoire, baashabira abantu omugisha; ekitiinisa kya MUKAMA kyabonekyera abantu boona. <verse eid="LEV 9:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LEV 9:24" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:24: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 18:39">1 Bag 18:39</ref>. </char></note> Omuriro gwaruga omu maisho ga MUKAMA, gwayokyeza kimwe ekitambo ky'okwotsya n'ebishaju ebyabaire biri aha itambiro; abantu boona ku baakireebire, baayamuza, baagwa ahansi bajuumaire.<verse eid="LEV 9:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LEV 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="LEV 10" />
  <para style="s1">MUKAMA okwita Nadabu na Abihu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LEV 10:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">10:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 30:9">Kur 30:9</ref>. </char>
    </note> Bwanyima Nadabu na Abihu batabani ba Arooni baatwara buri omwe ekyoterero kye, baabitamu omuriro, baagushukaho obubaane, baabwoterera omu maisho ga MUKAMA n'omuriro ogundi ogu atarabaragiire. <verse eid="LEV 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LEV 10:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 16:35">Kub 16:35</ref>. </char></note> Ahonaaho omuriro gwaruga ahari MUKAMA, gwabootsya, baafeera omu maisho ga MUKAMA. <verse eid="LEV 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LEV 10:3" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 28:22">Ezk 28:22</ref>. </char></note> Musa yaagira Arooni ati: Eki nikyo MUKAMA yaagambire ati: Ndyayeyoreka ku ndi Orikwera omu barikuunyirira haihi, kandi ndyaheebwa ekitiinisa omu maisho g'aba bantu boona. Arooni yaahunama. <verse eid="LEV 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LEV 10:4" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 5:6">Byak 5:6</ref>. </char></note> Musa yaayeta Mishaeli na Elizafani, batabani ba Uzieli, ishento wa Arooni, yaabagira ati: Mwirire haihi, mwihe beene waanyu omu maisho g'Omwanya ogurikwera, mubatware aheeru y'orusiisira. <verse eid="LEV 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LEV 10:5" />Bairira haihi, baabatwara bajwaire ekooti zaabo, baabaiha omu rusiisira, nk'oku Musa yaaragiira. <verse eid="LEV 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LEV 10:6" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:6: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 6:6">Kub 6:6</ref>, <ref loc="NUM 6:7">7</ref>. </char></note> Musa yaagambira Arooni n'abatabani, Eleazaari na Itamaari ati: Mutazingurura eishokye, n'obu kwakuba okutaagura emyenda yaanyu, mukafa, kandi ekiniga kya MUKAMA kikajuumikira eihanga ryona; kwonka murekye beene waanyu ab'enju ya Israeli boona bacure ahabw'abookiibwe omuriro ogu MUKAMA areetsire. <verse eid="LEV 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LEV 10:7" />Kandi mutaruga omu muryango gw'Eihema ry'okubugaabuganiramu, mukafa, ahabw'okuba amajuta ga MUKAMA agu mushukirweho gabariho. Baakora nk'oku Musa yaabaragiira.<verse eid="LEV 10:7" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Abanyamurwa okuzibirwa okunywa ebirikusinza</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LEV 10:8" />MUKAMA yaagambira Arooni ati: <verse eid="LEV 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LEV 10:9" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:9: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 27:7">Isa 27:7</ref>; <ref loc="EPH 5:18">Efe 5:18</ref>. </char></note> Mutarinywa viinyo nari eky'okunywa eky'amaani, iwe n'abatabani baawe mwaba nimutaaha omu Ihema ry'okubugaabuganiramu, mutakaafa; ekyo n'ekiragiro ky'ebiro byona omu busingye bwanyu bwona, <verse eid="LEV 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LEV 10:10" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:10: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 22:26">Ezk 22:26</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 44:23">44:23</ref>. </char></note> mubone kutaanisa ebirikwera n'ebitarikwera, kandi ebirikuzira n'ebitarikuzira, <verse eid="LEV 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LEV 10:11" />n'okwegyesa Abaisraeli ebiragiro byona, ebi MUKAMA yaabagambiire naaraba omuri Musa.<verse eid="LEV 10:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Eby'emigabo y'abanyamurwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LEV 10:12" />Musa yaagambira Arooni n'abatabani, abaatsigaireho, Eleazaari na Itamaari, naagira ati: Mutware empongano y'esaano etsigaire aha mpongano ezihongyeirwe MUKAMA ezookiibwe omu muriro, mugiriire aha rubaju rw'eitambiro etatumbisiibwe; ahakuba n'erikwera munonga; <verse eid="LEV 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LEV 10:13" />kandi mugiriire omu mwanya gurikwera, ahakuba n'omugabo gwawe n'abatabani baawe, ogu mushemereire kuheebwa aha mpongano ezihongyeirwe MUKAMA ezookiibwe omu muriro, ahakuba okwo nikwo naaragiirwe. <verse eid="LEV 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LEV 10:14" />Kwonka enkoro ezongazongiibwe n'ekivune ky'okuguru ekiihirweho mubiriire omu mwanya gwona ogushemeire, iwe n'abatabani baawe na bahara baawe, ahakuba n'omugabo gwawe ogu origuma nooheebwa n'abatabani baawe aha bitambo by'empongano z'Abaisraeli z'okusiima ahabw'obusingye. <verse eid="LEV 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LEV 10:15" />Ekivune ky'okuguru ekiihirweho n'enkoro ezongazongiibwe baryaguma nibabireeta hamwe n'empongano z'ebishaju ez'okwokibwa omu muriro, babizongazongyeze omu maisho ga MUKAMA kuba empongano ezongazongiibwe; bibe ebyawe n'abatabani baawe kuba omugabo gwanyu ogw'ebiro byona, nk'oku MUKAMA yaaragiire.<verse eid="LEV 10:15" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Musa okutonganisa Arooni ahabw'okutarya aha mpongano y'ekibi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LEV 10:16" />Musa yaayezirika munonga kusherura embuzi y'empongano y'ekibi, yaashanga bagyokyeize kimwe; yaagwerwa kubi Eleazaari na Itamaari, batabani ba Arooni abaatsigaireho, yaababuuza ati: <verse eid="LEV 10:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LEV 10:17" />N'enki ekyabazibira kuriira empongano y'ekibi omu mwanya gw'Aharikwera, haza eri erikwera munonga; kandi mugihairwe ngu mubone kutwara okutahikiirira kw'eihanga okuririhiirira omu maisho ga mukama? <verse eid="LEV 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LEV 10:18" />Reeba eshagama yaayo tereetsirwe mu mwanya gw'Aharikwera; buzimazima mukaabaire mugiriiriire omu mwanya gw'Aharikwera nk'oku naaragiire. <verse eid="LEV 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LEV 10:19" />Arooni yaagarukamu Musa ati: Reeba eri izooba baaheza kutamba empongano yaabo ey'ekibi n'ekitambo kyabo ekyokiibwe omu maisho ga MUKAMA; ebintu ebirikushusha biti byambaho! Mbwenu shi, kuri naarya empongano y'ekibi eri izooba, kikaabaire kirungi omu maisho ga MUKAMA? <verse eid="LEV 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LEV 10:20" />Musa ku yaakihuriire, yaaguubwa gye.<verse eid="LEV 10:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LEV 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="LEV 11" />
  <para style="s1">Enyamaishwa ezirikuzira n'ezitarikuzira</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LEV 11:1" />MUKAMA yaagambira Musa na Arooni, naabagira ati: <verse eid="LEV 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LEV 11:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 15:11">Mat 15:11</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 10:12">Byak 10:12</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 8:8">1 Kor 8:8</ref>. </char></note> Mugambire Abaisraeli muti: Ebiine amagara ebi nibyo murikwikirizibwa kurya omu nyamaishwa zoona ez'omu nsi. <verse eid="LEV 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LEV 11:3" />Enyamaishwa zoona ezaatsizemu ebyara, eziine ebigyere by'ebyara bibiri, kandi ezirikwekuuma, mube nizo mwarya. <verse eid="LEV 11:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LEV 11:4" />Kwonka omuri ezo ezirikwekuuma, nari ezaatsizemu ebyara, ezi mutarizirya; engamira, ahakuba eyekuuma, kwonka teyatsizemu byara; n'erikuzira ahariimwe; <verse eid="LEV 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LEV 11:5" />endirira, ahakuba eyekuuma, kwonka teyatsizemu byara; n'erikuzira ahariimwe; <verse eid="LEV 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LEV 11:6" />orumi, ahakuba rwekuuma, kwonka tirwatsizemu byara; n'orurikuzira ahariimwe; <verse eid="LEV 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LEV 11:7" />empunu, ahakuba eyatsizemu ebyara, eine ebigyere by'ebyara bibiri, kwonka teyekuuma; n'erikuzira ahariimwe. <verse eid="LEV 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LEV 11:8" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:8: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 52:11">Isa 52:11</ref>; <ref loc="ROM 14:1-23">Rom 14:1-23</ref>. </char></note> Enyama yaazo mutarigirya, kandi n'emitumbi yaazo mutarigikoraho; ezo n'ezizira ahariimwe.<verse eid="LEV 11:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LEV 11:9" />Ebi nibyo murikwikirizibwa kurya ahari byona eby'omu maizi; eby'omu maizi ag'omu nyanja n'ag'omu migyera ebiine amapapa n'engamba, mube nibyo mwarya; <verse eid="LEV 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LEV 11:10" />kwonka byona ebitaine mapapa na ngamba eby'omu nyanja n'omu migyera, ebirikugyendera omu maizi byona, kandi n'ebiine amagara byona eby'omu maizi, n'ebirikunugwa ahariimwe. <verse eid="LEV 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LEV 11:11" />Biryaguma biri ebirikunugwa ahariimwe; mutarirya aha nyama yaabyo, kandi emitumbi yaabyo mugume muginugye. <verse eid="LEV 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LEV 11:12" />Ekiri omu maizi kyona ekitaine mapapa na ngamba n'ekirikunugwa ahariimwe.<verse eid="LEV 11:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LEV 11:13" />Ebi n'ebirikuguruka ebi mushemereire kunuga; bitaririibwa, n'ebirikunugwa; eishamba, empungu-mareere, kaamushungushungu, <verse eid="LEV 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LEV 11:14" />ekyanira, nyakabaka n'oruganda rwayo, <verse eid="LEV 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LEV 11:15" />ekikoona kyona n'oruganda rwakyo, <verse eid="LEV 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LEV 11:16" />maaya, ekishoma-bwire, enyangi, akaca n'oruganda rwako, <verse eid="LEV 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LEV 11:17" />ekihihizi, ekiyoyo, enyawaawa, <verse eid="LEV 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LEV 11:18" />enkoko y'omu maizi, nyamunyonyi, ekihuhura-bahuta, <verse eid="LEV 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LEV 11:19" />enkongoro, oruyongoyongo n'oruganda rwarwo, enkooherwa, n'orubaka.<verse eid="LEV 11:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LEV 11:20" />Ebikooko byona ebiine amapapa, ebirikugyendesa amaguru magufu ana n'eby'okunugwa ahariimwe; <verse eid="LEV 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LEV 11:21" />kwonka omu bikooko ebiine amapapa, ebirikugyendesa amaguru ana magufu, nimwikirizibwa kurya ebiine amaguru maraingwa ageehinyire ahaiguru y'ebigyere byabyo ag'okugurukisa ahansi; <verse eid="LEV 11:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LEV 11:22" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:22: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MRK 1:6">Mak 1:6</ref>. </char></note> ahari ebyo ebi nibyo murikwikirizibwa kurya; enzigye n'oruganda rwazo, ebiharara n'oruganda rwabyo, ejerere n'oruganda rwazo, n'eseenene n'oruganda rwazo. <verse eid="LEV 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LEV 11:23" />Kwonka ebikooko ebindi byona ebiine amapapa, ebirikugyendesa amaguru magufu ana n'ebirikunugwa ahariimwe.<verse eid="LEV 11:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LEV 11:24" />Ebyo biryabahindura abasiisikaire; omuntu weena orikora aha mutumbi gwabyo aryaba osiisikaire okuhitsya omu mwabazyo. <verse eid="LEV 11:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LEV 11:25" />Weena oryekorera ekicweka kyona eky'omutumbi gwabyo, ashemereire kwozya ebijwaro bye, n'okuguma ari osiisikaire okuhitsya omu mwabazyo. <verse eid="LEV 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LEV 11:26" />Enyamaishwa yoona eyaatsizemu ebyara, kwonka etaine bigyere by'ebyara bibiri, kandi etarikwekuuma, n'erikuzira ahariimwe; omuntu weena origikoraho aryaba osiisikaire. <verse eid="LEV 11:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LEV 11:27" />Enyamaishwa yoona erikuribatisa ebiganja omu nyamaishwa zoona ezirikugyendesa amaguru ana, n'erikuzira ahariimwe; weena orikora aha mutumbi gwayo aryaba osiisikaire okuhitsya omu mwabazyo; <verse eid="LEV 11:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LEV 11:28" />kandi oryekorera omutumbi gw'emwe aharizo, ashemereire kwozya ebijwaro bye, n'okuguma ari osiisikaire okuhitsya omu mwabazyo; ezo n'ezirikuzira ahariimwe.<verse eid="LEV 11:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LEV 11:29" />Ebi nibyo birikuzira ahariimwe omu birikugyendera ahansi ebiine amaguru magufu; akakorwa, embeba, entsigira-muteete n'oruganda rwayo, <verse eid="LEV 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LEV 11:30" />ekihangare, engamba, ekinya, akanyarugondo n'enyaruju. <verse eid="LEV 11:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LEV 11:31" />Ebyo nibyo ebirikuzira ahariimwe omu birikugyendera ahansi byona ebiine amaguru magufu; omuntu weena oribikoraho bifiire, aryaba osiisikaire okuhitsya omu mwabazyo. <verse eid="LEV 11:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LEV 11:32" />Ekintu kyona eki omutumbi gwabyo gurigwaho, kiryaba ekisiisikaire; n'obu kiriba kiri ekintu ekibaizirwe omu kiti, nari ekijwaro, nari oruhu, nari ekiguniya, nari ekintu kyona ekirikukoresibwa omurimo gwona, kishemereire kuteebwa omu maizi, n'okuguma kiri ekisiisikaire okuhitsya omu mwabazyo; bwanyima kibe ekishemeire. <verse eid="LEV 11:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LEV 11:33" />Kandi kimwe aharibyo ku kirigwa omu kintu ky'eibumba, kyona ekiriba kiri omuri ekyo kintu kiryaba ekisiisikaire, kandi ekintu ekyo muryakyata. <verse eid="LEV 11:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LEV 11:34" />Eby'okurya byona ebikirimu ebirikugiibwamu amaizi, biryaba ebisiisikaire; nari eby'okunywa byona ebirikunywebwa ebiriba biri omuri ekyo kintu biryaba ebisiisikaire. <verse eid="LEV 11:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LEV 11:35" />Ekintu kyona ekiriguubwaho ekicweka ky'omutumbi gwabyo kiryaba ekisiisikaire, n'obu kiriba kiri eiteekyero ry'eby'okurya, nari amahega kyatagurwe; ebintu ebyo biryaba bisiisikaire, kandi biri ebisiisikaire ahariimwe. <verse eid="LEV 11:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LEV 11:36" />Kureka enshuro nari ekiina ekyarimiirwe amaizi, omu garikuteeranira, nikyo kiriba kitasiisikaire; kwonka ekiriihamu omutumbi gwabyo kiryaba ekisiisikaire. <verse eid="LEV 11:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LEV 11:37" />Kandi ekicweka kyona eky'omutumbi gwabyo ku kirigwa aha mbibo yoona ey'okubibwa, embibo egyo eryaba etasiisikaire; <verse eid="LEV 11:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LEV 11:38" />kwonka ezo mbibo ku ziriba zitumbikire omu maizi, zaaguubwaho ekicweka kyona eky'omutumbi gwabyo, ziryaba ezisiisikaire ahariimwe.<verse eid="LEV 11:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LEV 11:39" />Enyamaishwa yoona ei murikwikirizibwa kurya, ku erifa, orikora aha mutumbi gwayo, aryaba osiisikaire okuhitsya omu mwabazyo. <verse eid="LEV 11:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LEV 11:40" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:40: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 4:14">Ezk 4:14</ref>. </char></note> Kandi orirya aha mutumbi gwayo, aryayozya ebijwaro bye, agume ari osiisikaire okuhitsya omu mwabazyo; kandi n'oryekorera omutumbi gwayo, aryayozya ebijwaro bye, agume ari osiisikaire okuhitsya omu mwabazyo.<verse eid="LEV 11:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LEV 11:41" />Ekirikugyendera ahansi kyona, n'ekirikunugwa; kitaririibwa. <verse eid="LEV 11:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LEV 11:42" />Ebirikugyendera ahansi byona, yaaba ebirikugyendesa enda, yaaba eby'amaguru ana, nari eby'amaguru maingi, mutaribirya; ahakuba n'ebirikunugwa. <verse eid="LEV 11:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LEV 11:43" />Mutaryehindura abarikunugwa ahabw'ekintu kyona ekirikugyendera ahansi, kandi mutaribyesiisisa, bikabashiisha. <verse eid="LEV 11:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LEV 11:44" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:44: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 19:6">Kur 19:6</ref>; <ref loc="1PE 1:15">1 Pet 1:15</ref>. </char></note> Mumanye ku ndi MUKAMA Ruhanga waanyu; n'ahabw'ekyo mweyeze, mube abarikwera; ahabw'okuba ndi Orikwera; kandi mutaryeshiisha n'ekintu ky'omuringo gwona ekirikugyendera ahansi; <verse eid="LEV 11:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LEV 11:45" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:45: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 12:1">Rom 12:1</ref>. </char></note> ahakuba niinye MUKAMA owaabaihire omu nsi ya Misri kuba Ruhanga waanyu; n'ahabw'ekyo mube abarikwera, ahakuba ndi Orikwera.<verse eid="LEV 11:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LEV 11:46" />Ebyo nibyo biragiro by'enyamaishwa n'ebirikuguruka n'ebiine amagara byona ebirikugyendera omu maizi na buri kihangirwe kyona ekirikugyendera ahansi, <verse eid="LEV 11:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LEV 11:47" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:47: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 22:26">Ezk 22:26</ref>. </char></note> ebitairweho kutaanisa ebirikuzira n'ebitarikuzira, n'ebiine amagara ebirikwikirizibwa kuriibwa n'ebitarikwikirizibwa.<verse eid="LEV 11:47" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LEV 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="LEV 12" />
  <para style="s1">Ebiragiro by'abakazi abazaire</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LEV 12:1" />MUKAMA yaagambira Musa ati: <verse eid="LEV 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LEV 12:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 2:22">Luk 2:22</ref>. </char></note> Gambira Abaisraeli oti: Omukazi ku arigira enda, yaazaara omwana w'omwojo, aryamara ebiro mushanju atashemeire; nk'oku aba ari omu biro bye by'okuza omu kwezi, nikwo ariguma ari otashemeire. <verse eid="LEV 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LEV 12:3" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 2:21">Luk 2:21</ref>. </char></note> Aha kiro kya munaana omwana ogwo aryasharwa ekishushu ky'omubiri gwe. <verse eid="LEV 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LEV 12:4" />Kandi nyina aryagumizamu ari omu shagama y'ekizaire, amare ebiro makumi ashatu na bishatu naashemezibwa; atarikora aha kintu kyona ekyeziibwe, n'obu kwakuba okuza omu Mwanya ogurikwera ebiro by'okutashemera kwe bitakahweire. <verse eid="LEV 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LEV 12:5" />Kwonka ku arizaara omwishiki, obwo aryamara ebiro ikumi na bina ari otashemeire nk'omu biro bye by'okuza omu kwezi; agumizemu ari omu shagama y'ekizaire, amare ebiro makumi mukaaga na mukaaga, naashemezibwa. <verse eid="LEV 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LEV 12:6" />Ebiro by'okutashemera kwe ku birihwa, yaaba by'omwojo nari eby'omwishiki, aryareeta omwana gw'entaama oguhikize omwaka kuba ekitambo ky'okwotsya, n'enkombe nto nari akaiba kuba empongano y'ekibi, abireetere omunyamurwa aha muryango gw'Eihema ry'okubugaabuganiramu; <verse eid="LEV 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LEV 12:7" />omunyamurwa abihongyere omu maisho ga MUKAMA, amurihiirire; ogwo mukazi abone kushemezibwa omu by'eshagama y'obuzaire bwe. Ekyo nikyo kiragiro ky'omukazi ozaire omwana w'omwojo nari ow'omwishiki. <verse eid="LEV 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LEV 12:8" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:8: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 2:24">Luk 2:24</ref>; <ref loc="2CO 8:9">2 Kor 8:9</ref>. </char></note> Kwonka ku ariba ari omworo, atarikubaasa kureeta mwana gw'entaama, areete obwiba bubiri nari enkombe nto ibiri, emwe kuba ey'ekitambo ky'okwotsya, n'endiijo kuba ey'empongano y'ekibi; omunyamurwa amurihiirire, abe oshemeziibwe.<verse eid="LEV 12:8" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LEV 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="LEV 13" />
  <para style="s1">Ebiragiro by'ebibembe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LEV 13:1" />MUKAMA yaagambira Musa na Arooni ati: <verse eid="LEV 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LEV 13:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 8:2-4">Mat 8:2-4</ref>. </char></note> Omuntu ku arigira aha mubiri gwe ekizimba nari ekiseera nari eibara, kyahinduka aha mubiri gwe nk'endwara y'ebibembe, bamureetere Arooni omunyamurwa nari omwe ahari batabani be abanyamurwa; <verse eid="LEV 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LEV 13:3" />omunyamurwa ashwijume endwara ey'aha ruhu rw'omubiri gwe; ku arishanga obwoya obw'ahu endwara eri buhindukire nibwera, kandi eibara ryogire omu ruhu rw'omubiri, egyo ndwara eryaba eri ebibembe; omunyamurwa amwetegyereze, amurangye ku asiisikaire. <verse eid="LEV 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LEV 13:4" />Kwonka ku arireeba eibara ry'aha ruhu rw'omubiri gwe niryera, kandi ritoogire mu ruhu, n'obwoya bwaho butahindukire kuba oburikwera, obwo omunyamurwa aryakingirana ogwo muntu orwaire okumara ebiro mushanju; <verse eid="LEV 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LEV 13:5" />aha kiro kya mushanju omunyamurwa agarukye amushwijume; ku arireeba egyo ndwara egumire nk'oku ebaire eri, etabugire mubiri, obwo omunyamurwa aryagaruka amukingirane ebindi biro mushanju; <verse eid="LEV 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LEV 13:6" />aha kiro kya mushanju ekindi omunyamurwa agarukye amushwijume; ku arishanga eibara ry'endwara ritakireebeka munonga, ritabugire mubiri, obwo amurangye ku atasiisikaire; biri n'ekiseera; ogwo muntu ayozye ebijwaro bye, abe otasiisikaire. <verse eid="LEV 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LEV 13:7" />Kwonka ebiseera ku birimubuga omubiri, aherize kweyoreka omunyamurwa ahabw'okushemezibwa, aryagaruka ayeyorekye omunyamurwa; <verse eid="LEV 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LEV 13:8" />omunyamurwa amushwijume; ku ari reeba ebiseera bimubugire omubiri, amurangye ku asiisikaire; biri n'ebibembe.<verse eid="LEV 13:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LEV 13:9" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">13:9: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2KI 5:3">2 Bag 5:3</ref>. </char>
    </note> Omuntu ku arikwatwa endwara y'ebibembe, bamutwarire omunyamurwa; <verse eid="LEV 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LEV 13:10" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:10: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 26:19">2 Bus 26:19</ref>, <ref loc="2CH 26:20">20</ref>. </char></note> omunyamurwa amushwijume; ku arishanga aine ekizimba kirikwera omu ruhu, kihindwire obwoya bwaho kuba oburikwera, kandi hacwekire ekironda, <verse eid="LEV 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LEV 13:11" />biri n'ebibembe ebitwire aha mubiri gwe; omunyamurwa amurangye ku asiisikaire; atarimukingirana, ahabw'okuba asiisikaire. <verse eid="LEV 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LEV 13:12" />Ebibembe ku biri musheesha aha mubiri, byashweka omubiri gwe gwona kwiha aha mutwe kuta aha bigyere, aha bicweka ebi omunyamurwa arireeba, <verse eid="LEV 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LEV 13:13" />omunyamurwa amushwijume; ku arireeba ebibembe bishwekire omubiri gwe gwona, amurangye ku atasiisikaire ahabw'endwara egyo; omubiri gwe gwona nigwera; tasiisikaire. <verse eid="LEV 13:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LEV 13:14" />Kwonka ahu ekironda kirimureebekyeraho, aryaba osiisikaire. <verse eid="LEV 13:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LEV 13:15" />Omunyamurwa aryashwijuma ekyo kironda, amurangye ku asiisikaire; ekyo kironda kisiisikaire; n'ebibembe. <verse eid="LEV 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LEV 13:16" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:16: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 5:12-14">Luk 5:12-14</ref>. </char></note> Nari ekyo kironda ku kirigaruka kyaba ekirikwera, agarukye aha munyamurwa; <verse eid="LEV 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LEV 13:17" />omunyamurwa amushwijume; ku arishanga endwara ehindukire neeyera, obwo omunyamurwa amurangye ku atasiisikaire; biri tasiisikaire.<verse eid="LEV 13:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LEV 13:18" />Omuntu ku ariba aine aha mubiri gwe enkojo y'ekihuute ekikizire, <verse eid="LEV 13:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LEV 13:19" />omu nkojo y'ekyo kihuute haazimbamu ekizimba kirikwera, nari haijamu eibara eririkutukaatukura, obwo kiryayorekwa omunyamurwa, omunyamurwa akishwijume; <verse eid="LEV 13:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LEV 13:20" />ku arishanga kyogire omu ruhu rw'omubiri, n'obwoya bwaho buhindukire oburikwera, obwo omunyamurwa amurangye ku asiisikaire; biri n'endwara y'ebibembe, ebarukire omu nkojo y'ekihuute. <verse eid="LEV 13:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LEV 13:21" />Kwonka omunyamurwa ku arikishwijuma, yaashanga hatariho bwoya burikwera, kitoogire mu ruhu rw'omubiri, kandi kitarikureebeka munonga, omunyamurwa amukingirane okumara ebiro mushanju; <verse eid="LEV 13:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LEV 13:22" />kandi ku kirimubuga omubiri, omunyamurwa amurangye ku asiisikaire; biri n'endwara y'ebibembe. <verse eid="LEV 13:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LEV 13:23" />Kwonka eryo ibara ku ririgumira ahu ribaire riri, ritaayeyongyera, biri n'enkojo ya kiri kihuute; omunyamurwa amurangye ku atasiisikaire.<verse eid="LEV 13:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LEV 13:24" />Nari shi, omuntu ku arigira amasya aha ruhu rw'omubiri gwe, aho ahahiire haagira eibara eririkutukaatukura nari eririkwera, <verse eid="LEV 13:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LEV 13:25" />omunyamurwa ahashwijume; ku arishanga obwoya oburi omuri eryo ibara buhindukire oburikwera, kandi eibara riri nk'eryogire omu ruhu rw'omubiri, biri n'ebibembe ebibarukire omuri ago masya; omunyamurwa amurangye ku asiisikaire; biri n'endwara y'ebibembe. <verse eid="LEV 13:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LEV 13:26" />Kwonka omunyamurwa ku arihashwijuma, yaashanga obwoya bw'omuri eryo ibara butarikwera, kandi ritoogire mu ruhu rw'omubiri, kandi ritarikureebeka munonga, omunyamurwa amukingirane okumara ebiro mushanju. <verse eid="LEV 13:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LEV 13:27" />Aha kiro kya mushanju amushwijume; ku arishanga rimubugire omubiri, amurangye ku asiisikaire; biri n'endwara y'ebibembe. <verse eid="LEV 13:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LEV 13:28" />Kwonka eryo ibara ku ririgumira ahuribaire riri, ritaabuga mubiri, kandi ritaareebeka munonga, biri n'ekizimba ekizimbire ahaabaire hahiire; omunyamurwa amurangye ku atasiisikaire; ku ziri enkojo z'omu masya ezihiriitsire. <verse eid="LEV 13:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LEV 13:29" />Omushaija nari omukazi ku arigira endwara omu mutwe nari omu bireju, <verse eid="LEV 13:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LEV 13:30" />omunyamurwa ashwijume egyo ndwara; ku arishanga endwara eyogire omu ruhu, obwoya bwamwo nibushusha obw'orwaire mutuku, obwo omunyamurwa amurangye ku asiisikaire; biri n'ekiguuna, n'ebibembe by'omu mutwe nari omu bireju. <verse eid="LEV 13:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LEV 13:31" />Omunyamurwa ku arishwijuma egyo ndwara y'ekiguuna, yaashanga etoogire omu ruhu, hatarimu ishokye nari obwoya burikwiragura, omunyamurwa amukingirane okumara ebiro mushanju; <verse eid="LEV 13:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LEV 13:32" />aha kiro kya mushanju omunyamurwa ashwijume egyo ndwara; ku arishanga ekiguuna kiteeyongyeire, kandi kitarimu obwo bwoya obwa mutuku, kandi kitarikureebeka kyogire omu ruhu, <verse eid="LEV 13:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LEV 13:33" />bamwe eishokye, kwonka ahu ekiguuna kiri batarihamwa; omunyamurwa amukingirane okumara ebindi biro mushanju. <verse eid="LEV 13:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LEV 13:34" />Aha kiro kya mushanju ekindi, omunyamurwa ashwijume ekyo kiguuna; ku arishanga kitabugire mubiri, kandi kitarikureebeka kyogire omu ruhu, obwo omunyamurwa amurangye ku atasiisikaire; ayozye ebijwaro bye, abe oshemeire. <verse eid="LEV 13:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LEV 13:35" />Kwonka ekiguuna ku kirimubuga omubiri, aherize kushemezibwa, <verse eid="LEV 13:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LEV 13:36" />obwo omunyamurwa aryamushwijuma; ku arishanga ekiguuna kimubugire omubiri, ataryerusya kusherura obwoya bwa mutuku; biri asiisikaire. <verse eid="LEV 13:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LEV 13:37" />Kwonka ku arireeba ekiguuna kigumiire ahu kibaire kiri, hameziremu eishokye nari obwoya burikwiragura, biri ekyo kiguuna kikizire, omuntu ogwo aryaba atasiisikaire; omunyamurwa amurangye ku atasiisikaire.<verse eid="LEV 13:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LEV 13:38" />Kandi omushaija nari omukazi ku arigira amabara aha ruhu rw'omubiri gwe, ago mabara gaaba agarikwera, <verse eid="LEV 13:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LEV 13:39" />omunyamurwa agashwijume; ku arishanga ago mabara g'aha ruhu rw'omubiri gwe gatarikwera munonga, biri n'amazomba kwonka agaseesire aha mubiri; aryaba atasiisikaire.<verse eid="LEV 13:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LEV 13:40" />Omuntu ku ariba ahweirwe eishokye aha mutwe, aryaba aine oruhara, kwonka atasiisikaire; <verse eid="LEV 13:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LEV 13:41" />omuntu ku arihwa eishokye aha bwekorerero, aryaba aine oruhara aha bwekorerero; aryaba atasiisikaire. <verse eid="LEV 13:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LEV 13:42" />Kwonka omuntu ku arigira endwara y'eibara eririkutukaatukura omu ruhara orw'aha mutwe gwona, nari omu ruhara orw'aha bwekorerero, biri n'ebibembe ebirikwera omu ruhara rwe, nari omu ruhara rw'aha bwekorerero bwe. <verse eid="LEV 13:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LEV 13:43" />Omunyamurwa aryamushwijuma; ku arishanga egyo ndwara y'omu ruhara rwe, nari omu ruhara rw'aha bwekorerero, kiri ekizimba ekirikutukaatukura, ekirikushusha ebibembe ebiri aha ruhu rw'omubiri, <verse eid="LEV 13:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LEV 13:44" />biri n'omubembe, aryaba asiisikaire; omunyamurwa amurangye ku asiisikaire; n'endwara ye emuri omu mutwe.<verse eid="LEV 13:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LEV 13:45" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">13:45: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EZK 24:17">Ezk 24:17</ref>; <ref loc="JOB 40:4">Yob 40:4</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 17:12">Luk 17:12</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 17:13">13</ref>. </char>
    </note> Omubembe orwaire egyo ndwara aryajwara ebijwaro ebitaagukire, agyende azingurwire eishokye, ashembire obureju bwe bwa ruguru, agyende naagamba n'eiraka rihango ati: Nsiisikaire! Nsiisikaire! <verse eid="LEV 13:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LEV 13:46" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:46: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 26:21">2 Bus 26:21</ref>; <ref loc="2TH 3:6">2 Tes 3:6</ref>. </char></note> Ebiro byona ebi arimara aine egyo ndwara, aryaguma ari osiisikaire; n'osiisikaire, ashemereire kuguma wenka omu nganyo aheeru y'orusiisira.<verse eid="LEV 13:46" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LEV 13:47" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">13:47: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ZEC 3:4">Zek 3:4</ref>; <ref loc="JUD 1:23">Yud 1:23</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ekijwaro ku kiriba kiine endwara y'ebibembe, yaaba ky'ebyoya by'entaama, nari kya kitaani, <verse eid="LEV 13:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LEV 13:48" />yaaba mu huuzi za bukiika nari za bwemi, eza kitaani nari ez'obwoya bw'entaama, nari omu ruhu, nari omu kintu kyona ekikozire omu ruhu, <verse eid="LEV 13:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LEV 13:49" />endwara egyo ku eriba eine erangi ya kijubwe nari erikutukaatukura, yaareebeka omu kijwaro nari omu ruhu, nari omu huuzi ezirukire bukiika nari bwemi, nari omu kintu kyona ekikozirwe omu ruhu, eryaba eri ebibembe, eshemereire kworekwa omunyamurwa; <verse eid="LEV 13:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LEV 13:50" />omunyamurwa ashwijume egyo ndwara, akingirane ekyo kintu ekigiine okumara ebiro mushanju. <verse eid="LEV 13:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LEV 13:51" />Aha kiro kya mushanju ashwijume egyo ndwara; ku arishanga eyeyongyeire omuri ekyo kijwaro, yaaba mu huuzi ezirukire bukiika nari bwemi, nari omu ruhu orurikukoresibwa omurimo gwona, egyo ndwara eryaba eri ebibembe ebirikurya; ekyo kintu kiryaba kisiisikaire. <verse eid="LEV 13:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LEV 13:52" />Ayotsye ekyo kijwaro ekiine endwara omu huuzi ezirukire bukiika nari bwemi, yaaba ky'obwoya bw'entaama nari ekya kitaani, nari ekintu kyona ekikozirwe omu ruhu; ahakuba kiine endwara y'ebibembe erikurya; kishemereire kwokibwa omu muriro.<verse eid="LEV 13:52" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="LEV 13:53" />Omunyamurwa ku arishwijuma, yaashanga endwara eteeyongyeire muri ekyo kijwaro omu huuzi ezirukire bukiika nari bwemi, nari omu kintu kyona ekikozirwe omu ruhu, <verse eid="LEV 13:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="LEV 13:54" />obwo omunyamurwa aryaragiira boozye ekintu ekirimu egyo ndwara, akikingirane okumara ebindi biro mushanju; <verse eid="LEV 13:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="LEV 13:55" />kandi omunyamurwa ashwijume ekyo kintu ekibaire kirimu endwara, kiherize kwogibwa; ku arishanga egyo ndwara etahindwire ibara, kandi eteeyongyeire, biri kisiisikaire; oryaba oshemereire kukyotsya; biri n'endwara erikurya, n'obu eibara ry'endwara egyo ryakuba riri enyima nari omunda. <verse eid="LEV 13:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LEV 13:56" />Kwonka omunyamurwa ku arishwijuma ahu endwara ebaire eri, yaashanga etarikureebeka munonga, haherize kwogibwa, ataagure eibara omu kijwaro, nari omu ruhu, nari omu huuzi ezirukire bukiika nari bwemi; <verse eid="LEV 13:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="LEV 13:57" />egyo ndwara ku erireebeka ekiri omuri ekyo kijwaro, yaaba mu huuzi ezirukire bukiika nari bwemi, nari omu kintu kyona eky'oruhu, biri neekyeyongyera, oshemereire kwotsya ekyo kintu ki erimu. <verse eid="LEV 13:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="LEV 13:58" />Kandi ekijwaro, yaaba ky'ehuuzi ekirukire bukiika nari bwemi nari ekintu kyona eky'oruhu ekirirugwamu endwara oherize kukyozya, kiryagaruka kyogibwe, kibe ekishemeire.<verse eid="LEV 13:58" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" sid="LEV 13:59" />Ebyo nibyo biragiro by'endwara y'ebibembe omu kijwaro ky'obwoya bw'entaama nari ekya kitaani, omu huuzi ezirukire bukiika nari bwemi, nari ekintu kyona eky'oruhu, ebirikuhamya ku kitasiisikaire nari ku kisiisikaire.<verse eid="LEV 13:59" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LEV 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="LEV 14" />
  <para style="s1">Ebiragiro by'okushemezibwa kw'ababembe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LEV 14:1" />MUKAMA yaagambira Musa ati: <verse eid="LEV 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LEV 14:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MRK 1:40">Mak 1:40</ref>, <ref loc="MRK 1:44">44</ref>. </char></note> Ebi nibyo biragiro by'omubembe aha izooba ry'okushemezibwa kwe. Aryareetwa aha munyamurwa; <verse eid="LEV 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LEV 14:3" />omunyamurwa ashohore aheeru y'orusiisira, ashwijume ogwo mubembe; ku arishanga akizire endwara y'ebibembe, <verse eid="LEV 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LEV 14:4" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 12:22">Kur 12:22</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 51:7">Zab 51:7</ref>. </char></note> aragiire bareete enyonyi ibiri ezitarikuzira, ezihuriire, n'ekiti ky'omwereezi, n'akenda ka karari, n'enganda y'enyaweera ahabw'orikwenda kushemezibwa; <verse eid="LEV 14:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LEV 14:5" />omunyamurwa aragiire kwitira emwe ahari ezo nyonyi omu rwabya rw'eibumba ahaiguru y'amaizi agarikugyenda; <verse eid="LEV 14:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LEV 14:6" />atware enyonyi ehuriire n'ekyo kiti ky'omwereezi n'akenda ka karari n'enganda y'enyaweera, abijabikye hamwe n'enyonyi ehuriire omu shagama y'enyonyi ei baitira ahaiguru y'amaizi agarikugyenda; <verse eid="LEV 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LEV 14:7" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:7: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 36:25">Ezk 36:25</ref>; <ref loc="HEB 9:13">Heb 9:13</ref>. </char></note> bwanyima agimiisiire orikuza kushemezibwaho ebibembe emirundi mushanju, amurangye ku ashemeziibwe, bwanyima arekure egyo nyonyi ehuriire, eze omu ishwa. <verse eid="LEV 14:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LEV 14:8" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:8: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 12:14">Kub 12:14</ref>, <ref loc="NUM 12:15">15</ref>. </char></note> Orikushemezibwa ayozye emyenda ye, amwe omubiri gwe gwona, ayogye omu maizi, abe oshemeziibwe; bwanyima y'ebyo agarukye omu rusiisira, kwonka amare ebiro mushanju aheeru y'eihema rye. <verse eid="LEV 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LEV 14:9" />Aha kiro kya mushanju amwe eishokye rye ryona n'ebireju bye na bahungu n'obundi bwoya bwe bwona, kandi ayozye emyenda ye, ayogye omubiri gwe omu maizi, abe oshemeziibwe. <verse eid="LEV 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LEV 14:10" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:10: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 8:4">Mat 8:4</ref>. </char></note> Kandi aha kiro kya munaana atware abaana b'entaama babiri b'empaya, abataine kamogo n'omwagazi gw'entaama oguhikize omwaka, ogutaine kamogo, hamwe n'ebicweka bishatu bya ikumi bya eefa y'esaano y'obunono ejwangize n'amajuta kuba empongano y'esaano na <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14:10 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">logi emwe neingana na painta. </char></note>logi emwe y'amajuta g'emizeituuni. <verse eid="LEV 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LEV 14:11" />Omunyamurwa orikumushemeza atware omushaija orikushemezibwa n'ebintu ebyo omu maisho ga MUKAMA aha muryango gw'Eihema ry'okubugaabuganiramu. <verse eid="LEV 14:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LEV 14:12" />Bwanyima omunyamurwa atware emwe ahari ezo mpaya nto z'entaama, agihongye kuba empongano y'okwihaho orubanja, hamwe na logi y'amajuta, abizongazonzye kuba empongano ezongazongiibwe omu maisho ga MUKAMA; <verse eid="LEV 14:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LEV 14:13" />bwanyima aitire egyo mpaya nto omu mwanya ogu baitiramu empongano y'ekibi n'ekitambo ky'okwotsya omu mwanya gw'Aharikwera; ahakuba nk'oku empongano y'ekibi eri ey'omunyamurwa, nikwo n'empongano y'okwihaho orubanja eri; n'erikwera munonga. <verse eid="LEV 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LEV 14:14" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:14: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 12:1">Rom 12:1</ref>. </char></note> Omunyamurwa atware ah shagama y'empongano y'okwihaho orubanga, agite aha nshonga y'okutu kwa buryo kw'orikushemezibwa, n'aha kikumu kishaija eky'engaro ye ya buryo, kandi n'aha kikumu kishaija eky'ekigyere kye kya buryo; <verse eid="LEV 14:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LEV 14:15" />kandi omunyamurwa atware ahari logi y'amajuta, agashukye aha kiganja kye kya bumosho, <verse eid="LEV 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LEV 14:16" />akoze orukumu rwe rwa buryo omu majuta agari aha kiganja kye kya bumosho, arumiisiize ago majuta emirundi mushanju omu maisho ga MUKAMA; <verse eid="LEV 14:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LEV 14:17" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:17: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 6:13-22">Rom 6:13-22</ref>. </char></note> amajuta agaatsigara aha kiganja kye omunyamurwa agate aha nshonga y'okutu kwa buryo kw'orukushemezibwa n'aha kikumu kishaija eky'engaro ye ya buryo, n'aha kikumu kishaija eky'ekigyere kye kya buryo, ahu yaata eshagama y'empongano y'okwihaho orubanja. <verse eid="LEV 14:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LEV 14:18" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:18: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 5:11">Rom 5:11</ref>. </char></note> Agandi majuta agaatsigara aha kiganja ky'omunyamurwa agasiigye aha mutwe gw'orikushemezibwa; omunyamurwa amurihiirire omu maisho ga MUKAMA. <verse eid="LEV 14:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LEV 14:19" />Kandi omunyamurwa ahongye empongano y'ekibi, arihiirire owaashemezibwaho okusiisikara; bwanyima aite ekitambo ky'okwotsya; <verse eid="LEV 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LEV 14:20" />ahongyere aha itambiro ekyo kitambo ky'okwotsya n'empongano y'esaano; amurihiirire, abe oshemeziibwe.<verse eid="LEV 14:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LEV 14:21" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">14:21: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PRO 22:2">Enf 22:2</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kwonka ku ariba ari omworo, otarikubaasa ebyo byona, areete empaya nto y'entaama kuba empongano y'okwihaho orubanja, ey'okuzongazongibwa, ahabw'okumurihiirira, n'empongano y'esaano y'ekicweka kimwe kya ikumi kya eefa y'esaano y'obunono ejwangize n'amajuta na logi y'amajuta g'emizeituuni, <verse eid="LEV 14:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LEV 14:22" />kandi n'obwiba bubiri nari enkombe nto ibiri ebi arikubaasa kutunga; emwe ahari ezo ebe empongano y'ekibi, endiijo ebe ekitambo ky'okwotsya. <verse eid="LEV 14:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LEV 14:23" />Aha kiro kya munaana abitwarire omunyamurwa aha muryango gw'Eihema ry'okubugaabuganiramu omu maisho ga MUKAMA, kushemezibwa. <verse eid="LEV 14:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LEV 14:24" />Omunyamurwa atware ogwo mwana gw'entaama gw'empongano y'okwihaho orubanja, na logi ya majuta, abizongazongyeze omu maisho ga MUKAMA, kuba empongano ezongazongiibwe; <verse eid="LEV 14:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LEV 14:25" />aite ogwo mwana gw'entaama gw'empongano y'okwihaho orubanja, atware aha shagama yaagwo, agite aha nshonga y'okutu kwa buryo kw'orikushemezibwa, n'aha kikumu kishaija eky'engaro ye ya buryo, n'aha kikumu kishaija eky'ekigyere kye kya buryo; <verse eid="LEV 14:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LEV 14:26" />kandi omunyamurwa ashukye ahari ago majuta aha kiganja kye eky'engaro ya bumosho; <verse eid="LEV 14:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LEV 14:27" />amiisiire ahari ago majuta gari aha kiganja kye n'orukumu rwe rwa buryo emirundi mushanju omu maisho ga MUKAMA; <verse eid="LEV 14:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LEV 14:28" />omunyamurwa akore ahari ago majuta, agate aha nshonga y'okutu kwa buryo kw'orikushemezibwa, n'aha kikumu kishaija eky'engaro ye ya buryo, n'aha kikumu kishaija eky'ekigyere kye kya buryo, ahu yaata eshagama y'empongano y'okwihaho orubanja; <verse eid="LEV 14:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LEV 14:29" />kandi amajuta agaatsigara aha kiganja ky'omunyamurwa, agasiigye aha mutwe gw'orikushemezibwa, kumurihiirira omu maisho ga MUKAMA. <verse eid="LEV 14:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LEV 14:30" />Bwanyima ahongye kamwe ahari obwo bwiba, nari ahari ezo nkombe nto, ezi abaasize kutunga, <verse eid="LEV 14:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LEV 14:31" />emwe ebe empongano y'ekibi, endiijo ebe ekitambo ky'okwotsya hamwe n'empongano y'esaano; omunyamurwa arihiirire orikushemezibwa omu maisho ga MUKAMA. <verse eid="LEV 14:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LEV 14:32" />Ebyo nibyo biragiro ahabw'omuntu orwaire endwara y'ebibembe otarikubaasa kutunga empongano ezaatairweho ahabw'okushemezibwa kwe.<verse eid="LEV 14:32" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ebiragiro by'enju ekwatsirwe ebibembe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LEV 14:33" />MUKAMA yaagambira Musa na Arooni ati: <verse eid="LEV 14:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LEV 14:34" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:34: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 45:7">Isa 45:7</ref>; <ref loc="AMO 3:6">Amo 3:6</ref>. </char></note> Ku murihika omu nsi ya Kanaani, ei mbahaire kuba eyaanyu, naareeta endwara y'ebibembe aha nju ey'omuri egyo nsi, <verse eid="LEV 14:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LEV 14:35" />mukama w'egyo nju agyende agambire omunyamurwa, ati: Nooshusha oti enju yangye etaahirwemu endwara. <verse eid="LEV 14:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LEV 14:36" />Omunyamurwa aragiire baihe omuri egyo nju ebirimu byona, atakataahiremu kushwijuma endwara, ebintu byona eby'omuri egyo nju birekye kurangwa ku bisiisikaire; bwanyima y'okubiihamu omunyamurwa ataahemu agireebe; <verse eid="LEV 14:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LEV 14:37" />ashwijume egyo ndwara; ku arishanga endwara eri aha bisiika by'enju, eri ey'eibara rya kijubwe nari eririkutukaatukura, kandi yaareebeka etaahire omu kisiika, <verse eid="LEV 14:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LEV 14:38" />obwo omunyamurwa arugye omuri egyo nju; ku arihika aha muryango, agikingye okumara ebiro mushanju; <verse eid="LEV 14:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LEV 14:39" />aha kiro kya mushanju agarukye agishwijume; ku araashangye egyo ndwara ebugire ebisiika by'enju, <verse eid="LEV 14:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LEV 14:40" />aragiire baihe omuri ekyo kisiika amabaare agarimu egyo ndwara, baganagye ahatashemeire aheeru y'orurembo; <verse eid="LEV 14:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LEV 14:41" />kandi aragiire baharagate egyo nju yoona omunda; ebi baraaharagatemu babyate aheeru y'orurembo omu mwanya gutashemeire; <verse eid="LEV 14:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LEV 14:42" />bwanyima bareete agandi mabaare, bagagarure omu mwanya gwa gari, areete ogundi musheenyi, agisiigirize.<verse eid="LEV 14:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="LEV 14:43" />Egyo ndwara ku erigaruka yaasheesha omu nju, aherize kwihamu ago mabaare, n'okugiharagata, n'okugisiigiriza, <verse eid="LEV 14:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LEV 14:44" />omunyamurwa ataahemu agishwijume; ku arishanga egyo ndwara egibugire, biri n'ebibembe ebiri kurya bitaahire omu nju; enju egyo eryaba esiisikaire. <verse eid="LEV 14:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LEV 14:45" />Asheenye egyo nju, amabaare gaayo n'ebiti byayo n'obuhome bwayo bwona abitware aheeru y'orurembo omu mwanya gutashemeire. <verse eid="LEV 14:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LEV 14:46" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:46: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 15:33">1 Kor 15:33</ref>. </char></note> Kandi oritaaha omu nju egyo ekikingire, aryahinduka osiisikaire okuhitsya omu mwabazyo. <verse eid="LEV 14:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LEV 14:47" />Kandi origibyamamu aryayozya ebijwaro bye; n'origiriiramu, ayozye ebijwaro bye. <verse eid="LEV 14:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LEV 14:48" />Kwonka omunyamurwa ku arigitaahamu, yaagishwijuma, yaashanga endwara etabugire nju bwanyima y'okusiigirizibwa, obwo arangye ku egyo nju etasiisikaire, ahabw'okuba endwara ekizire; <verse eid="LEV 14:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LEV 14:49" />atware enyonyi ibiri n'ekiti ky'omwereezi n'akenda ka karari n'enganda y'enyaweera eby'okushemeza egyo nju, <verse eid="LEV 14:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LEV 14:50" />emwe ahari ezo nyonyi agiitire omu rwabya ahaiguru y'amaizi agarikugyenda; <verse eid="LEV 14:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LEV 14:51" />kandi atware ekyo kiti ky'omwereezi n'enganda y'enyaweera n'akenda ka karari hamwe n'enyonyi ehuriire, abijabikye omu shagama y'enyonyi eyaitwa, kandi n'omu maizi agarikugyenda, amiisiire egyo nju emirundi mushanju. <verse eid="LEV 14:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LEV 14:52" />Okwo nikwo arishemeza enju n'eshagama y'enyonyi n'amaizi agarikugyenda n'enyonyi ehuriire n'ekiti ky'omwereezi n'enganda y'enyaweera n'akenda ka karari; <verse eid="LEV 14:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LEV 14:53" />bwanyima arekure egyo nyonyi ehuriire, erugye omu rurembo eze omu ishwa; atyo arihiirire egyo nju; ebe eshemeziibwe.<verse eid="LEV 14:53" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="LEV 14:54" />Ebyo nibyo biragiro by'emiringo yoona ey'endwara y'ebibembe n'ekiguuna, <verse eid="LEV 14:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="LEV 14:55" />n'ebibembe eby'omu bijwaro nari omu nju, <verse eid="LEV 14:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LEV 14:56" />n'eby'ebizimba n'ebiseera n'eibara, <verse eid="LEV 14:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="LEV 14:57" />ebirikumanyisa ekisiisikaire n'ekitasiisikaire. Ebyo nibyo biragiro by'ebibembe.<verse eid="LEV 14:57" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LEV 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="LEV 15" />
  <para style="s1">Ebiragiro by'abarikurugwamu ebitashemeire</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LEV 15:1" />MUKAMA yaagambira Musa na Arooni ati: <verse eid="LEV 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LEV 15:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MRK 5:25">Mak 5:25</ref>. </char></note> Mugambire Abaisraeli nimubagira muti: Omushaija weena ku ariba naarugwa amahira omu mibiri, aryaba asiisikaire ahabw'amahira ago. <verse eid="LEV 15:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LEV 15:3" />Ebi nibyo biragiro by'okusiisikara kwe ahabw'amahira agarikumurugamu; yaaba omubiri gwe nigureeta amahira, nari omuhanda gwago gwigaire, okwo nikwo kusiisikara kwe. <verse eid="LEV 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LEV 15:4" />Buri kitanda eki orikurugwamu amahira aribyamaho, kiryaba ekisiisikaire, na buri kintu eki arishutamaho, kiryaba ekisiisikaire. <verse eid="LEV 15:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LEV 15:5" />Kandi orikora aha kitanda kye weena, ayozye ebijwaro bye, ayogye omu maizi, kandi agume ari osiisikaire okuhitsya omu mwabazyo. <verse eid="LEV 15:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LEV 15:6" />Orishutama aha kintu kyona eki orikurugwamu amahira ashutamireho, ayozye ebijwaro bye, ayogye omu maizi, kandi agume ari osiisikaire okuhitsya omu mwabazyo. <verse eid="LEV 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LEV 15:7" />Orikora aha mubiri gw'orikurugwamu amahira, ayozye ebijwaro bye, ayogye omu maizi, kandi agume ari osiisikaire okuhitsya omu mwabazyo. <verse eid="LEV 15:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LEV 15:8" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:8: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 30:10">Yob 30:10</ref>. </char></note> Kandi orikurugwamu amahira ku aricwera omuntu otasiisikaire amacwante, owaacwerwa ayozye ebijwaro bye, ayogye omu maizi, kandi agume ari osiisikaire okuhitsya omu mwabazyo. <verse eid="LEV 15:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LEV 15:9" />Amatandiiko goona agu orikurugwamu amahira arishutamaho garyaba agasiisikaire. <verse eid="LEV 15:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LEV 15:10" />Weena orikora aha kintu kyona ekiriba kiri ahansi ye, aryaba osiisikaire okuhitsya omu mwabazyo; kandi n'oryekorera kimwe ahari ebyo, ayozye ebijwaro bye, ayogye omu maizi, kandi agume ari osiisikaire okuhitsya omu mwabazyo. <verse eid="LEV 15:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LEV 15:11" />Kandi orikurugwamu amahira ku arikora aha muntu weena atanaabire ngaro ze, owaakorwaho ayozye ebijwaro bye, ayogye omu maizi, kandi agume ari osiisikaire okuhitsya omu mwabazyo. <verse eid="LEV 15:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LEV 15:12" />Ekintu ky'eibumba eki orikurugwamu amahira arikoraho, kyatwe; kandi ekibaizirwe omu kiti kyona kyogibwe.<verse eid="LEV 15:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LEV 15:13" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">15:13: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="NUM 12:14">Kub 12:14</ref>. </char>
    </note> Orikurugwamu amahira ku arikira, ayebarire ebiro mushanju eby'okushemerezibwamu, ayozye ebijwaro bye, ayogye omubiri gwe gwona omu maizi agarikugyenda, abe oshemeire. <verse eid="LEV 15:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LEV 15:14" />Aha kiro kya munaana atware obwiba bubiri, nari enkombe nto ibiri, aije omu maisho ga MUKAMA aha muryango gw'Eihema ry'okubugaabuganiramu, abihe omunyamurwa; <verse eid="LEV 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LEV 15:15" />omunyamurwa abihongye, kimwe kibe empongano y'ekibi, ekindi kibe ekitambo ky'okwotsya; omunyamurwa amurihiirire omu maisho ga MUKAMA ahabw'okurugwamu amahira kwe.<verse eid="LEV 15:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LEV 15:16" />Omuntu weena ku arirugwamu amaizi agarikuzaara, ayogye omubiri gwe gwona omu maizi, agume ari osiisikaire okuhitsya omu mwabazyo; <verse eid="LEV 15:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LEV 15:17" />kandi buri kijwaro n'oruhu rwona ebirihikwaho ago maizi agarikuzaara, byogibwe omu maizi, bigume biri ebisiisikaire okuhitsya omu mwabazyo. <verse eid="LEV 15:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LEV 15:18" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:18: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 21:4">1 Sam 21:4</ref>. </char></note> Kandi omushaija ku ariba abyami n'omukazi, yaarugwamu ago maizi, bombi boogye omu maizi, bagume bari abasiisikaire okuhitsya omu mwabazyo.<verse eid="LEV 15:18" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Eby'endwara z'abakazi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LEV 15:19" />Omukazi ku ariza omu kwezi nk'obutoosha, aryamara ebiro mushanju ari otashemeire; orimukoraho weena abe otashemeire okuhitsya omu mwabazyo; <verse eid="LEV 15:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LEV 15:20" />kandi ekintu kyona eki aribyamaho ari omu kwezi, kibe ekisiisikaire; n'eki arishutamaho kyona kibe ekisiisikaire. <verse eid="LEV 15:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LEV 15:21" />Weena orikora aha kitanda kye, ayozye ebijwaro bye, ayogye omu maizi, agume ari otashemeire okuhitsya omu mwabazyo. <verse eid="LEV 15:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LEV 15:22" />Kandi weena orikora aha kintu kyona eki ashutamireho, ayozye ebijwaro bye, ayogye omu maizi, agume ari otashemeire okuhitsya omu mwabazyo, <verse eid="LEV 15:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LEV 15:23" />yaaba kitanda kye nari ekintu kyona eki ashutamireho, orikikoraho aryaba otashemeire okuhitsya omu mwabazyo. <verse eid="LEV 15:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LEV 15:24" />Kandi omushaija oribyama nawe, ebirikumurugamu byamuzaho, amare ebiro mushanju ari otashemeire; kandi ekitanda kyona eki ogwo mushaija aribyamaho, kiryaba ekisiisikaire.<verse eid="LEV 15:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LEV 15:25" />Omukazi ku arimara ebiro bingi naajwa eshagama, butari bunaku bwe bw'okuza omu kwezi, nari shi yaarenzya ebiro ebi ashangwa amara omu kwezi, aryaba nk'oku ashangwa aba omu biro bye by'okuza omu kwezi; abe otashemeire. <verse eid="LEV 15:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LEV 15:26" />Ekitanda kyona eki aribyamaho omu biro byona ebi arimara arwaire ekyejwiso, kiryaba nk'ekitanda eki abyamaho omu biro bye by'okuba omu kwezi, n'ekintu kyona eki arishutamaho, kiryaba ekisiisikaire nk'ekisiisirwe okuba omu kwezi kwe. <verse eid="LEV 15:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LEV 15:27" />Orikora ahari ebyo weena aryaba otashemeire, ayozye ebijwaro bye, ayogye omu maizi, kandi agume ari otashemeire okuhitsya omu mwabazyo. <verse eid="LEV 15:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LEV 15:28" />Kwonka ku arikira ekyejwiso, ayebarire ebiro mushanju, bwanyima yaabyo aryaba oshemeire. <verse eid="LEV 15:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LEV 15:29" />Aha kiro kya munaana aryatwara obwiba bubiri nari enkombe nto ibiri, azireetere omunyamurwa aha muryango gw'Eihema ry'okubugaabuganiramu; <verse eid="LEV 15:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LEV 15:30" />omunyamurwa ahongye emwe kuba empongano y'ekibi, n'endiijo kuba ekitambo ky'okwotsya, omunyamurwa amurihiirire ahabw'okutashemera kw'ekyejwiso kye.<verse eid="LEV 15:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LEV 15:31" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">15:31: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1CO 3:17">1 Kor 3:17</ref>. </char>
    </note> Okwo nikwo muritaanisa Abaisraeli n'okutashemera kwabo, barekye kukufeeramu ahabw'okushiisha obutaaho bwangye oburi ahagati yaabo.<verse eid="LEV 15:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LEV 15:32" />Ebyo nibyo biragiro by'orikurugwamu amahira, nari orikurugwamu amaizi agarikuzaara, bikamuhindura otashemeire, <verse eid="LEV 15:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LEV 15:33" />n'eby'omukazi ori omu kwezi, n'eby'omuntu weena, omushaija nari omukazi, orikurugwamu ebirikumushiisha, n'eby'omushaija okubyama n'omukazi otashemeire.<verse eid="LEV 15:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LEV 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="LEV 16" />
  <para style="s1">Ebiragiro by'eizooba ry'okuhongyeraho empongano z'okurihiirira ebibi by'Abaisraeli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LEV 16:1" />MUKAMA yaagambira Musa bwanyima y'okufa kwa batabani ba Arooni, obu bairira omu maisho ga MUKAMA, bakafa. <verse eid="LEV 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LEV 16:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 8:10-12">1 Bag 8:10-12</ref>. </char></note> MUKAMA yaagira Musa ati: Gambira Arooni mukuru waawe, arekye kuguma naataaha buri kaanya Aharikwera omunda y'omukingo, omu maisho g'ekitebe ky'okusaasira, ekiri aha mutwe gw'eshanduukye, atakaafa; ahabw'okuba niinyija kweyorekyera omu kicu aha kitebe ky'okusaasira. <verse eid="LEV 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LEV 16:3" />Kwonka oku nikwo Arooni araagume naatwaza, yaaba naija Aharikwera, aijane enimi y'ekimasha kuba empongano y'ekibi, kandi n'empaya y'entaama y'ekitambo ky'okwotsya. <verse eid="LEV 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LEV 16:4" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 10:22">Heb 10:22</ref>. </char></note> Ajware ekooti erikwera ya bafuta, n'empare ya bafuta, bibanze aha mubiri, ayezirikise orukoba rwa bafuta, ajware n'ekikwemba kya bafuta; ebyo nibyo bijwaro ebirikwera. Abanze ayogye, bwanyima abijware. <verse eid="LEV 16:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LEV 16:5" />Aihe omu Baisraeli empaya ibiri z'embuzi kuba empongano y'ekibi, kandi n'empaya y'entaama kuba ekitambo ky'okwotsya.<verse eid="LEV 16:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LEV 16:6" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">16:6: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="HEB 5:1">Heb 5:1</ref>, <ref loc="HEB 5:2">2</ref>; <ref loc="HEB 7:27">7:27</ref>, <ref loc="HEB 7:28">28</ref>. </char>
    </note> Arooni ahongye egyo nimi kuba empongano ye ey'ekibi, ayerihiirire we n'eka ye. <verse eid="LEV 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LEV 16:7" />Bwanyima atware ezo mbuzi zombi, azite omu maisho ga MUKAMA aha muryango g'Eihema ry'okubugaabuganiramu; <verse eid="LEV 16:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LEV 16:8" />Arooni ateerere ezo mbuzi zombi enteenyu, emwe ahabwa MUKAMA, n'endi ahabwa Azazeeli. <verse eid="LEV 16:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LEV 16:9" />Arooni areete egyo mbuzi eyaakwatwa enteenyu ya MUKAMA, agitambe ebe empongano y'ekibi; <verse eid="LEV 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LEV 16:10" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:10: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CO 5:21">2 Kor 5:21</ref>. </char></note> kwonka embuzi eyaakwatwa enteenyu eya Azazeeli emurikwe omu maisho ga MUKAMA ehuriire, bagikorereho eby'okurihiirira ebibi, bagyohereze omu ihamba ahabwa Azazeeli. <verse eid="LEV 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LEV 16:11" />Bwanyima Arooni amurikye egyo nimi kuba empongano ye y'ekibi, ayerihiirire we n'eka ye; aite egyo nimi ei yaayetambirira kuba empongano y'ekibi; <verse eid="LEV 16:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LEV 16:12" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:12: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 8:3">Kush 8:3</ref>, <ref loc="REV 8:4">4</ref>. </char></note> areete ekyoterero ekiijwire amakara garikwaka, agu yaiha aha itambiro omu maisho ga MUKAMA, kandi n'empi ibiri z'obubaane bushekwire oburikutaamirana, akitware omunda y'omukingo, <verse eid="LEV 16:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LEV 16:13" />abute aha muriro omu maisho ga MUKAMA, omwika gw'obubaane gushwekye ekitebe ky'okusaasira ekiri aha Birikuhamya, ngu atafa; <verse eid="LEV 16:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LEV 16:14" />kandi atware aha shagama y'egyo nimi, agimiisiire n'orukumu rwe aha rubaju rw'ekitebe ky'okusaasira orurikureeba omu maisho, kandi agimiisiire omu maisho g'ekitebe ky'okusaasira emirundi mushanju.<verse eid="LEV 16:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LEV 16:15" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">16:15: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="HEB 6:19">Heb 6:19</ref>. </char>
    </note> Bwanyima aite egyo mbuzi y'empongano y'ekibi ey'okuhongyerera abantu, areete eshagama yaayo omunda y'omukingo, agitwaze nk'oku yaatwaza ey'enimi, agimiisiire aha kitebe ky'okusaasira n'omu maisho gaakyo; <verse eid="LEV 16:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LEV 16:16" />arihiirire atyo Aharikwera ahabw'okusiisikara kw'Abaisraeli, kandi n'ahabw'eby'okushiisha byabo, n'ebibi byabo byona; kandi abe nikwo yaatwaza Eihema ry'okubugaabuganiramu, eri batuura naryo omu kusiisikara kwabo. <verse eid="LEV 16:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LEV 16:17" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:17: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 1:10">Luk 1:10</ref>. </char></note> Hatarigira owaaguma omu Ihema ry'okubugaabuganiramu, Arooni yaaba naataaha Aharikwera kukora eby'okurihiirira, okuhitsya obu araarugyemu, yaaheza kwerihiirira we n'eka ye n'eihanga rya Israeli ryona. <verse eid="LEV 16:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LEV 16:18" />Bwanyima ashohore aze aha itambiro eriri omu maisho ga MUKAMA, aririhiirire, kandi atware aha shagama y'egyo nimi n'ey'egyo mbuzi, agite aha mahembe g'eitambiro aha nshonda zoona; <verse eid="LEV 16:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LEV 16:19" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:19: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 43:20">Ezk 43:20</ref>. </char></note> akore ahari egyo shagama, agimiisiire aha itambiro n'orukumu rwe emirundi mushanju, arishemeze, aryeze, rirugweho okusiisikara kw'Abaisraeli.<verse eid="LEV 16:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LEV 16:20" />Arooni ku araaheze kurihiirira Aharikwera n'Eihema ry'okubugaabuganiramu n'eitambiro, areete egyo mbuzi ehuriire; <verse eid="LEV 16:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LEV 16:21" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:21: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 53:6">Isa 53:6</ref>; <ref loc="1PE 2:24">1 Pet 2:24</ref>. </char></note> ate engaro ze zombi aha mutwe gwayo, agyaturireho eby'okutahikiirira by'Abaisraeli byona n'eby'okushiisha byabo byona; ebyo bibi byabo byona abite aha mutwe gw'egyo mbuzi agyohereze omu ihamba etwarwe omuntu oyeteekateekyeire omurimo ogwo; <verse eid="LEV 16:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LEV 16:22" />egyo mbuzi eyekorere eby'okutahikiirira byabo byona, ebitware omu nsi etatuurwamu bantu, agirekure eze omu ihamba. <verse eid="LEV 16:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LEV 16:23" />Bwanyima Arooni ataahe omu Ihema ry'okubugaabuganiramu, ajuure eby'okujwara bya bafuta, ebi yaajwara naataaha Aharikwera, abitsigyeyo; <verse eid="LEV 16:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LEV 16:24" />ayogyere omubiri gwe omu mwanya gurikwera, ajware ebijwaro bye, ashohore, ayetambirire ekitambo ky'okwotsya, atambe n'eky'abantu, ayerihiirire, arihiirire n'abantu. <verse eid="LEV 16:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LEV 16:25" />Ebishaju by'egyo mpongano y'ekibi abyokyeze aha itambiro. <verse eid="LEV 16:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LEV 16:26" />Kandi orekwire egyo mbuzi ahabwa Azazeeli, ayozye ebijwaro bye, ayogye n'omubiri gwe, abone kugaruka omu rusiisira. <verse eid="LEV 16:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LEV 16:27" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:27: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 13:11">Heb 13:11</ref>. </char></note> Reero egyo nimi y'empongano y'ekibi n'egyo embuzi y'empongano y'ekibi, ebi eshagama yaabyo yaataahibwa Aharikwera kukora eby'okurihiirira ebibi, babyekorere, babitware aheeru y'orusiisira, bootsye empu zaabyo n'enyama zaabyo n'efa yaabyo omu muriro. <verse eid="LEV 16:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LEV 16:28" />Oraaheze kubyotsya ayozye ebijwaro bye, ayogye omubiri gwe, bwanyima agarukye omu rusiisira. <verse eid="LEV 16:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LEV 16:29" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:29: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 29:7">Kub 29:7</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 58:3">Isa 58:3</ref>, <ref loc="ISA 58:5">5</ref>. </char></note> Ekyo kigume kiri ekiragiro ekibateereirweho ekitahwaho; omu kwezi kwa mushanju aha kiro kya ikumi eky'okwo kwezi, muryaguma mwebonabonese, mutarikikoreraho omurimo gwona, n'obu yaakuba omuntu enzaarwa, nari omunyaihanga oshuhuukiire omuriimwe; <verse eid="LEV 16:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LEV 16:30" />ahakuba aha kiro ekyo nikyo muriguma nimurihiiririrwaho kushemezibwa; obwo muryaba abashemeziibweho ebibi byanyu byona omu maisho ga MUKAMA. <verse eid="LEV 16:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LEV 16:31" />Eizooba eryo riryababeera sabato ey'okuruhuukiraho, muryayebonabonesa; n'ekiragiro ekitairweho okuhitsya ebiro byona. <verse eid="LEV 16:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LEV 16:32" />Kandi omunyamurwa oriba waashukirweho amajuta, akashoroorwa kuba omunyamurwa omu mwanya gwa ishe, niwe ariguma naabarihiirira, ajwaire ebyo bijwaro birikwera bya bafuta; <verse eid="LEV 16:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LEV 16:33" />kandi arihiirire Omwanya ogurikwera, arihiirire Eihema ry'okubugaabuganiramu n'eitambiro; kandi arihiirire abanyamurwa n'abantu b'eihanga boona. <verse eid="LEV 16:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LEV 16:34" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:34: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 9:7">Heb 9:7</ref>. </char></note> Kandi eki kibabeere ekiragiro ekitairweho ekitarihwaho, Abaisraeli kuguma nibarihiirirwa ahabw'ebibi byabo byona rimwe omu mwaka. Musa yaakora nk'oku MUKAMA yaamuragiire.<verse eid="LEV 16:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LEV 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="LEV 17" />
  <para style="s1">Mukama okuzibira Abaisraeli kubaagira ahandi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LEV 17:1" />MUKAMA yaagambira Musa ati: <verse eid="LEV 17:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LEV 17:2" />Gambira Arooni n'abatabani n'Abaisraeli boona oti: Eki nikyo MUKAMA yaaragiira naagira ati: <verse eid="LEV 17:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LEV 17:3" />Omuntu weena ow'omu nju ya Israeli oribaagira ente nari omwana gw'entaama nari embuzi omu rusiisira, nari origibaagira aheeru yaarwo, <verse eid="LEV 17:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LEV 17:4" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 32:2">Zab 32:2</ref>; <ref loc="1KI 14:22">1 Bag 14:22</ref>, <ref loc="1KI 14:23">23</ref>. </char></note> atagitware ha muryango gw'Eihema ry'okubugaabuganiramu, kugihongyera MUKAMA omu maisho g'obutaaho bwe, ogwo muntu aryakwatwa orubanja rw'egyo shagama; n'omuntu oseesire eshagama; kandi omuntu ogwo aryacuubwa omu ihanga rye; <verse eid="LEV 17:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LEV 17:5" />ebyo byaragiirwa ngu ebitambo ebi Abaisraeli baraagume baitira omu ishwa, babireetere MUKAMA aha muryango gw'Eihema ry'okubugaabuganiramu, babiheereze omunyamurwa, abitambe, bibe empongano z'okusiima MUKAMA ahabw'obusingye. <verse eid="LEV 17:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LEV 17:6" />Obwo omunyamurwa amiisire eshagama yaabyo aha itambiro rya MUKAMA aha muryango gw'Eihema ry'okubugaabuganiramu, ayotsye ebishaju, bibe ekisooroora kirungi ahari MUKAMA. <verse eid="LEV 17:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LEV 17:7" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:7: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 11:15">2 Bus 11:15</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 10:20">1 Kor 10:20</ref>. </char></note> N'ahabw'ekyo batarigaruka kuhongyera baadaimoni ebitambo byabo, abu barikwenda kukurata kuraaya nabo. Ekyo kibe ekiragiro ekibateereirweho ebiro byona omu busingye bwabo bwona. <verse eid="LEV 17:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LEV 17:8" />Kandi obagire oti: Omuntu weena ow'omu nju ya Israeli nari ow'omu banyamahanga ababashuhuukiiremu, oritamba ekitambo eky'okwotsya nari ekindi, <verse eid="LEV 17:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LEV 17:9" />atakireetsire ha muryango gw'Eihema ry'okubugaabuganiramu kukitambira MUKAMA, ogwo muntu aryacuubwa omu ihanga rye.<verse eid="LEV 17:9" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ebiragiro by'eshagama</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LEV 17:10" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">17:10: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 44:11">Yer 44:11</ref>. </char>
    </note> Omuntu weena ow'omu nju ya Israeli nari ow'omu banyamahanga obashuhuukiiremu, orirya eshagama yoona, ndyamuta aha kaso, mmucwe omu ihanga rye. <verse eid="LEV 17:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LEV 17:11" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:11: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="COL 1:14">Kol 1:14</ref>; <ref loc="1JN 1:7">1 Yoh 1:7</ref>; <ref loc="HEB 9:22">Heb 9:22</ref>. </char></note> Mumanye ngu amagara g'omubiri gaba omu shagama; nikyo naagibaheera kushukwa aha itambiro ngu erihiirire amagara gaanyu; eshagama niyo erihiirira ahabw'okuba erimu amagara. <verse eid="LEV 17:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LEV 17:12" />Nikyo naagambirira Abaisraeli nti: Hatarigira omuntu weena omuriimwe owaarya eshagama, n'obu yaakuba omunyaihanga obashuhuukiiremu. <verse eid="LEV 17:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LEV 17:13" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:13: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 24:7">Ezk 24:7</ref>. </char></note> Kandi omuntu weena omu Baisraeli nari ow'omu banyamahanga obashuhuukiiremu, oriita enyamaishwa erikuriibwa nari enyonyi ahiigire, ayate eshagama yaayo ahansi, agishwekye eiju; <verse eid="LEV 17:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LEV 17:14" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:14: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 9:4">Kut 9:4</ref>. </char></note> ahabw'okuba amagara g'ekihangirwe kyona gaba omu shagama yaakyo; nikyo ngiriire Abaisraeli nti: Mutarirya eshagama y'ekihangirwe kyona; ahakuba amagara g'ekihangirwe kyona gaba omu shagama yaakyo; origirya weena, aryacuubwa. <verse eid="LEV 17:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LEV 17:15" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:15: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 4:14">Ezk 4:14</ref>. </char></note> Kandi omuntu weena orirya ekintu kyona ekyefeereire, nari ekiitsirwe enyamaishwa, yaaba muntu enzaarwa nari omunyaihanga, aryayozya ebijwaro bye, ayogye omu maizi, kandi agume ari otashemeire okuhitsya omu mwabazyo; obwo aryaba oshemeire. <verse eid="LEV 17:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LEV 17:16" />Kwonka ku ariba atabyogize, nawe akooga, orubanja rw'okutahikiirira ruryamugumaho.<verse eid="LEV 17:16" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LEV 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="LEV 18" />
  <para style="s1">Ebirikuzira omu kushwererana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LEV 18:1" />MUKAMA yaagambira Musa ati: <verse eid="LEV 18:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LEV 18:2" />Gambira Abaisraeli ebi ndikugamba ningira nti: Niinye MUKAMA Ruhanga waanyu. <verse eid="LEV 18:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LEV 18:3" />Mutarikora nk'oku Abanyamisri bakora omu nsi yaabo ei mwabaire mutwiremu; kandi mutarikora nk'oku Abanyakanaani barikukora omu nsi yaabo ei ndikubatwaramu. Buzima mutarikuratira ebiragiro byabo. <verse eid="LEV 18:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LEV 18:4" />Ebi ndikubaragiira mube nibyo mwahurira, ebiragiro byangye mubyorobere mubigyenderemu. Niinye MUKAMA Ruhanga waanyu. <verse eid="LEV 18:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LEV 18:5" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 10:28">Luk 10:28</ref>; <ref loc="ROM 10:5">Rom 10:5</ref>. </char></note> N'ahabw'ekyo mugume mworobere ebiragiro byangye n'ebi ndikuragiira; oribyorobera biryamuhaisa amagara. Niinye MUKAMA.<verse eid="LEV 18:5" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Abu omushaija arikuzibirwa kubyama nabo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LEV 18:6" />Hatarigira owaahika omunyabuzaare weena omuri haihi kumujweka busha. Niinye MUKAMA. <verse eid="LEV 18:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LEV 18:7" />Otarijweka sho busha, ahakuba enjuuro ya sho nikyo kimwe n'eya nyoko; niwe nyoko; otarimujweka busha. <verse eid="LEV 18:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LEV 18:8" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:8: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 5:1">1 Kor 5:1</ref>. </char></note> Otarijweka busha muka sho; ahakuba n'enjuuro ya sho. <verse eid="LEV 18:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LEV 18:9" />Otarijweka busha munyaanyoko, owa sho nari owa nyoko, yaaba azairwe omuka nari ahandi. <verse eid="LEV 18:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LEV 18:10" />Otarijweka busha muhara wa mutabani waawe, nari muhara wa muhara waawe; ahakuba enjuuro yaabo niyo yaawe. <verse eid="LEV 18:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LEV 18:11" />Otarijweka busha muhara wa muka sho, ozairwe sho, ahakuba ni munyaanyoko. <verse eid="LEV 18:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LEV 18:12" />Otarijweka busha shwenkazi; ahakuba aine obuzaare bwa haihi na sho. <verse eid="LEV 18:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LEV 18:13" />Otarijweka busha nyokwento, ahakuba aine obuzaare bwa haihi na nyoko. <verse eid="LEV 18:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LEV 18:14" />Otarijweka busha shwento, nikwo kuhika omukazi we; ahakuba ni muka shwento. <verse eid="LEV 18:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LEV 18:15" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:15: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 38:18">Kut 38:18</ref>. </char></note> Otarijweka busha muka mwana waawe; ahakuba ni muka mutabani waawe, otarimujweka busha. <verse eid="LEV 18:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LEV 18:16" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:16: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 14:3">Mat 14:3</ref>, <ref loc="MAT 14:4">4</ref>. </char></note> Otarijweka busha muka mwene sho, ahakuba enjuuro ye n'eya mwene sho. <verse eid="LEV 18:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LEV 18:17" />Otarijweka busha omukazi na muhara we, kandi otaritwara muhara wa mutabani we nari owa muhara we, okabajweka busha; ahabw'okuba baine obuzaare bwa haihi n'omukazi waawe; ekyo n'ekibi kihango. <verse eid="LEV 18:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LEV 18:18" />Otarishwera omukazi na mwene nyina kumumuharika, okamujweka busha, mwene nyina akiriho.<verse eid="LEV 18:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LEV 18:19" />Otarijweka busha omukazi akiri omu kwezi, atakashemeire. <verse eid="LEV 18:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LEV 18:20" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:20: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 6:9">1 Kor 6:9</ref>. </char></note> Otaribyama na muka mutaahi waawe, okamwesiisisa. <verse eid="LEV 18:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LEV 18:21" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:21: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 16:3">2 Bag 16:3</ref>; <ref loc="JER 19:5">Yer 19:5</ref>. </char></note> Otarihayo n'omwe omu ruzaaro rwawe kumutambira Moleki, okajumisa eiziina rya Ruhanga waawe. Niinye MUKAMA. <verse eid="LEV 18:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LEV 18:22" />Otarigira omushaija omukazi; ahabw'okuba n'ekihagaro. <verse eid="LEV 18:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LEV 18:23" />Otaribyama n'enyamaishwa yoona okagyesiisisa; nari omukazi weena otaryeha enyamaishwa kubyama nayo; n'okukora ebitari by'obuhangwa.<verse eid="LEV 18:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LEV 18:24" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">18:24: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 15:18">Mat 15:18</ref>. </char>
    </note> Mutarigira eki mwayesiisisa ahari ebyo byona; ahakuba ebi nibyo amahanga gu ndikubinga omu maisho gaanyu gaayesiisiise, <verse eid="LEV 18:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LEV 18:25" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:25: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 24:5">Isa 24:5</ref>. </char></note> ensi yaabo ekasiisikara; nikyo ndikugitura ahabw'okutahikiirira kwayo, ekatanaka abagitwiremu. <verse eid="LEV 18:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LEV 18:26" />Kwonka imwe mugume mworobere ebiragiro byangye n'ebi naataireho, kandi mutakora na kimwe aha bihagaro ebyo byona, yaaba muntu enzaarwa nari omunyaihanga obashuhuukiiremu; <verse eid="LEV 18:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LEV 18:27" />(ahakuba ebyo bihagaro nibyo abantu b'ensi egi abababandiize baakozire, ensi ekasiisikara); <verse eid="LEV 18:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LEV 18:28" />naimwe ensi ekabatanaka ahabw'okugishiisha, nk'oku yaatanakire eihanga eryababandiize. <verse eid="LEV 18:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LEV 18:29" />Ahabw'okuba omuntu weena orikora ekihagaro kyona ahari ebyo, abantu abaribikora baryacuubwa omu ihanga ryabo. <verse eid="LEV 18:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LEV 18:30" />N'ahabw'ekyo mworobere ebi ndikubaragiira; mutarikora emicwe egyo yoona erikunugwa, ei abababandiize baakozire, mukabyesiisisa. Niinye MUKAMA Ruhanga waanyu.<verse eid="LEV 18:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LEV 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="LEV 19" />
  <para style="s1">Ebiragiro ebitari bimwe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LEV 19:1" />Kandi MUKAMA yaagira Musa ati: <verse eid="LEV 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LEV 19:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1TH 4:7">1 Tes 4:7</ref>. </char></note> Gambira eihanga ry'Abaisraeli ryona ebi ndikugamba ningira nti: Mushemereire kuba abarikwera; ahakuba Nyowe MUKAMA Ruhanga waanyu ndi orikwera. <verse eid="LEV 19:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LEV 19:3" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NEH 13:15-21">Neh 13:15-21</ref>. </char></note> Omuntu weena omuriimwe ashemereire kutiina nyina na ishe; kandi mugume murinde sabato zangye. Niinye MUKAMA Ruhanga waanyu. <verse eid="LEV 19:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LEV 19:4" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 10:14">1 Kor 10:14</ref>. </char></note> Mutarihindukira ebishushani ebirikuramibwa, n'obu kwakuba okweheeshera baaruhanga b'ebishushani. Niinye MUKAMA Ruhanga waanyu.<verse eid="LEV 19:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LEV 19:5" />Ku muritambira MUKAMA ebitambo by'empongano y'okusiima ahabw'obusingye, muryaguma mubihongye omu buryo obu murikubaasa kwikiririzibwamu. <verse eid="LEV 19:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LEV 19:6" />Ekyo kitambo kiriibwe aha izooba eri murikihongyeraho, n'eririkurataho; ekiriba kyatsigaireho okuhitsya aha izooba rya kashatu, kyokibwe omu muriro. <verse eid="LEV 19:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LEV 19:7" />Ku kiririibwaho aha izooba rya kashatu, kiryaba ekirikunugwa; tikiriikirizibwa; <verse eid="LEV 19:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LEV 19:8" />kandi omuntu weena orikiryaho, orubanja rw'okutahikiirira ruryamugumaho, ahabw'okuba aryaba asiisire ekintu kya MUKAMA ekirikwera; ogwo muntu aryacuubwa omu ihanga rye.<verse eid="LEV 19:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LEV 19:9" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">19:9: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LEV 23:22">Lev 23:22</ref>; <ref loc="RUT 2:15">Rus 2:15</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ku murishaaruura emyaka y'omu nsi yaanyu, mutarishaaruurira kimwe n'ey'aha mbibi, n'obu kwakuba okuhumba ebitsigairemu bwanyima y'okugyesha. <verse eid="LEV 19:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LEV 19:10" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:10: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ECC 5:8">Mub 5:8</ref>. </char></note> Otarishoroma emizaabibu yaawe okagiherezamu kimwe, n'obu kwakuba okutorotoora eragarikire; ogitsigire enshoberwa n'omushuhuuki. Niinye MUKAMA Ruhanga waanyu. <verse eid="LEV 19:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LEV 19:11" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:11: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 4:25">Efe 4:25</ref>. </char></note> Mutariiba, mutarigobya, kandi mutaribeihana. <verse eid="LEV 19:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LEV 19:12" />Mutarirahirira busha eiziina ryangye, mukajumisa eiziina rya Ruhanga waanyu. Niinye MUKAMA.<verse eid="LEV 19:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LEV 19:13" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">19:13: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JAS 5:4">Yak 5:4</ref>. </char>
    </note> Otariita kubi mugyenzi waawe nari kumunyaga. Otariraara n'ebihembo ebi omukozi akoreire okuhitsya omu kasheeshe. <verse eid="LEV 19:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LEV 19:14" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:14: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 14:13">Rom 14:13</ref>. </char></note> Otarikyeena ekifa-matu, kandi otaritega empumi eky'okugiteeza entsibo, kureka ogume otiine Ruhanga waawe. Niinye MUKAMA.<verse eid="LEV 19:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LEV 19:15" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">19:15: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JAS 2:9">Yak 2:9</ref>. </char>
    </note> Otarikora ebitari by'oburyo omu kucwa emanja; otarigwera orubaju rw'omworo, n'obu kwakuba okweta aha kitiinisa ky'omukuru; kureka ocwere mutaahi waawe orubanja rw'oburyo. <verse eid="LEV 19:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LEV 19:16" />Otarigyendagyenda noogambuura abantu omu bantu b'owaanyu; kandi otariba mushinja w'ebishuba kwitisa mutaahi waawe. Niinye MUKAMA.<verse eid="LEV 19:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LEV 19:17" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">19:17: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1JN 2:9">1 Yoh 2:9</ref>, <ref loc="1JN 2:11">11</ref>; <ref loc="1JN 3:15">3:15</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 17:3">Luk 17:3</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 5:43">Mat 5:43</ref>, <ref loc="MAT 5:44">44</ref>. </char>
    </note> Otaryangira mwene waanyu aha mutima, kureka oshemereire kuhana mutaahi waawe, otakaagiibwaho orubanja ahabwe. <verse eid="LEV 19:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LEV 19:18" />Otarihoora abantu b'eihanga ryawe, n'obu kwakuba okubagiraho enziika; kureka okunde mutaahi waawe, nk'oku oyekunda. Niinye MUKAMA.<verse eid="LEV 19:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LEV 19:19" />Mugume mworobere ebiragiro byangye. Otaryemesa amatungo gaawe aha nyamaishwa ezitari z'oruganda rwago; otaribiba omu musiri gwawe embibo z'emiringo ebiri; kandi otarijwara ekijwaro kibaziire omu myenda y'emiringo ebiri.<verse eid="LEV 19:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LEV 19:20" />Omuntu ku aribyama n'omuzaana, orikugambwa ondiijo mushaija obugyenyi, omuzaana ogwo atakacungwirwe nari atakarekwirwe, ebyabo biryayetegyerezibwa, kwonka tibariitwa, ahabw'okuba omukazi abaire atakarekwirwe. <verse eid="LEV 19:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LEV 19:21" />Kwonka ogwo mushaija areetere MUKAMA empongano y'okwihaho orubanja aha muryango gw'Eihema ry'okubugaabuganiramu, empaya y'entaama kuba empongano y'okwihaho orubanja; <verse eid="LEV 19:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LEV 19:22" />omunyamurwa amurihiirire omu maisho ga MUKAMA empaya y'entaama kuba empongano y'okwihaho orubanja rw'ekibi eki akozire, nawe aryasaasirwa ekyo kibi ki akozire.<verse eid="LEV 19:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LEV 19:23" />Ku murihika omu nsi egyo, mwabyara emiti y'emiringo yoona ahabw'ebyokurya, mubanze mutwaze ebijuma byayo nk'ebitarikwikirizibwa kuriibwa; muryamara emyaka eshatu mutarikubiikirizibwa; bitaririibwaho. <verse eid="LEV 19:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LEV 19:24" />Kandi omu mwaka gwa kana ebijuma byayo byona biryaba ebirikwera, empongano y'okuhimbisa MUKAMA. <verse eid="LEV 19:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LEV 19:25" />Kwonka omu mwaka gwa kataano muryaikirizibwa kurya aha bijuma byayo, egyo miti ebone kuguma neebeerera munonga. Niinye MUKAMA Ruhanga waanyu.<verse eid="LEV 19:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LEV 19:26" />Mutarirya ekintu kyona n'eshagama yaakyo; mutariroga n'obu kwakuba okuragura. <verse eid="LEV 19:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LEV 19:27" />Mutaritega ebyeyera, mutarishiisha omu mbaju z'ebireju byanyu. <verse eid="LEV 19:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LEV 19:28" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:28: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 14:1">Bir 14:1</ref>. </char></note> Mutarishara emibiri yaanyu ahabw'okuba omu rufu, kandi mutaricwa engondo. Niinye MUKAMA.<verse eid="LEV 19:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LEV 19:29" />Otarishiisha muhara waawe, okamuhindura maraaya, ensi erekye kwohokyera omu bushambani, ekaijura obubi. <verse eid="LEV 19:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LEV 19:30" />Mugume murinde sabato zangye, muhe ekitiinisa Omwanya gwangye ogurikwera. Niinye MUKAMA.<verse eid="LEV 19:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LEV 19:31" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">19:31: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 8:10">Isa 8:10</ref>. </char>
    </note> Mutariimuurira aha barikubandwa emizimu n'obu baakuba abarogi; mutaribasherura, bakabashiisha. Niinye MUKAMA Ruhanga waanyu.<verse eid="LEV 19:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LEV 19:32" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">19:32: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1TI 5:1">1 Tim 5:1</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ogume oimukire ow'enju, n'omugurusi omuhe ekitiinisa, kandi otiine Ruhanga waawe. Niinye MUKAMA.<verse eid="LEV 19:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LEV 19:33" />Omunyaihanga ku arishuhuukira owaanyu omu nsi yaanyu, otarimwita kubi; <verse eid="LEV 19:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LEV 19:34" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:34: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 10:19">Bir 10:19</ref>. </char></note> omunyaihanga oribashuhuukiramu abe nk'enzaarwa omuriimwe, omukunde nk'oku oyekunda; ahabw'okuba naimwe mukaba muri abanyaihanga omu nsi ya Misri. Niinye MUKAMA Ruhanga waanyu.<verse eid="LEV 19:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LEV 19:35" />Mutarikora ebitari by'oburyo omu kucwa emanja, omu kugyera oburaingwa, nari oburemeezi, nari obwingi. <verse eid="LEV 19:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LEV 19:36" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:36: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PRO 20:10">Enf 20:10</ref>. </char></note> Mugire eminzaani ehikire, amabaare gahikire, eefa ehikire na hiini ehikire. Niinye MUKAMA Ruhanga waanyu owaabaihire omu nsi ya Misri. <verse eid="LEV 19:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LEV 19:37" />Mugume mworobere ebiragiro byangye byona n'emigyenzo ei naataireho yoona, mubikore. Niinye MUKAMA.<verse eid="LEV 19:37" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LEV 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="LEV 20" />
  <para style="s1">Ebifubiro ebishemereire abarikushiisha ebiragiro</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LEV 20:1" />MUKAMA yaagira Musa ati: <verse eid="LEV 20:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LEV 20:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 33:6">2 Bus 33:6</ref>. </char></note> Garuka ogambire Abaisraeli ebigambo ebi: Omuntu weena ow'omu Baisraeli nari ow'omu banyamahanga abarikubashuhuukiramu, oritambira Moleki omwe aha b'omu ruzaaro rwe, ashemereire kwitwa, ab'omuri egyo nsi bakamuteera amabaare. <verse eid="LEV 20:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LEV 20:3" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 19:20">Kub 19:20</ref>. </char></note> Naanye ndyareeba kubi ogwo mushaija, mmucwe omu ihanga rye, nimmutura okuha Moleki omwe aha b'omu ruzaaro rwe, n'okushiisha Omwanya gwangye ogurikwera, akajumisa eiziina ryangye eririkwera. <verse eid="LEV 20:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LEV 20:4" />Abantu b'omu nsi egyo ku baryehuzya ogwo mushaija, ohaire Moleki omwe aha b'omu ruzaaro rwe, bataamwita, <verse eid="LEV 20:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LEV 20:5" />ndyaguma nindeeba kubi ogwo mushaija hamwe n'ab'omu ka ye, mmucwe omu ihanga ryabo hamwe n'abandi boona abarikumukuratira, bakeehongyera Moleki, bakamuramya nk'abarikuraaya.<verse eid="LEV 20:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LEV 20:6" />Kandi omuntu oriimuurira aha bantu abarikubandwa emizimu n'abarogi, abarikubakuratira nk'abarikuraaya, ndyareeba kubi ogwo muntu, mmucwe omu ihanga rye. <verse eid="LEV 20:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LEV 20:7" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:7: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 5:48">Mat 5:48</ref>; <ref loc="COL 3:12">Kol 3:12</ref>. </char></note> N'ahabw'ekyo mweyeze, mube abarikwera; ahakuba Niinye MUKAMA Ruhanga waanyu. <verse eid="LEV 20:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LEV 20:8" />Mugume mworobere ebiragiro byangye, kandi mukore ebi naataireho. Niinye MUKAMA orikubeeza. <verse eid="LEV 20:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LEV 20:9" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:9: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 15:4">Mat 15:4</ref>. </char></note> Omuntu weena orikyeena ishe nari nyina aitwe; ahabw'okukyeena ishe nari nyina, orubanja rw'eshagama ye rube ahariwe.<verse eid="LEV 20:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LEV 20:10" />Omuntu ku arishambana na muka mutaahi we, bombi kishambana na kishambanisibwa, baitwe. <verse eid="LEV 20:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LEV 20:11" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:11: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 27:23">Bir 27:23</ref>. </char></note> Omushaija ku aribyama na muka ishe, aryaba ajwekire ishe busha; bombi baitwe; orubanja rw'eshagama yaabo rubabeho. <verse eid="LEV 20:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LEV 20:12" />Omuntu ku aribyama n'omukaamwana, bombi baitwe; baryaba bakozire ekitakorwa; orubanja rw'eshagama yaabo rubabeho. <verse eid="LEV 20:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LEV 20:13" />Omushaija ku arihindura mugyenzi we omukazi, bombi baryaba bakozire ekihagaro, baitwe; orubanja rw'eshagama yaabo rubabeho. <verse eid="LEV 20:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LEV 20:14" />Omushaija ku arishwera omukazi na nyina, kiryaba kiri ekibi kihango, we nabo bookibwe, ekibi kyona kirekye kuba omuriimwe. <verse eid="LEV 20:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LEV 20:15" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:15: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 27:21">Bir 27:21</ref>. </char></note> Omushaija ku aribyama n'enyamaishwa, aitwe, kandi mwite n'egyo nyamaishwa. <verse eid="LEV 20:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LEV 20:16" />Omukazi ku arihika enyamaishwa, yaabyama nayo, mwite ogwo mukazi n'egyo nyamaishwa; buzima bishemereire kwitwa; kandi orubanja rw'eshagama yaabyo rukabibaho.<verse eid="LEV 20:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LEV 20:17" />Omuntu ku aritwara munyaanya, owa ishe nari owa nyina, baareebana bajwaire busha, kiryaba ekihemu; babacwere omu maisho g'eihanga ryabo; ahakuba ajwekire busha munyaanya; orubanja rw'okutahikiirira ruryamugumaho. <verse eid="LEV 20:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LEV 20:18" />Omushaija ku aribyama n'omukazi ori omu kwezi, yaamujweka busha, aryaba ajwekire busha okujwa kwe, n'omukazi nawe aryaba ajwekire busha okujwa kwe; bombi bacuubwe omu ihanga ryabo. <verse eid="LEV 20:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LEV 20:19" />Otarijweka busha nyokwento nari shwenkazi; ahabw'okuba okwo n'okujweka busha ow'obuzaare bwa haihi; mwembi orubanja rw'okutahikiirira ruryabagumaho. <verse eid="LEV 20:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LEV 20:20" />Omushaija ku aribyama na muka ishento, aryaba ajwekire busha ishento; baryagiibwaho ekibi kyabo, bafe bucwekye. <verse eid="LEV 20:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LEV 20:21" />Omushaija ku aritwara muka mwene ishe, kiryaba kiri okweshiisha; aryaba ajwekire busha mwene ishe; baryafa bucwekye.<verse eid="LEV 20:21" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Omutaano gw'Abaisraeli n'abandi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LEV 20:22" />N'ahabw'ekyo mugume mworobere ebiragiro byangye byona n'emigyenzo ei naataireho yoona, mubikore, ensi ei ndikubatwara kutuuramu erekye kubatanaka. <verse eid="LEV 20:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LEV 20:23" />Mutaritooreza emicwe y'eihanga eri ndikubinga omu maisho gaanyu; ahakuba ebyo byona nibyo baakozire, bikandeetera okubangira kimwe. <verse eid="LEV 20:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LEV 20:24" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:24: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 7:6">Bir 7:6</ref>; <ref loc="1PE 2:9">1 Pet 2:9</ref>. </char></note> Kwonka imwe nkabagira nti: Muryahungura ensi yaabo, ngibahe, ebe eyaanyu, ensi ey'amate n'obwoki. Niinye MUKAMA Ruhanga waanyu owaabataaniise n'agandi mahanga. <verse eid="LEV 20:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LEV 20:25" />N'ahabw'ekyo mushemereire kutaanisa omu nyamaishwa ezitarikuzira n'ezirikuzira, n'enyonyi ezitarikuzira n'ezirikuzira; mutaryesiisisa enyamaishwa nari enyonyi nari ekintu kyona ekirikugyendera ahansi, eki naabataaniise nakyo, ngu kigume kiri ekirikuzira ahariimwe. <verse eid="LEV 20:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LEV 20:26" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:26: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 99:5">Zab 99:5</ref>; <ref loc="TIT 2:14">Tit 2:14</ref>. </char></note> Muryaba abarikwera ahariinye; ahabw'okuba Nyowe MUKAMA ndi orikwera, kandi nkabataanisa n'amahanga agandi, ngu mubone kuba abantu bangye.<verse eid="LEV 20:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LEV 20:27" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">20:27: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1SA 28:7">1 Sam 28:7</ref>. </char>
    </note> Omushaija nari omukazi orikubandwa emizimu nari orikuroga, aitwe; babateere amabaare; orubanja rw'eshagama yaabo rubabeho.<verse eid="LEV 20:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LEV 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="LEV 21" />
  <para style="s1">Ebiragiro by'okuheereza kw'abanyamurwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LEV 21:1" />MUKAMA yaagira Musa ati: Gambira abanyamurwa batabani ba Arooni, noobagira oti: Hatarigira omuntu omuriimwe owaayeshiisha ahabw'omuntu ofiire omu ruganda rwe, <verse eid="LEV 21:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LEV 21:2" />kureka ahabw'ow'obuzaare obumuri haihi munonga, nka nyina, ishe, omutabani, muhara we, mwene ishe, <verse eid="LEV 21:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LEV 21:3" />nari munyaanya otakamanyaga mushaija, (omuri haihi, ahakuba takashweirwe; ahabw'ogwo naikirizibwa kweshiisha). <verse eid="LEV 21:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LEV 21:4" />Ataryeshiisha, akeegayisa, ahabw'okuba n'omuntu mukuru omu ihanga rye. <verse eid="LEV 21:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LEV 21:5" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 44:20">Ezk 44:20</ref>. </char></note> Bataryemwa eishokye aha kazingiro, bataritega omu mbaju z'ebireju byabo, n'obu kwakuba okwecwa engondo. <verse eid="LEV 21:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LEV 21:6" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:6: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 15:4">Zab 15:4</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 5:33-37">Mat 5:33-37</ref>. </char></note> Babe abeereziibwe Ruhanga waabo, barekye kujumisa eiziina rye; ahakuba nibo bahongyera MUKAMA empongano z'okwotsya n'omuriro, nibyo by'okurya bya Ruhanga waabo; n'ahabw'ekyo bashemereire kuba abarikwera. <verse eid="LEV 21:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LEV 21:7" />Batarishwera maraaya nari omukazi osiisirwe, nari oshenzirwe iba; ahakuba omunyamurwa n'orikwera ahari Ruhanga we. <verse eid="LEV 21:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LEV 21:8" />Nikyo orimwereza, ahakuba niwe ahonga eby'okurya bya Ruhanga waawe; aryaguma ari orikwera ahariiwe; ahabw'okuba nyowe MUKAMA orikubeeza ndi orikwera. <verse eid="LEV 21:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LEV 21:9" />Kandi muhara w'omunyamurwa weena, ku aryeshiisha, yaaba maraaya, biri ajumiise ishe; ayokibwe omu muriro.<verse eid="LEV 21:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LEV 21:10" />Oriba ari omunyamurwa omukuru omuri beene ishe, owaashukirwe amajuta aha mutwe, akeezibwa kujwara ebyo bijwaro by'obunyamurwa bukuru, atarizingurura eishokye rye, n'obu kwakuba okutaagura ebijwaro bye; <verse eid="LEV 21:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LEV 21:11" />atarihika aha mutumbi gwona, kandi ataryeshiisha n'omutumbi gwa ishe nari ogwa nyina. <verse eid="LEV 21:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LEV 21:12" />Atarishohora kuruga omu Mwanya ogurikwera gwa Ruhanga we, n'obu kwakuba okugushiisha; ahabw'okuba okushoroorwa, oku yaashoroirwe naashukwaho amajuta ga Ruhanga we, kumuriho. Niinye MUKAMA. <verse eid="LEV 21:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LEV 21:13" />Kandi ashemereire kushwera omwishiki otakamanyaga mushaija; <verse eid="LEV 21:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LEV 21:14" />atarishwera omufaakazi, nari oshenzirwe, nari osiisirwe, nari maraaya; kureka ashwere omwishiki w'eihanga rye otakamanyaga mushaija, <verse eid="LEV 21:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LEV 21:15" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:15: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 3:16">1 Kor 3:16</ref>, <ref loc="1CO 3:17">17</ref>. </char></note> arekye kujumisa abaana be omu ihanga rye; ahakuba niinye MUKAMA orikumweza.<verse eid="LEV 21:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LEV 21:16" />MUKAMA yaagira Musa ati: <verse eid="LEV 21:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LEV 21:17" />Gambira Arooni oti: Omuntu weena ow'omu ruzaaro rwawe omu busingye bwabo bwona oine akamogo, atariikirizibwa kuhika haihi, kuhongyera Ruhanga we eby'okurya; <verse eid="LEV 21:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LEV 21:18" />ahakuba omuntu weena oine akamogo tarikwikirizibwa kwirira haihi, yaaba ari empumi nari ekirema nari okokoire enyindo, nari ekimuga, <verse eid="LEV 21:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LEV 21:19" />nari owaahendekire ekigyere nari engaro, <verse eid="LEV 21:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LEV 21:20" />nari ow'eibango nari ekipimpiri, nari oine eshongo, nari orwaire obuhere, nari ebiseera, nari oyatikire amagosi. <verse eid="LEV 21:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LEV 21:21" />Hatarigira ow'omu ruzaaro rwa Arooni omunyamurwa oine akamogo owaahika haihi kuhongyera MUKAMA empongano ez'okwotsya omu muriro; ahakuba aine akamogo tariirira haihi kuhongyera Ruhanga we eby'okurya. <verse eid="LEV 21:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LEV 21:22" />Aryaguma arye eby'okurya bya Ruhanga we, ebirikwera munonga n'ebirikwera; <verse eid="LEV 21:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LEV 21:23" />kwonka taritaaha kuhika aha mukingo, nari okuhika aha itambiro, ahakuba aine akamogo; arekye kushiisha emyanya yangye erikwera, ahabw'okuba niinye MUKAMA orikubeeza. <verse eid="LEV 21:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LEV 21:24" />Atyo Musa yaabigambira Arooni n'abatabani n'eihanga ryona ery'Abaisraeli.<verse eid="LEV 21:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LEV 21" />
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="LEV 22" />
  <para style="s1">Ebiragiro ebirikukwata aha banyamurwa n'empongano</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LEV 22:1" />MUKAMA yaagira Musa ati: <verse eid="LEV 22:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LEV 22:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 28:38">Kur 28:38</ref>. </char></note> Gambira Arooni n'abatabani beetantare ebintu ebirikwera, ebi Abaisraeli barikuunyereza, barekye kujumisa eiziina ryangye eririkwera. Niinye MUKAMA. <verse eid="LEV 22:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LEV 22:3" />Obagambire ebigambo byangye ebi ndikugamba ningira nti: Omuntu weena ow'omu ruzaaro rwanyu omu busingye bwanyu bwona orihika aha bintu birikwera ebi Abaisraeli barikwereza MUKAMA akisiisikaire, omuntu ogwo aryacuubwa omu maisho gangye. Niinye MUKAMA. <verse eid="LEV 22:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LEV 22:4" />Weena ow'omu ruzaaro rwa Arooni obembire, nari orikureeta amahira, atarirya aha bintu ebirikwera okuhitsya obu ariba oshemeire. Omuntu weena orikora aha kintu kyona ekisiisikaire ahabw'okuhika aha mutumbi, nari orikureeta amahira, <verse eid="LEV 22:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LEV 22:5" />nari orikora aha kintu kyona ekirikugyendera ahansi ekirikubaasa kumuhindura otashemeire, nari omuntu ondiijo ou yaihaho okutashemera okw'omuringo gwona, <verse eid="LEV 22:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LEV 22:6" />omuntu orikora aha kintu ekirikushusha kityo, aryaba otashemeire okuhitsya omu mwabazyo, kandi tariikirizibwa kurya aha bintu birikwera, atabandize kwoga omubiri gwe omu maizi. <verse eid="LEV 22:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LEV 22:7" />Eizooba ku ririrenga, aryaba oshemeire; bwanyima abone kurya aha bintu ebirikwera; ahabw'okuba ebyo n'eby'okurya bye. <verse eid="LEV 22:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LEV 22:8" />Atarirya ekyefeereire nari ekiitsirwe enyamaishwa okukyesiisisa. Niinye MUKAMA. <verse eid="LEV 22:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LEV 22:9" />N'ahabw'ekyo bashemereire kworobera eki ndikubaragiira, batakaagiibwaho orubanja rw'ekibi, bakakifeeramu ahabw'okushiisha ekiragiro ekyo. Niinye MUKAMA orikubeeza.<verse eid="LEV 22:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LEV 22:10" />Hatarigira otari w'omu banyamurwa weena owaarya aha kintu ekirikwera; omushuhuuki w'omunyamurwa nari omupakasi orikumukorera taribiryaho. <verse eid="LEV 22:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LEV 22:11" />Kwonka omunyamurwa ku arigura omuntu n'empiiha ze, ogwo aryabiryaho; kandi n'abo abazaariirwe omu ka ye, baryarya aha by'okurya bye. <verse eid="LEV 22:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LEV 22:12" />Muhara w'omunyamurwa ku arishwerwa otari w'omu banyamurwa, atarirya aha mpongano z'ebintu ebirikwera; <verse eid="LEV 22:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LEV 22:13" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:13: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 18:11">Kub 18:11</ref>. </char></note> kwonka muhara w'omunyamurwa ku ariba ari omufaakazi nari oshenzirwe, ataine mwana, yaagaruka aha mahega ga ishe, nk'oku yaabaire ari akiri omwishiki, aryaikirizibwa kurya aha by'okurya bya ishe; kwonka tihariho otari w'omu banyamurwa weena oribiryaho. <verse eid="LEV 22:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LEV 22:14" />Kandi omuntu ku arirya aha kintu kirikwera atakimanyire, akirihe omunyamurwa, kandi ayongyereho ekicweka kimwe kya kataano eky'obuguzi bwakyo. <verse eid="LEV 22:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LEV 22:15" />Abanyamurwa batarishiisha ebintu ebirikwera ebi Abaisraeli bahongyera MUKAMA, <verse eid="LEV 22:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LEV 22:16" />bakabareetera kugiibwaho okutahikiirira n'orubanja ahabw'okurya ebintu byabo ebirikwera; ahabw'okuba niinye MUKAMA orikubeeza.<verse eid="LEV 22:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LEV 22:17" />Kandi MUKAMA yaagira Musa ati: <verse eid="LEV 22:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LEV 22:18" />Gambira Arooni n'abatabani n'eihanga ryona ery'Abaisraeli oti: Omuntu weena ow'omu nju ya Israeli nari ow'omu babashuhuukiiremu ku arireeta empongano ye, yaaba y'okuhikiiriza eki yaaraganiise nari eki yaatoizire ahabw'okweyendera, kuba empongano ehongyeirwe MUKAMA ey'ekitambo ky'okwotsya, <verse eid="LEV 22:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LEV 22:19" />ahabw'okwenda ngu eikirizibwe, mushemereire kuhonga enimi nari empaya y'entaama nari ey'embuzi etaine kamogo; <verse eid="LEV 22:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LEV 22:20" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:20: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAL 1:8">Mal 1:8</ref>, <ref loc="MAL 1:14">14</ref>; <ref loc="1PE 1:19">1 Pet 1:19</ref>. </char></note> kwonka ekiine akamogo mutarikihonga, ahabw'okuba tikiritoorwa habwanyu. <verse eid="LEV 22:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LEV 22:21" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:21: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 23:21">Bir 23:21</ref>. </char></note> Kandi omuntu weena oritambira MUKAMA ekitambo ky'empongano z'okusiima ahabw'obusingye, okuhikiiriza eki yaaraganiise nari eki atoizire ahabw'okweyendera, naakiiha omu masyo g'ente nari ag'entaama, kyaza kwikirizibwa kishemereire kuba ekishugaine, kitainemu kamogo koona. <verse eid="LEV 22:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LEV 22:22" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:22: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAL 1:8">Mal 1:8</ref>, <ref loc="MAL 1:14">14</ref>. </char></note> Enyamaishwa ehumire nari ehendekire nari ebuzireho orugingo nari erikureeta amahira nari erwaire orukamba nari akanyamutinda, mutaribihongyera MUKAMA, n'obu kwakuba okubitamba mukabyokyeza MUKAMA aha itambiro. <verse eid="LEV 22:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LEV 22:23" />Enimi nari omwana gw'entaama ebiine ebicweka ebirikukiraakirana, nimwikirizibwa kukihonga kuba omutoijo gw'okweyendera; kwonka tibirikwikirizibwa kuba empongano y'okuhikiiriza eki mwaraganiise. <verse eid="LEV 22:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LEV 22:24" />Enyamaishwa eine amagosi gahonokire nari gahonzire nari gataagukire nari gashaahwirwe, mutarigitoijera MUKAMA n'obu kwakuba okugimutambira omu nsi yaanyu. <verse eid="LEV 22:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LEV 22:25" />Kandi mutaryakiira ezirikushusha nk'ezo okuruga omu mikono y'omunyaihanga kuba eby'okurya eby'okuhongyera Ruhanga waanyu; ahabw'okuba ziine obumogo; ahabw'obumogo bwazo tiziritoorwa habwanyu.<verse eid="LEV 22:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LEV 22:26" />Kandi MUKAMA yaagira Musa ati: <verse eid="LEV 22:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LEV 22:27" />Enimi nari entaama nari embuzi ku erizaarwa, eryamara ebiro mushanju na nyinayo; okuruga aha kiro kya munaana eryaikirizibwa kuhongyerwa MUKAMA kuba empongano eyokiibwe omu muriro. <verse eid="LEV 22:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LEV 22:28" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:28: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 22:6">Bir 22:6</ref>. </char></note> Nyinayo, ku eriba eri ente nari entaama, otarigiita hamwe n'omwana gwayo aha izooba rimwe. <verse eid="LEV 22:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LEV 22:29" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:29: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 116:17">Zab 116:17</ref>. </char></note> Ku muritambira MUKAMA ekitambo ky'okusiima, mukitambe omu muringo ogu murikubaasa kwikiririzibwamu; <verse eid="LEV 22:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LEV 22:30" />kiriibwe aha izooba eryo eri kyatambirwaho; mutarigira eki mwatsigaho okuhitsya omu kasheeshe. Niinye MUKAMA. <verse eid="LEV 22:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LEV 22:31" />N'ahabw'ekyo muryaguma mworobere ebiragiro byangye, mukore ebi naataireho. Niinye MUKAMA. <verse eid="LEV 22:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LEV 22:32" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:32: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 6:9">Mat 6:9</ref>. </char></note> Kandi mutarijumisa eiziina ryangye eririkwera; kureka ndyaguma nyezibwe omu ihanga rya Israeli. Niinye MUKAMA orikubeeza, <verse eid="LEV 22:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LEV 22:33" />owaabaihire omu nsi ya Misri, kuba Ruhanga waanyu. Niinye MUKAMA.<verse eid="LEV 22:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LEV 22" />
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="LEV 23" />
  <para style="s1">Eby'amagyenyi ga MUKAMA</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LEV 23:1" />MUKAMA yaagira Musa ati: <verse eid="LEV 23:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LEV 23:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 30:5">2 Bus 30:5</ref>. </char></note> Gambira Abaisraeli ebi ndikugamba ningira nti: Aga nigo magyenyi ga MUKAMA agu naataireho, agu oshemereire kuranga kuba okuteerana okurikwera. <verse eid="LEV 23:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LEV 23:3" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 56:2">Isa 56:2</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 58:13">58:13</ref>. </char></note> Omu biro mukaaga emirimo ebe nimwo yaakorerwa; kwonka ekiro kya mushanju ni sabato y'okuhuumuriraho ey'okuteerana okurikwera; mutarigikoreraho omurimo gwona; ni sabato ahari MUKAMA omu maka gaanyu goona.<verse eid="LEV 23:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LEV 23:4" />Aga nigo magyenyi ga MUKAMA agaatairweho ag'okuteerana okurikwera, agu oshemereire kuranga omu bunaku bwago obwatairweho. <verse eid="LEV 23:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LEV 23:5" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 12:6">Kur 12:6</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 16:1">Bir 16:1</ref>. </char></note> Omu kwezi kw'okubanza aha kiro kya ikumi na bina omu mwabazyo, nikwo kuhinguraho kwa MUKAMA. <verse eid="LEV 23:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LEV 23:6" />Aha kiro kya ikumi na bitaano eky'okwezi okwo n'obugyenyi bw'emigaati etatumbisiibwe ahari MUKAMA; muryaguma mumare ebiro mushanju nimurya emigaati etatumbisiibwe. <verse eid="LEV 23:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LEV 23:7" />Aha kiro ky'okutandikiraho obwo bugyenyi muryagira okuteerana kurikwera; mutarikikoreraho omurimo gwona ogurikurusya; <verse eid="LEV 23:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LEV 23:8" />kwonka muryaguma nimureeta empongano y'okuhongyera MUKAMA ey'okwotsya omu muriro okumara ebiro mushanju; aha kiro kya mushanju haryabaho okuteerana okurikwera; mutarikikoreraho omurimo gwona ogurikurusya.<verse eid="LEV 23:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LEV 23:9" />MUKAMA yaagira Musa ati: <verse eid="LEV 23:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LEV 23:10" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:10: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PRO 3:9">Enf 3:9</ref>. </char></note> Gambira Abaisraeli ebi ndikuragiira ningira nti: Ku murihika omu nsi ei ndikubaha, mwashaaruura emyaka yaayo, muryareetera omunyamurwa ekiba ky'omuganuro gw'ebi mwerize, <verse eid="LEV 23:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LEV 23:11" />nawe azongazonzye ekyo kiba omu maisho ga MUKAMA, kiikirizibwe ahabwanyu; aha izooba eririkurata sabato niryo omunyamurwa arikizongazongyezaho; <verse eid="LEV 23:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LEV 23:12" />kandi aha izooba eryo eri murizongazongyezaho ekyo kiba, muryahonga empaya nto y'entaama etaine kamogo ehikize omwaka, kuba ekitambo ky'okwotsya ekihongyeirwe MUKAMA. <verse eid="LEV 23:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LEV 23:13" />Kandi empongano y'esaano ey'okuhongwa nakyo eryaguma ebe ebicweka bibiri bya ikumi bya eefa y'esaano y'obunono ejwangize n'amajuta, ebe empongano ey'okuhongyera MUKAMA ey'okwotsya omu muriro kuba ekisooroora kirungi; empongano y'eby'okunywa ey'okuhongwa nakyo eryaguma ebe ekicweka kimwe kya kana kya hiini ya viinyo. <verse eid="LEV 23:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LEV 23:14" />Mutarirya omugaati gwona nari enjuma y'ekintu kyona ekarangire nari embisi eryo izooba eri muriheeraho empongano ahari Ruhanga waanyu ritakahikire. Ekyo n'ekiragiro ekitarihwaho omu busingye bwanyu bwona n'omu maka gaanyu goona.<verse eid="LEV 23:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LEV 23:15" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">23:15: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 34:22">Kur 34:22</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 16:9">Bir 16:9</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kandi muryayebarira ebiro okwiha aha izooba eririkurata sabato, eri muriba mureeteireho ekiba ky'empongano ey'okuzongazonzya; ebyo biro bihikye sabato mushanju eziijwire, <verse eid="LEV 23:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LEV 23:16" />nimubara ebiro makumi ataano okuhitsya aha izooba eririkukurata sabato ya mushanju; obwo muryareeta empongano y'esaano y'omwaka musya y'okuhongyera MUKAMA. <verse eid="LEV 23:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LEV 23:17" />Mwihe omu maka gaanyu emigaati ebiri ekozirwe omu bicweka bibiri bya ikumi bya eefa kuba empongano y'okuzongazonzya, eteekwe omu saano y'obunono, bagiteekyerane n'ekitumbisa kuganurirwa MUKAMA. <verse eid="LEV 23:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LEV 23:18" />Hamwe n'egyo migaati mureete abaana b'entaama mushanju abataine kamogo, abahikize omwaka, n'enimi nto emwe n'empaya z'entaama ibiri; bibe ekitambo ky'okwotsya eky'okutambirwa MUKAMA, n'empongano y'esaano ereetsirwe nabyo, n'ez'eby'okunywa ezireetsirwe nabyo, kuba empongano ey'okwotsya omu muriro y'ekisooroora kirungi ahari MUKAMA. <verse eid="LEV 23:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LEV 23:19" />Kandi muhongye empaya y'embuzi kuba empongano y'ekibi, n'empaya nto ibiri z'entaama ezihikize omwaka kuba ekitambo ky'empongano z'okusiima ahabw'obusingye. <verse eid="LEV 23:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LEV 23:20" />Omunyamurwa abizongazonzye hamwe n'emigaati y'omuganuro kuba empongano ezongazongiibwe omu maisho ga MUKAMA hamwe n'abo baana b'entaama bombi, bibe ebyereziibwe MUKAMA, bitwarwe omunyamurwa. <verse eid="LEV 23:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LEV 23:21" />Eryo izooba murangye ku murigira okuteerana okurikwera; mutaririkoreraho omurimo gwona ogurikurusya. Ekyo n'ekiragiro ekitarihwaho omu maka gaanyu goona n'omu busingye bwanyu bwona.<verse eid="LEV 23:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LEV 23:22" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">23:22: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JAS 2:1">Yak 2:1</ref>; <ref loc="RUT 2:15">Rus 2:15</ref>, <ref loc="RUT 2:16">16</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ku muriba nimushaaruura emyaka y'omu misiri yaanyu, mutarimariramu kimwe n'ey'aha mbibi, n'obu kwakuba okuhumba ebitsigairemu; kureka mubitsigire abooro n'abanyamahanga. Niinye MUKAMA Ruhanga waanyu.<verse eid="LEV 23:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LEV 23:23" />Kandi MUKAMA yaagira Musa ati: <verse eid="LEV 23:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LEV 23:24" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:24: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 10:10">Kub 10:10</ref>; <ref loc="NUM 29:1">29:1</ref>. </char></note> Gambira Abaisraeli oti: Omu kwezi kwa mushanju, ekiro ky'okubanza ky'okwo kwezi muryakigira eizooba eririkwera ery'okuhuumuriraho, ery'ekiijutsyo eki muriranga nimuteera enzamba, kuba okweteerana okurikwera. <verse eid="LEV 23:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LEV 23:25" />Mutaririkoreraho omurimo gwona ogurikurusya; kureka muryahongyera MUKAMA empongano y'okwotsya omu muriro. <verse eid="LEV 23:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LEV 23:26" />Kandi MUKAMA yaagira Musa ati: <verse eid="LEV 23:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LEV 23:27" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:27: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 29:7">Kub 29:7</ref>. </char></note> Kwonka ekiro kya ikumi eky'okwo kwezi kwa mushanju kiryaba eizooba ry'okurihiiriraho; riryababeera eizooba ry'okuteerana okurikwera; muryabonabonesa amagara gaanyu, muhongyere MUKAMA empongano y'okwotsya omu muriro. <verse eid="LEV 23:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LEV 23:28" />Aha kiro ekyo mutarikora omurimo gwona, ahakuba n'eizooba ry'okurihiiriraho, okubarihiirira omu maisho ga MUKAMA Ruhanga waanyu. <verse eid="LEV 23:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LEV 23:29" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:29: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2TH 3:6">2 Tes 3:6</ref>. </char></note> Ahakuba omuntu oriba atabonaboneise magara ge eryo izooba, aryacuubwa omu ihanga rye; <verse eid="LEV 23:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LEV 23:30" />n'omuntu weena orikora omurimo gwona ahari eryo izooba, ndyamuhwerekyereza, mmwihe omu ihanga rye. <verse eid="LEV 23:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LEV 23:31" />Mutarigira omurimo gwona ogu mwakora. Ekyo n'ekiragiro ekitarihwaho omu maka gaanyu goona n'omu busingye bwanyu bwona. <verse eid="LEV 23:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LEV 23:32" />Eryo izooba riryababeera sabato erikwera ey'okuhuumuriraho, mubonabonese amagara gaanyu; aha kiro kya mwenda eky'okwezi okwo okwiha omu mwabazyo muryarinda sabato yaanyu okuhitsya omu mwabazyo ogundi.<verse eid="LEV 23:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LEV 23:33" />MUKAMA yaagira Musa ati: <verse eid="LEV 23:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LEV 23:34" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:34: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 34:22">Kur 34:22</ref>; <ref loc="EZR 3:4">Ezr 3:4</ref>; <ref loc="ZEC 14:16">Zek 14:16</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 7:2">Yoh 7:2</ref>. </char></note> Gambira Abaisraeli oti: Aha kiro kya ikumi na bitaano eky'okwo kwezi kwa mushanju haryabaho obugyenyi bw'Ensiisira ahari MUKAMA okumara ebiro mushanju. <verse eid="LEV 23:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LEV 23:35" />Aha izooba ry'okubanza haryabaho okuteerana okurikwera; mutaririkoreraho omurimo gwona ogurikurusya. <verse eid="LEV 23:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LEV 23:36" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:36: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 7:37">Yoh 7:37</ref>. </char></note> Muryaguma nimureeta empongano y'okuhongyera MUKAMA y'okwotsya omu muriro okumara ebiro mushanju; aha kiro kya munaana muryagira okuteerana okurikwera, mureete empongano y'okuhongyera MUKAMA y'okwotsya omu muriro; eryo izooba n'ery'okuteerana okurikwera; mutaririkoreraho omurimo gwona ogurikurusya. <verse eid="LEV 23:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LEV 23:37" />Ago nigo magyenyi ga MUKAMA agaatairweho agu muriranga kuba ag'okuteerana okurikwera, mukabona kureetera MUKAMA empongano z'okwotsya omu muriro, n'ekitambo ky'okwotsya, n'empongano y'esaano, n'ebindi bitambo, n'empongano z'eby'okunywa, buri kimwe aha izooba ryakyo, <verse eid="LEV 23:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LEV 23:38" />mutaihiremu sabato za MUKAMA, n'emitoijo yaanyu, n'ebi muraganisa nimuhiga byona, n'ebi mutoija ahabw'okweyendera ebi mutoijera MUKAMA.<verse eid="LEV 23:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LEV 23:39" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">23:39: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 21:8">Mat 21:8</ref>. </char>
    </note> Aha kiro kya ikumi na bitaano eky'okwezi kwa mushanju, ku muriheza kushaaruura emyaka y'omu misiri, muryagira obugyenyi bw'ebiro bikuru ahari MUKAMA okumara ebiro mushanju; haryabaho okuhuumura okurikwera aha izooba ry'okutandikiraho obwo bugyenyi, kandi n'aha izooba ryabwo rya munaana. <verse eid="LEV 23:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LEV 23:40" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:40: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NEH 8:15">Neh 8:15</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 35:10">Isa 35:10</ref>. </char></note> Ahari eryo izooba ry'okutandikiraho muryatwara ebijuma by'emiti emirungi, n'amataagi g'enkindo, n'amataagi g'emiti eyumbize, n'emiti y'aha migyera; muryamara ebiro mushanju nimushemerererwa omu maisho ga MUKAMA Ruhanga waanyu. <verse eid="LEV 23:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LEV 23:41" />Kandi muryaguma mugire obwo bugyenyi bw'ebiro mushanju ahari MUKAMA buri mwaka. Ekyo n'ekiragiro ekitarihwaho omu busingye bwanyu bwona. Muryaguma mubugire omu kwezi kwa mushanju. <verse eid="LEV 23:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LEV 23:42" />Muryamara ebiro mushanju nimuraara omu nsiisira; Abaisraeli enzaarwa boona bagume omu nsiisira, <verse eid="LEV 23:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LEV 23:43" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:43: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 78:5">Zab 78:5</ref>, <ref loc="PSA 78:6">6</ref>. </char></note> ab'obusingye bwona oburibakurata bamanye ku naaraarize Abaisraeli omu nsiisira, obu naabaiha omu nsi ya Misri. Niinye MUKAMA Ruhanga waanyu. <verse eid="LEV 23:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LEV 23:44" />Okwo nikwo Musa yaarangiire Abaisraeli amagyenyi ga MUKAMA agaatairweho.<verse eid="LEV 23:44" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LEV 23" />
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="LEV 24" />
  <para style="s1">Eby'amajuta agarikwera, n'emigaati y'okumurika</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LEV 24:1" />MUKAMA yaagira Musa ati: <verse eid="LEV 24:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LEV 24:2" />Ragiira Abaisraeli bakureetere amajuta marungi g'emizeituuni eshekwirwe ag'okuhemba, amatabaaza gabone kuguma nigaaka obutoosha. <verse eid="LEV 24:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LEV 24:3" />Enyima y'omukingo ogurikukingira Ebirikuhamya, omu Ihema ry'okubugaabuganiramu, Arooni abe niho yaaguma naagashemereza obutoosha, gabone kuguma nigaakira omu maisho ga MUKAMA okuruga omu mwabazyo okuhitsya omu kasheeshe. Ekyo kibe ekiragiro ekitarihwaho omu busingye bwanyu bwona. <verse eid="LEV 24:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LEV 24:4" />Arooni agume ashemereze ago matabaaza aha kikondo kyago eky'ezaabu eshemeziibwe, gaakire omu maisho ga MUKAMA.<verse eid="LEV 24:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LEV 24:5" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">24:5: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 25:30">Kur 25:30</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kandi oryatwara esaano y'obunono, ogiteekyemu obugaati bwa keeki ikumi na bubiri, ebicweka bibiri bya ikumi bya eefa birugwemu akagaati kamwe; <verse eid="LEV 24:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LEV 24:6" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:6: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 9:2">Heb 9:2</ref>. </char></note> obute aha meeza y'ezaabu eshemeziibwe omu mishorongo ebiri ey'obugaati mukaaga-mukaaga omu maisho ga MUKAMA. <verse eid="LEV 24:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LEV 24:7" />Kandi aha mishorongo yombi oteho obubaane burungi oburikwetwa lebona, bubone kuheebwayo hamwe n'emigaati nk'ekiijutsyo eky'empongano ey'okuhongyera MUKAMA ey'okwotsya omu muriro. <verse eid="LEV 24:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LEV 24:8" />Buri sabato Arooni agite omu maisho ga MUKAMA obutoosha ahabw'Abaisraeli, kuba endagaano etarihwaho. <verse eid="LEV 24:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LEV 24:9" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:9: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 12:4">Mat 12:4</ref>. </char></note> Kandi egyo migaati egume ebe eya Arooni n'abatabani bagiriire omu mwanya gurikwera, ahakuba n'erikwera munonga ahariwe omu mpongano ezihongyerwa MUKAMA ezokiibwe omu muriro; n'omugabo gwe ogw'ebiro byona.<verse eid="LEV 24:9" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Orubanja rw'abarikurogota aha iziina rya MUKAMA</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LEV 24:10" />Hakaba hariho omwojo, mutabani w'Omwisraelikazi, ou yaazairweho Omunyamisri, owaizire n'Abaisraeli; omwojo ogwo akatonganira omu rusiisira n'omushaija Omwisraeli; <verse eid="LEV 24:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LEV 24:11" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:11: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 1:5">Yob 1:5</ref>; <ref loc="JOB 2:5">2:5</ref>, <ref loc="JOB 2:9">9</ref>. </char></note> mutabani w'Omwisraelikazi yaarogota aha Iziina eryo, naakyeena; baamureeta ahari Musa. (Kandi nyina akaba naayetwa Shelomiisi muhara wa Diburi, ow'omu ruganda rwa Daani.) <verse eid="LEV 24:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LEV 24:12" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:12: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 15:34">Kub 15:34</ref>. </char></note> Baamukingirana okuhitsya obunaku obu baraagambirirweho eki MUKAMA arikuragiira. <verse eid="LEV 24:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LEV 24:13" />MUKAMA yaagambira Musa ati: <verse eid="LEV 24:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LEV 24:14" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:14: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 17:7">Bir 17:7</ref>. </char></note> Shohoza ogwo okyeenire aheeru y'orusiisira, abamuhuriire boona bamute engaro aha mutwe, abantu boona bamuteere amabaare. <verse eid="LEV 24:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LEV 24:15" />Kandi ogambire Abaisraeli oti: Omuntu weena orikyeena Ruhanga we aryagiibwaho orubanja rw'ekyo kibi; <verse eid="LEV 24:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LEV 24:16" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:16: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MRK 3:28">Mak 3:28</ref>. </char></note> kandi orirogota aha Iziina rya MUKAMA, aitwe; ab'eihanga ryona bamuteere amabaare; n'omunyaihanga nawe nk'omuntu enzaarwa, orirogota aha Iziina eryo, aitwe.<verse eid="LEV 24:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LEV 24:17" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">24:17: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="NUM 35:31">Kub 35:31</ref>; <ref loc="REV 13:10">Kush 13:10</ref>. </char>
    </note> Oriita omuntu, aitwe. <verse eid="LEV 24:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LEV 24:18" />Oriita enyamaishwa etungirwe, agirihe; amagara garihwe agandi. <verse eid="LEV 24:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LEV 24:19" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:19: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 5:38">Mat 5:38</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 7:2">7:2</ref>. </char></note> Omuntu oriremaza mutaahi we, nawe aihurwe eki amukozire; <verse eid="LEV 24:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LEV 24:20" />obuhuta burihwe obundi; eriisho ririhwe erindi; eriino ririhwe erindi; nk'oku omuntu ariba aremaize ondiijo, nawe abe nikwo yaihurwa. <verse eid="LEV 24:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LEV 24:21" />Oriita enyamaishwa etungirwe, agirihe; n'oriita omuntu, aitwe. <verse eid="LEV 24:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LEV 24:22" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:22: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 12:49">Kur 12:49</ref>. </char></note> Omunyaihanga n'enzaarwa bagire ekiragiro kimwe. Niinye MUKAMA Ruhanga waanyu.<verse eid="LEV 24:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LEV 24:23" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">24:23: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="DEU 13:9">Bir 13:9</ref>. </char>
    </note> Musa yaaragiira Abaisraeli, baatwara ogwo owaakyeenire aheeru y'orusiisira, baamwitsa amabaare. Okwo nikwo Abaisraeli baakozire nk'oku MUKAMA yaaragiire Musa.<verse eid="LEV 24:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LEV 24" />
  <chapter number="25" style="c" sid="LEV 25" />
  <para style="s1">Omwaka gwa mushanju ogw'okuraaza emisiri</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LEV 25:1" />MUKAMA yaagambirira Musa aha rushozi Sinai ati: <verse eid="LEV 25:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LEV 25:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">25:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 26:34">Lev 26:34</ref>, <ref loc="LEV 26:35">35</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 36:21">2 Bus 36:21</ref>. </char></note> Gambira Abaisraeli ebi ndikugamba ningira nti: Ku murihika omu nsi ei ndikubaha, egyo nsi eryaguma egire sabato ahabwa MUKAMA. <verse eid="LEV 25:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LEV 25:3" />Oryamara emyaka mukaaga noohinga emisiri yaawe, noosharira emizaabibu yaawe, nooshaaruura emyaka yaabyo. <verse eid="LEV 25:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LEV 25:4" />Kwonka omwaka gwa mushanju guryaba sabato y'okuraariza kimwe emisiri; ni sabato ahabwa MUKAMA; otarihinga emisiri yaawe, n'obu kwakuba okusharira emizaabibu yaawe. <verse eid="LEV 25:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LEV 25:5" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">25:5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 37:30">Isa 37:30</ref>. </char></note> Ebyemerize otaribigyesha, kandi ebijuma by'emizaabibu yaawe etashariire otaribicwa; omwaka ogwo guryaba ogw'okuhuumura kw'ensi okurikwera. <verse eid="LEV 25:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LEV 25:6" />Sabato egyo ey'ensi niyo eriba eby'okurya byanyu, iwe n'omuhuuku waawe n'omuzaana waawe n'omupakasi waawe n'omunyaihanga owaakushuhuukiireho, <verse eid="LEV 25:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LEV 25:7" />n'amatungo gaawe n'enyamaishwa ez'omu nsi yaawe, byona ebi ensi eryeza nibyo biriba eby'okurya.<verse eid="LEV 25:7" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Omwaka gwa Jubili</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LEV 25:8" />Kandi oryayebarira sabato mushanju z'emyaka, niyo myaka mushanju emirundi mushanju; n'ahabw'ekyo obunaku bwa sabato ezo mushanju z'emyaka buryababeera emyaka makumi ana na mwenda. <verse eid="LEV 25:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LEV 25:9" />Reero aha kiro kya ikumi ky'okwezi kwa mushanju oryatwara enzamba erikugamba munonga; ahari eryo izooba ry'okurihiirira niryo oriteereraho enzamba omu nsi yaawe yoona. <verse eid="LEV 25:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LEV 25:10" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">25:10: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 34:8">Yer 34:8</ref>, <ref loc="JER 34:17">17</ref>; <ref loc="GAL 5:1">Gal 5:1</ref>. </char></note> Mweze omwaka gwa makumi ataano, murangye omu nsi yoona abagitwiremu boona, ku baine obusingye; guryababeera jubili; omuntu weena omuriimwe agarukye omu butaka bwe n'omu baabo. <verse eid="LEV 25:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LEV 25:11" />Ogwo mwaka gwa makumi ataano guryababeera jubili; mutariguhingiramu, mutarigushaaruuriramu ebyemerize, n'obu kwakuba okugucweramu ebijuma by'emizaabibu etashariire; <verse eid="LEV 25:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LEV 25:12" />ahabw'okuba ni jubili; guryababeera ogurikwera; muryaguma nimurya ebyezire omu ishwa omuri ogwo mwaka.<verse eid="LEV 25:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LEV 25:13" />Omuri ogwo mwaka gwa jubili omuntu weena omuriimwe aryagaruka omu butaka bwe. <verse eid="LEV 25:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LEV 25:14" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">25:14: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 12:3">1 Sam 12:3</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 6:8">1 Kor 6:8</ref>. </char></note> Kandi ku origira eki waaguza mutaahi waawe, nari eki waamuguraho, mutariinyagana. <verse eid="LEV 25:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LEV 25:15" />Nk'emyaka erikurata jubili oku eriba eri, obe nikwo waagura ahari mutaahi waawe, kandi nawe akuguze nk'emyaka y'ebihingirwe oku eriba eri. <verse eid="LEV 25:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LEV 25:16" />Emyaka ku eriba mingi, oyongyere obuguzi; kandi emyaka ku eriba mikye, otuubye aha buguzi; ahabw'okuba omu kukuguza aryakurata obwingi bw'emyaka ei orishaaruura. <verse eid="LEV 25:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LEV 25:17" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">25:17: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PRO 14:31">Enf 14:31</ref>; <ref loc="PRO 22:22">22:22</ref>; <ref loc="1TH 4:6">1 Tes 4:6</ref>. </char></note> Mutariinyagana, kureka mutiine Ruhanga waanyu; ahakuba niinye MUKAMA Ruhanga waanyu.<verse eid="LEV 25:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LEV 25:18" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">25:18: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 4:8">Zab 4:8</ref>; <ref loc="JER 23:6">Yer 23:6</ref>. </char>
    </note> N'ahabw'ekyo muhurire ebiragiro byangye, mworobere emigyenzo ei naataireho, mugikore; obwo nibwo murituura omu nsi buhooro. <verse eid="LEV 25:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LEV 25:19" />Ensi eryayeza emyaka yaayo, naimwe murye, muhaagye, mugituuremu buhooro. <verse eid="LEV 25:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LEV 25:20" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">25:20: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 6:25">Mat 6:25</ref>. </char></note> Kandi ku murigira muti: Beitu shi turyatungwa ki omu mwaka gwa mushanju? Ku turiba tutahingire kandi tutashaarwire! <verse eid="LEV 25:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LEV 25:21" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">25:21: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 16:29">Kur 16:29</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 28:8">Bir 28:8</ref>. </char></note> Mumanye ku ndiragiira omugisha gukabaijaho omu mwaka gwa mukaaga, ogwo mwaka gukeera eby'okurya by'emyaka eshatu. <verse eid="LEV 25:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LEV 25:22" />Omu mwaka gwa munaana muryahinga; kwonka muryaguma nimurya ahari ebyo ebi muhunikire ira, okuhitsya omu mwaka gwa mwenda, obu ebi mwabibire biryera.<verse eid="LEV 25:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LEV 25:23" />Eitaka ritaritundirwa kimwe; ahakuba niinye mukama waaryo; naimwe muri abanyaihanga abanshuhuukiireho. <verse eid="LEV 25:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LEV 25:24" />Kandi ensi yoona eriba yaabaire obutaka bwanyu, muryaguma mwikirize eitaka ricungurwe. <verse eid="LEV 25:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LEV 25:25" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">25:25: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="RUT 2:20">Rus 2:20</ref>; <ref loc="RUT 3:2">3:2</ref>. </char></note> Mwene waanyu ku ariba omworo, yaatunda aha butaka bwe, owaabo omuri haihi omu buzaare aryaija acungure eki mwene waabo atunzire. <verse eid="LEV 25:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LEV 25:26" />Omuntu ku aribura ow'okubucungura, bwanyima yaatunga, yaagira eby'okubucungura, <verse eid="LEV 25:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LEV 25:27" />abare emyaka ehingwire okwiha obu yaabutunda, agarurire owaabuguzire eby'emyaka eriba etsigaireyo, abone kugaruka omu butaka bwe. <verse eid="LEV 25:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LEV 25:28" />Kwonka ku ariba atarikubaasa kubwecungurira, obutaka obu yaatunzire buryagumanwa owaabuguzire okuhitsya aha mwaka gwa jubili; omu mwaka ogwo buryarekurwa, mukama waabwo abugarukyemu.<verse eid="LEV 25:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LEV 25:29" />Omuntu ku aritunda enju ye omu rurembo orwehinguririziibwe orugo rw'amabaare, aryaikirizibwa kugicungura omwaka gutakahweireho okuruga obu yaagitunda; aryamara omwaka gwona aine obushoboorozi bw'okugicungura. <verse eid="LEV 25:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LEV 25:30" />Kwonka ku eriba etacungwirwe omwaka ogwo gutakahweire, enju egyo eri omu rurembo orwehinguririziibwe orugo rw'amabaare eryahamibwa kubeera kimwe ey'ogwo owaagiguzire ebiro bye byona n'eby'abarimukurata; n'omu mwaka gwa jubili tericungurwa. <verse eid="LEV 25:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LEV 25:31" />Kwonka amaju g'omu birorero ebiteehinguririziibwe rugo rw'amabaare nigabarwa nk'emisiri y'omu ishwa; nigabaasa kucungurwa; kandi omu mwaka gwa jubili garyarekurwa. <verse eid="LEV 25:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LEV 25:32" />Kwonka omu ndembo z'Abaleevi amaju g'omu butaka bwabo nibaikirizibwa kugacungura omu bunaku bwona. <verse eid="LEV 25:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LEV 25:33" />Kandi Omuleevi ku ariba atacungwire nju ye, egyo nju eyaatunzirwe omu rurembo rw'obutaka bwabo, eryarekurwa omuri jubili; ahabw'okuba amaju g'omu ndembo z'Abaleevi n'agaabo g'obutaka obu baabagaine omu Baisraeli. <verse eid="LEV 25:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LEV 25:34" />Kwonka emisiri ehereraine n'endembo z'Abaleevi teritundwa, ahakuba n'obutaka bwabo bw'ebiro byona.<verse eid="LEV 25:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LEV 25:35" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">25:35: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ACT 11:29">Byak 11:29</ref>; <ref loc="1JN 3:17">1 Yoh 3:17</ref>. </char>
    </note> Mwene waanyu otwire naiwe ku ariba omworo, atakibaasa kwetunga, iwe oryamutunga, agume naiwe nk'omunyaihanga kandi omushuhuuki. <verse eid="LEV 25:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LEV 25:36" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">25:36: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NEH 5:7">Neh 5:7</ref>. </char></note> Otarimushaba enshaagi nari ebirengyesereize; kureka otiine Ruhanga waawe, mwene waanyu abone kuguma atwire naiwe. <verse eid="LEV 25:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LEV 25:37" />Otarimuguza empiiha ahabw'enshaagi, n'obu kwakuba okumuha eby'okurya ngu akweshumbizeho. <verse eid="LEV 25:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LEV 25:38" />Niinye MUKAMA Ruhanga waanyu, owaabaihire omu nsi ya Misri kubaha ensi ya Kanaani, ngu mbe Ruhanga waanyu.<verse eid="LEV 25:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LEV 25:39" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">25:39: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2KI 4:1">2 Bag 4:1</ref>; <ref loc="JER 34:14">Yer 34:14</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kandi mwene waanyu otwire naiwe ku ariba omworo, yaayetunda kuba owaawe, otarimukoresa nk'omuhuuku, <verse eid="LEV 25:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LEV 25:40" />kureka agume naiwe nk'omupakasi kandi nk'omushuhuuki; akukorere okuhitsya omu mwaka gwa jubili. <verse eid="LEV 25:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LEV 25:41" />Obwo aryakurugaho, we n'abaana be, agarukye omuri beene waabo n'omu butaka bwa baishenkuru; <verse eid="LEV 25:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LEV 25:42" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">25:42: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 7:23">1 Kor 7:23</ref>. </char></note> ahakuba n'abairu bangye abu naihire omu nsi ya Misri; bataritundwa nk'abahuuku. <verse eid="LEV 25:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LEV 25:43" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">25:43: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 6:9">Efe 6:9</ref>. </char></note> Otarimutegyekyesa eikama, kureka otiine Ruhanga waawe. <verse eid="LEV 25:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LEV 25:44" />Kandi eby'abahuuku baawe n'abazaana baawe, abu oriba oine, noikirizibwa kubagura omu mahanga agabeehinguririize; <verse eid="LEV 25:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LEV 25:45" />kandi nimwikirizibwa kubagura omu baana b'abanyamahanga abaabashuhuukiiremu, n'abaijukuru baabo abu barizaarira omu nsi yaanyu; bo baryaba abaanyu. <verse eid="LEV 25:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LEV 25:46" />Kandi nimwikirizibwa kubaraga abaana baanyu abaribakurata, babe abaabo ebiro byona. Bo muryaguma mubagire abahuuku ebiro byona; kwonka beene waanyu Abaisraeli mutaribaikiriza omuntu kutegyekyesa mutaahi we amaani.<verse eid="LEV 25:46" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LEV 25:47" />Omunyaihanga nari omushuhuuki okushuhuukiireho ku ariba omutungi, na mwene waanyu otwire nawe yaaba omworo yaayetunda ahari ogwo munyaihanga nari omushuhuuki okushuhuukiireho, nari ahari omwe ow'omuri beene waabo, <verse eid="LEV 25:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LEV 25:48" />bwanyima y'okutundwa naabaasa kucungurwa; omwe ahari beene waabo naabaasa kumucungura, <verse eid="LEV 25:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LEV 25:49" />yaaba ishento nari omwana wa ishento, nari mwene waabo weena ow'obuzaare bwa haihi, naabaasa kumucungura; nari shi we wenka, yaatunga, nabaasa kwecungura. <verse eid="LEV 25:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LEV 25:50" />Aryabara emyaka n'owaamuguzire okwiha aha mwaka ogu yaamwetundiiremu okuhitsya aha mwaka gwa jubili; empiiha z'okumucungura ziingane n'egyo myaka; ebiro ebi ariba amazire naakorera mukama we biryabariirirwa, biihurwe nk'oku baihura omupakasi. <verse eid="LEV 25:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LEV 25:51" />Emyaka ku eriba ekitsigaire mingi okuhitsya ahari jubili, oku eriba eri, nikwo arigarurira mukama we empiiha z'okumucungura, naaziitsya ahari ezo ezi yaaguzirwe. <verse eid="LEV 25:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LEV 25:52" />Emyaka ku eriba etsigaire mikye, aryabara emyaka na mukama we; oku egyo myaka eriba eri, abe nikwo yaamugarurira empiiha z'okwecungura. <verse eid="LEV 25:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LEV 25:53" />Aryaguma nawe nk'omupakasi orikukorera ebihembo buri mwaka; atarimutwaza eikama, noomureeba. <verse eid="LEV 25:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="LEV 25:54" />Ku ariba atacungwirwe omu buryo obwo, omu mwaka gwa jubili aryarekurwa n'abaana be; <verse eid="LEV 25:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="LEV 25:55" />ahakuba ahariinye Abaisraeli n'abairu; n'abairu bangye abu naihire omu nsi ya Misri. Niinye MUKAMA Ruhanga waanyu.<verse eid="LEV 25:55" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LEV 25" />
  <chapter number="26" style="c" sid="LEV 26" />
  <para style="s1">Ebindi biragiro bya Ruhanga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LEV 26:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">26:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 20:4">Kur 20:4</ref>, <ref loc="EXO 20:5">5</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 44:9-20">Isa 44:9-20</ref>. </char>
    </note> Mutaryekorera ebishushani ebirikuramibwa, n'obu kwakuba okwemereza ebishushani ebibaizire, nari enyomyo; kandi mutaryemereza eibaare eribaizirwemu ekishushani omu nsi yaanyu okuriinamira; ahabw'okuba niinye MUKAMA Ruhanga waanyu. <verse eid="LEV 26:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LEV 26:2" />Muryaguma murinde sabato zangye, muhe ekitiinisa Omwanya gwangye ogurikwera. Niinye MUKAMA.<verse eid="LEV 26:2" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Emigisha erikuruga omu kworobera Ruhanga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LEV 26:3" />Ku muriguma nimukuratira ebi naataireho, mwahurira ebiragiro byangye, mwabyorobera, <verse eid="LEV 26:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LEV 26:4" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26:4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 30:23">Isa 30:23</ref>. </char></note> ndyaguma mbagwisize enjura omu bunaku bwayo, ensi egire omweru n'emiti y'omu misiri eyane ebyana. <verse eid="LEV 26:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LEV 26:5" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26:5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOL 2:19">Yoel 2:19</ref>, <ref loc="JOL 2:26">26</ref>. </char></note> Eihuura ryanyu riryahitsya omu ishaaruura ry'emizaabibu, n'eishaaruura rihitsye omu ibiba; muryarya eby'okurya byanyu, muhaagye, mutuure omu nsi yaanyu buhooro. <verse eid="LEV 26:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LEV 26:6" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26:6: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 30:10">Yer 30:10</ref>; <ref loc="2KI 17:25">2 Bag 17:25</ref>. </char></note> Kandi ndyareeta obusingye omu nsi; muryabyama, kandi tihaine oribatiinisa. Ndyamara enyamaishwa mbi omu nsi, na rurara teriraba mu nsi yaanyu yoona. <verse eid="LEV 26:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LEV 26:7" />Muryabinga abazigu baanyu, zaarurara zibagwise omu maisho gaanyu. <verse eid="LEV 26:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LEV 26:8" />Bataano omuriimwe baryabinga igana, na igana omuriimwe baryabinga kakumi; abazigu baanyu baryaitwa zaarurara. <verse eid="LEV 26:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LEV 26:9" />Ndyabataho omutima, mbahe okuzaara munonga, mbakanyise, mpamye endagaano yangye naimwe. <verse eid="LEV 26:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LEV 26:10" />Muryarya eby'okurya ebitwire omu bitara, muhununure ebikuru, muhunikye ebisya. <verse eid="LEV 26:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LEV 26:11" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26:11: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 37:26">Ezk 37:26</ref>. </char></note> Ndyata obutaaho bwangye ahagati yaanyu; omutima gwangye tiguribatamwa. <verse eid="LEV 26:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LEV 26:12" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26:12: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CO 6:16">2 Kor 6:16</ref>. </char></note> Ndyagyendera omuriimwe, mbe Ruhanga waanyu, naimwe mube abantu bangye. <verse eid="LEV 26:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LEV 26:13" />Niinye MUKAMA Ruhanga waanyu owaabaihire omu nsi ya Misri, ngu murekye kuba abahuuku baabo; naabaihaho emigamba eyaabaire yaabainikire, naabagyendesa bwemi.<verse eid="LEV 26:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ebifubiro by'okutoorobera Ruhanga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LEV 26:14" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">26:14: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="DEU 28:15">Bir 28:15</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ku muryanga kumpurira, kandi mutaayorobera ebyo biragiro byona; <verse eid="LEV 26:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LEV 26:15" />ku murigaya ebi naataireho, emitima yaanyu yaayangira kimwe emigyenzo ei naataireho, kyabareetera kutoorobera biragiro byangye byona, kureka mwaita endagaano yangye, <verse eid="LEV 26:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LEV 26:16" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26:16: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 28:22">Bir 28:22</ref>; <ref loc="1SA 2:33">1 Sam 2:33</ref>; <ref loc="JDG 6:3-11">Bar 6:3-11</ref>. </char></note> naanye ndyabagira nti; ndyabareetera ebirikutiinisa, n'omunywengyerero, n'omushwija ogurukugwisa amaisho omunda, gukareetera amagara okugyenda nigahwerera. Muryabibira busha, ahakuba ebi muribiba abazigu baanyu baryabirya. <verse eid="LEV 26:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LEV 26:17" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26:17: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 106:41">Zab 106:41</ref>. </char></note> Ndyabata omu kaso, mbarwanise, mubingwe abazigu baanyu; abarikubanga babe nibo baabategyeka; muryahunga, hataine obabingire. <verse eid="LEV 26:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LEV 26:18" />Hoona nabwo ku muryanga kumpurira, ndyayeyongyera kubahana emirundi mushanju ahabw'ebibi byanyu; <verse eid="LEV 26:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LEV 26:19" />ndyabacwa amaryo, mbamare eishaija; eiguru ryanyu ndihindure ribe nk'ekyoma, n'ensi yaanyu ebe nk'omuringa; <verse eid="LEV 26:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LEV 26:20" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26:20: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 127:1">Zab 127:1</ref>. </char></note> muryahendekyera busha, ahakuba ensi yaanyu teryeza myaka, kandi emiti y'ensi yaanyu teryana bijuma. <verse eid="LEV 26:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LEV 26:21" />Ku muritwaza okwanyu, mutaikirizana naanye, mwayanga kumpurira, ndyabareetera ebindi bibonaboneso, ebirikwingana n'ebibi byanyu emirundi mushanju. <verse eid="LEV 26:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LEV 26:22" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26:22: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 17:26">2 Bag 17:26</ref>; <ref loc="JDG 5:6">Bar 5:6</ref>. </char></note> Kandi ndyabarekurira enyamaishwa z'omu ihamba, zibaakye abaana, zicwekyereze amatungo gaanyu, zibatuubye, n'emihanda yaanyu etsibe. <verse eid="LEV 26:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LEV 26:23" />Ebyo bifubiro ku biriba bitabareeteire kungarukira, mwagumizamu nimutwaza okwanyu, mutaikirizana naanye, <verse eid="LEV 26:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LEV 26:24" />naanye ndyatwaza okwangye, ndekye kwikirizana naimwe; kandi nyowe ndyabeeteerera emirundi mushanju, nimbatura ebibi byanyu. <verse eid="LEV 26:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LEV 26:25" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26:25: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="AMO 4:10">Amo 4:10</ref>. </char></note> Ndyabareetaho rurara, ehoore enzigu y'okwita endagaano yangye; kandi ku murihungira omu ndembo zaanyu, ndyabooherereza orufu, mbaheyo omu mikono y'abazigu. <verse eid="LEV 26:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LEV 26:26" />Ku ndihenda enkoni ei mwegamiire, nibyo by'okurya byanyu, abakazi ikumi baryateeka eby'okurya byanyu omu nyungu emwe babibarengyere; muryarya, kwonka timurihaaga.<verse eid="LEV 26:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LEV 26:27" />Ebyo byona ku biriba bitabareeterire kumpurira, mwagumizamu nimutwaza okwanyu, mutaikirizana naanye, <verse eid="LEV 26:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LEV 26:28" />naanye ndyatwaza okwangye mbainiire ekiniga, mbabonabonese emirundi mushanju, nimbatura ebibi byanyu. <verse eid="LEV 26:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LEV 26:29" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26:29: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 6:29">2 Bag 6:29</ref>. </char></note> Muryarya batabani baanyu na bahara baanyu. <verse eid="LEV 26:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LEV 26:30" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26:30: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 34:3">2 Bus 34:3</ref>. </char></note> Kandi ndyacwekyereza emyanya yaanyu mikuru ey'okuramizamu, nteme ebyoterero byanyu by'obubaane, mbiiheho, nnagye emitumbi yaanyu aha mitumbi y'ebishushani byanyu; kandi omutima gwangye guryabatamirwa kimwe. <verse eid="LEV 26:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LEV 26:31" />Endembo zaanyu ndyazihindura amatongo, n'emyanya yaanyu erikwera ngihindure emishaka; tindihurira kutaamirana k'emigaju yaanyu. <verse eid="LEV 26:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LEV 26:32" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26:32: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 9:11">Yer 9:11</ref>. </char></note> Ndyahindura ensi yaanyu amatongo, kitangaaze abazigu baanyu abariba bagitwiremu. <verse eid="LEV 26:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LEV 26:33" />Ndyabataataanisiza omu mahanga, nsyoreyo rurara, ngibakuratse, ensi yaanyu eryaba amatongo, n'endembo zaanyu zibe emishaka.<verse eid="LEV 26:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LEV 26:34" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">26:34: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2CH 36:21">2 Bus 36:21</ref>. </char>
    </note> Obunaku bwona obu egyo nsi erimara eri amatongo, eryashemerererwa sabato zaayo, mukiri omu nsi y'abazigu; obwo nibwo ensi eriruhuuka, ekashemerererwa sabato zaayo. <verse eid="LEV 26:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LEV 26:35" />Obunaku bwona obu erimara eri amatongo, eryahuumura, okuhuumura oku etaratungiire mu sabato zaanyu mukigirimu. <verse eid="LEV 26:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LEV 26:36" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26:36: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 2:9-11">Yos 2:9-11</ref>; <ref loc="PRO 28:1">Enf 28:1</ref>. </char></note> Abariba baahonokireho omuriimwe, ndyabahahaariza emitima omu nsi y'abazigu baabo; baryakangwa ekibabi ekirikuhuuhwa omuyaga, bahungye, nk'oku omuntu ahunga rurara; bagwe hataine obabingire. <verse eid="LEV 26:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LEV 26:37" />Baryagwa nibaribatiirirana, nk'abarikuhunga rurara, haza hataine obabingire; timurigira garwanisa bazigu baanyu. <verse eid="LEV 26:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LEV 26:38" />Muryahwerekyererera omu mahanga; ensi y'abazigu baanyu ebamareho. <verse eid="LEV 26:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LEV 26:39" />Abariba baahonokireho omuriimwe baryahwererera omu nsi y'abazigu baanyu ahabw'okutahikiirira kwabo; kandi ahabw'okutahikiirira kwa baishenkurubo, baryahwerera nkabo.<verse eid="LEV 26:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LEV 26:40" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">26:40: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1KI 8:33">1 Bag 8:33</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 15:18">Luk 15:18</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kwonka ku baryatura okutahikiirira kwabo n'okwa baishenkurubo omu kucumura oku bancumwireho, bakaikiriza emitwarize yaabo ku etaraikirizaine n'eyangye, <verse eid="LEV 26:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LEV 26:41" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26:41: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 2:29">Rom 2:29</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 12:6">2 Bus 12:6</ref>. </char></note> ku nikyo kyandeeteire kutwaza okwangye nkabarwanisa, nkabareeta omu nsi y'abazigu baabo; omu bunaku obwo emitima yaabo etashazirwe ku eryecureeza, baikiriza ekifubiro ky'okutahikiirira kwabo, <verse eid="LEV 26:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LEV 26:42" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26:42: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 16:60">Ezk 16:60</ref>. </char></note> naanye obwo ndyaijuka endagaano yaangye na Yakobo, n'ei naaragaine na Isaaka, kandi n'ei naaragaine na Abrahamu; n'egyo nsi ndyagiijuka. <verse eid="LEV 26:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LEV 26:43" />Kwonka ensi yaabo baryaba batagirimu, eshemerererwe sabato zaayo, omu bunaku bwona obu erimara eri amatongo batagirimu; baikirize ekifubiro ky'okutahikiirira kwabo, ahabw'okuba bakanga emigyenzo yangye ei naataireho, n'emitima yaabo yaayangira kimwe ebiragiro byangye. <verse eid="LEV 26:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LEV 26:44" />Kwonka n'obu kiriba kiri kityo, ku bariba bari omu nsi y'abazigu baabo, tindibanaga, kandi tindibangira kimwe kubacwekyereza nkabamaraho, nkaita endagaano yangye nabo; ahakuba ndi MUKAMA Ruhanga waabo; <verse eid="LEV 26:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LEV 26:45" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26:45: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 11:28">Rom 11:28</ref>. </char></note> kureka ahabwabo ndyaijuka endagaano ei naaragaine na baishenkurubo, abu naihire omu nsi ya Misri omu maisho g'amahanga, kuba Ruhanga waabo. Niinye MUKAMA. <verse eid="LEV 26:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LEV 26:46" />Ebyo nibyo biragiro ebyatairweho n'emigyenzo n'ebindi biragiro ebi MUKAMA yaataire ahagati ye n'Abaisraeli, naabigambira aha rushozi Sinai, naaraba omuri Musa.<verse eid="LEV 26:46" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LEV 26" />
  <chapter number="27" style="c" sid="LEV 27" />
  <para style="s1">Ebiragiro by'eby'okuraganisa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LEV 27:1" />MUKAMA yaagira Musa ati: <verse eid="LEV 27:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LEV 27:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">27:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 6:2">Kub 6:2</ref>; <ref loc="JOB 22:27">Yob 22:27</ref>. </char></note> Gambira Abaisraeli ebigambo ebi. Omuntu ku ariraganisa kuhongyera MUKAMA empongano y'omutaano yaahonga abantu, abo bantu baryaba aba MUKAMA nk'oku oribabariirira; <verse eid="LEV 27:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LEV 27:3" />obariirire omushaija okuruga aha myaka makumi abiri okuhika ahari makumi mukaaga, omucwe shekeli z'efeeza makumi ataano, nka shekeli ey'Omwanya ogurikwera oku eri. <verse eid="LEV 27:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LEV 27:4" />Ku ariba ari omukazi, omucwe shekeli makumi ashatu. <verse eid="LEV 27:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LEV 27:5" />Ku ariba ari omwana ow'emyaka etaano okuhika ahari makumi abiri, yaaba ari omwojo omucwe shekeli makumi abiri; ku ariba ari omwishiki, omucwe ikumi. <verse eid="LEV 27:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LEV 27:6" />Ku ariba ari omwana muto ow'okwezi kumwe okuhika aha myaka etaano, yaaba ari omwojo omucwe shekeli z'efeeza itaano; ku ariba ari omwishiki, omucwe shekeli z'efeeza ishatu. <verse eid="LEV 27:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LEV 27:7" />Kandi ku ariba ahikize emyaka makumi mukaaga n'okukiraho, yaaba ari omushaija, omucwe shekeli ikumi na itaano; ku ariba ari omukazi omucwe shekeli ikumi. <verse eid="LEV 27:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LEV 27:8" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">27:8: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 21:1-4">Luk 21:1-4</ref>; <ref loc="2CO 8:12">2 Kor 8:12</ref>. </char></note> Kwonka kiraganisa ku ariba ari omworo, otarikubaasa kuha eki acwereirwe, aryareeta empongano aha munyamurwa, nawe amucwere; omunyamurwa amucwere nk'oku kiraganisa arikubaasa kuha. <verse eid="LEV 27:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LEV 27:9" />Eki yaaraganisa ku kiriba kiri enyamaishwa ey'omu nganda ezihongyerwa MUKAMA, yoona ey'omuri ezo nganda ei omuntu ahongyera MUKAMA, eryaba erikwera. <verse eid="LEV 27:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LEV 27:10" />Atarigira ekindi kyona eki yaaha omu mwanya gwayo, n'obu kwakuba okugihingisa, enungi omu mwanya gw'embi, nari embi omu mwanya gw'enungi; ku arigihingisa enyamaishwa ngyenzi yaayo, ei araganiise, n'ei yaagihinga, zombi ziryaba ezirikwera. <verse eid="LEV 27:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LEV 27:11" />Ku ariba araganiise enyamaishwa erikuzira, etari y'omu nganda ezihongyerwa MUKAMA, kiraganisa agitwarire omunyamurwa; <verse eid="LEV 27:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LEV 27:12" />omunyamurwa agicwere obuguzi nk'oburungi nari obubi bwayo oku buri; nk'oku iwe omunyamurwa origicwera, obuguzi bwayo nikwo buriba. <verse eid="LEV 27:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LEV 27:13" />Kwonka kiraganisa ku aryenda kugicungura, ayongyere aha buguzi obu ecwereirwe ekicweka kimwe kya kataano.<verse eid="LEV 27:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LEV 27:14" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">27:14: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LEV 25:29-31">Lev 25:29-31</ref>. </char>
    </note> Omuntu ku arihayo enju ye kuba eyereziibwe MUKAMA, omunyamurwa agicwere obuguzi nk'oburungi bwayo nari obubi bwayo oku buri; nk'oku omunyamurwa arigicwera, obuguzi bwayo nikwo buriba. <verse eid="LEV 27:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LEV 27:15" />Kandi ogihaireyo ku aryenda kugyecungurira, ayongyereho ekicweka kimwe kya kataano eky'obuguzi obu ecwereirwe, ebone kuba eye. <verse eid="LEV 27:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LEV 27:16" />Omuntu ku arihayo ahari MUKAMA ekicweka ky'eitaka ery'omu butaka bwe, oricwere obuguzi noihirira aha bwingi bw'embibo za sayiri ezishemereire kuhingwamu; homeri y'embibo za sayiri ecwerwe shekeli z'efeeza makumi ataano. <verse eid="LEV 27:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LEV 27:17" />Ku arihayo omusiri gwe ahari MUKAMA, atandikire aha mwaka gwa jubili, obuguzi bw'omusiri ogwo buryaba nk'oku ogucwereire. <verse eid="LEV 27:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LEV 27:18" />Kwonka ku ariguhayo bwanyima ya jubili, omunyamurwa abariirire obuguzi bwagwo, naihirira aha myaka eriba etsigaireyo okuhitsya aha gundi mwaka gwa jubili; bacwe aha buguzi bwagwo nk'oku oribariirira. <verse eid="LEV 27:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LEV 27:19" />Kandi oriba ahaireyo omusiri ku aryenda kugwecungurira, ayongyereho ekicweka kimwe kya kataano eky'obuguzi obu ogucwereire, gubone kuba ogwe buzima. <verse eid="LEV 27:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LEV 27:20" />Kwonka ku ariba atarikwenda kwecungurira ogwo musiri, nari ku ariba yaagugurize ondiijo, guryaba gutakicungurwa bundi. <verse eid="LEV 27:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LEV 27:21" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">27:21: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 18:14">Kub 18:14</ref>. </char></note> Kwonka ogwo musiri ku gurirekurwa omu mwaka gwa jubili, guryaguma guri ogwereziibwe MUKAMA, nk'omusiri oguhairweyo; kandi omunyamurwa abe niwe yaagutwara.<verse eid="LEV 27:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LEV 27:22" />Omuntu ku arihayo omusiri ogu yaaguzire ogutari gw'omu butaka bwe, <verse eid="LEV 27:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LEV 27:23" />omunyamurwa abariirire obuguzi bwagwo okuhitsya aha mwaka gwa jubili; omuntu ogwo ahe obuguzi obu gucwereirwe aha izooba eryo, gube ekintu ekyereziibwe MUKAMA. <verse eid="LEV 27:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LEV 27:24" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">27:24: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 25:28">Lev 25:28</ref>. </char></note> Omu mwaka gwa jubili omusiri ogwo guryagarukira ou baaguguzireho, ou gwashangirwe guri omu butaka bwe obw'empungurirano. <verse eid="LEV 27:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LEV 27:25" />Obuguzi bwona obu oricwa buryabarwa omuri shekeli ez'Omwanya ogurikwera; kandi shekeli emwe neingana geera makumi abiri.<verse eid="LEV 27:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LEV 27:26" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">27:26: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="DEU 15:19">Bir 15:19</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kwonka emijigaijo y'enyamaishwa, eshangwa eba eya MUKAMA, ahakuba n'emijigaijo, hatarigira omuntu owaagihayo; yaaba nte, yaaba ntaama, n'eya MUKAMA. <verse eid="LEV 27:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LEV 27:27" />Ku guriba guri ogw'enyamaishwa erikuzira, agucunguze obuguzi obu oricwa, ayongyereho ekicweka kyabwo kimwe kya kataano; nari ku eriba etacungwirwe, etundwe nk'obuguzi bwayo obu oricwa oku buri. <verse eid="LEV 27:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LEV 27:28" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">27:28: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JDG 11:30">Bar 11:30</ref>, <ref loc="JDG 11:31">31</ref>.</char></note> Kwonka tihariho kintu ekihairweyo kyona eki omuntu arihayo ahari MUKAMA, ahari byona ebi aine, yaaba muntu, nari enyamaishwa, nari ekibanja kye ky'empungurirano, ekiritundwa, nari ekiricungurwa; ekintu kyona ekihairweyo n'ekyeziibwe munonga ahabwa MUKAMA. <verse eid="LEV 27:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LEV 27:29" />Hatarigira omuntu weena ohairweyo ahabw'okucwerwa abantu orubanja rw'okufa, owaacungurwa, kureka aitwe.<verse eid="LEV 27:29" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ebiragiro by'ekicweka kimwe kya ikumi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="LEV 27:30" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">27:30: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="GEN 28:22">Kut 28:22</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 31:5">2 Bus 31:5</ref>. </char>
    </note> Aha bimezire omu itaka, yaaba myaka y'omu misiri, nari ebijuma by'emiti, ekicweka kimwe kya ikumi kyona ekyabyo n'ekya MUKAMA; n'ebyereziibwe MUKAMA. <verse eid="LEV 27:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LEV 27:31" />Omuntu ku aryenda kugira eki yaacungura omuri ebyo bicweka bya ikumi, ayongyereho ekicweka kimwe kya kataano ky'obuguzi bwabyo. <verse eid="LEV 27:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LEV 27:32" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">27:32: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 33:13">Yer 33:13</ref>. </char></note> Ekicweka kimwe kya ikumi ky'amasyo g'ente nari ag'entaama, buri nyamaishwa ya ikumi ahari ezo eziriba niziraba ahansi y'enkoni y'omuriisa, eryaba eyereziibwe MUKAMA. <verse eid="LEV 27:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LEV 27:33" />Omuntu ataryetegyereza kureeba yaaba eri nungi nari mbi, kandi atarigihingisa; kwonka ku arigihingisa, eyaahingwa n'eyaahingisibwa, zombi ziryaba ezirikwera; zitaricungurwa.<verse eid="LEV 27:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LEV 27:34" />Ebyo nibyo biragiro ebi MUKAMA yaaragiriire Musa aha rushozi Sinai kubigambira Abaisraeli.<verse eid="LEV 27:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LEV 27" />
</usx>